ef-6f631e537119","name":"Kirkegaard, Hans","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Feldbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fb25b9f-381b-44a6-a8dd-26eacf839d37","name":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","orcid":"0000-0001-5339-171X","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40499675"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.resuscitation.2025.110672","issn":["03009572","18731570"],"issn_org":["03009572"],"journal":"Resuscitation","pages":"110672","paperid":"110672","publisher":"Elsevier Ireland Ltd","status":"e","title":"Resuscitation"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105008964182"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["E-Published (ahead of print)"]},"sid":["aau-774e2aac-a6c5-4c01-81ce-e3ca1d5b84ef","au-947b23a3-0d1b-4e57-893e-d3217a18f8f6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Long-term functional outcome and quality of life 5-8 years after out of hospital cardiac arrest","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-822359","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"CONTEXT: Clinical studies of psychiatric morbidity in patients with congenital adrenal hyperplasia (CAH) imply impaired mental health. OBJECTIVE: To delineate psychiatric morbidity in a national CAH cohort by using complete data on psychiatric diagnoses from all Danish hospitals between 1977-2018 and on all psychiatric medication prescribed between 1995-2018. DESIGN: A registry-based cohort study. SETTING: A public uniform healthcare system. PATIENTS AND CONTROLS: Four-hundred-forty-eight patients (females: n=215) with CAH, hereof 410 with 21-hydroxylase deficiency (21-OHD) (females: n=255) and 44,527 age- and sex-matched general population controls. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES: Diagnoses were analyzed by negative binomial regression yielding incidence rate ratios (IRR). Medication were analyzed by Cox regression yielding hazard ratios (HR). RESULTS: 21-OHD was associated with an increased risk of any psychiatric diagnosis; females: IRR=2.32 (confidence interval (CI) (1.48-3.64), males: IRR=2.74 (CI 1.31-5.71) as well as of medication related to psychiatric disorders; females: HR=1.74 (CI 1.42-2.13), males: HR=1.74 (CI1.30-2.33). Both females and males with 21-OHD had a significantly increased risk of alcohol use, stress- and adjustment disorders, and of suicidal behavior. For patients with more rare forms of CAH (n=24), the risk of any psychiatric diagnosis was significantly increased for males, IRR=12.85 (CI 1.78-92.87), but not for females, IRR=0.54 (CI 0.10-3.00). The risk of being prescribed psychiatric medication was not increased for neither females, HR=1.05 (CI 0.39-2.84), or males, HR=0.72 (CI 0.10-5.13), with rare forms of CAH. CONCLUSION: 21-OHD is associated with a significantly increased psychiatric morbidity. This study underlines a need for awareness of mental health in patients with 21-OHD.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Lind-Holst, Marie","Hansen, Dorte","Main, Katharina Maria","Juul, Anders","Andersen, Marianne Skovsager","Dunø, Morten","Rasmussen, Åse Krogh","Jørgensen, Niels","Gravholt, Claus Højbjerg","Berglund, Agnethe"],"cuid":["S03-099.70-813582"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Berglund, Agnethe"],"keyword":["Congenital adrenal hyperplasia","Population based","Psychiatry"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"delineating the psychiatric morbidity spectrum in congenital adrenal hyperplasia a population based registry study","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105010933605","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-099.70-813582","identifier":[{"id":"105010933605","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39545512","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-2dc73bc2-9df4-443e-a6cc-e3588af14662","ku-2e4f9ae6-d328-470d-a217-63294e6f3848","sdu-595f8833-381f-45f8-a576-d69587e11964"],"keyword":["congenital adrenal hyperplasia","population-based","psychiatry"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-AA7CFA40AAA272D6796239854C08D9E1"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Paediatrics (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Paediatrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Molecular Medicine (MOMA)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie","key":"lindholstpau","last":"Lind-Holst","locid":"edd5bfca-e07d-4bbc-ae9a-f6f5e060f15a","name":"Lind-Holst, Marie","orcid":"0000-0003-2585-8102","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorte","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"20f8509d-8af4-4a9b-81d6-d51820e52835","name":"Hansen, Dorte","orcid":"0000-0002-6598-9740","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","first":"Katharina Maria","key":"mainpau","last":"Main","locid":"1770eebd-1659-4088-b44c-c9de22a4bb0b","name":"Main, Katharina M.","name_org":"Main, Katharina Maria","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","first":"Anders","key":"juulpau","last":"Juul","locid":"f9b11983-c7c8-4111-b119-4de471572898","name":"Juul, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-0534-4350","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne Skovsager","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"94aa4e0a-b026-469f-a635-4bad008d49d7","name":"Andersen, Marianne","name_org":"Andersen, Marianne Skovsager","orcid":"0000-0002-4603-9504","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"dunøpau","last":"Dunø","name":"Dunø, Morten","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Åse Krogh","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Åse Krogh","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Niels","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Claus Højbjerg","key":"gravholtpau","last":"Gravholt","locid":"22ab3957-d834-426e-8ba5-3d45496b0d2a","name":"Gravholt, Claus Højbjerg","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 6","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Agnethe","key":"berglundpau","last":"Berglund","locid":"cc80d6a6-1b9c-49d4-b13f-c54df4e041d2","name":"Berglund, Agnethe","orcid":"0000-0001-9185-1342","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["39545512"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1210/clinem/dgae780","issn":["0021972X","19457197"],"issn_org":["0021972X"],"issue":"8","journal":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","pages":"2147-2156","publisher":"Endocrine Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","title_org":"The Journal of clinical endocrinology and metabolism","volume":"110"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105010933605"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-2dc73bc2-9df4-443e-a6cc-e3588af14662","ku-2e4f9ae6-d328-470d-a217-63294e6f3848","sdu-595f8833-381f-45f8-a576-d69587e11964"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Delineating the psychiatric morbidity spectrum in congenital adrenal hyperplasia : a population-based registry study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.70-813582","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"In-stent restenosis (ISR) still occurs after percutaneous coronary intervention (PCI). Few studies have compared the outcomes of PCI for de novo stenosis with those of PCI for ISR, and the results are conflicting. The present study aimed to conduct this comparison. Using patient-level data from the randomized all-comer SORT OUT studies III to X, we included all patients with previous PCI and either an ISR or a de novo lesion as the study target lesion. Outcomes of interest were major adverse cardiac events (MACE) and target lesion revascularization (TLR) after 5 years. Of the 2,928 patients with a previous PCI included in the SORT OUT studies, 491 (17%) were treated for ISR and 2,437 (83%) for a de novo stenosis. Baseline characteristics did not differ significantly. At 5 years, MACE occurred in 148 patients (32%) in the ISR group and 654 patients (28%) in the de novo stenosis group (crude and adjusted hazard ratio 1.16 [95% confidence interval (CI) 0.97 to 1.38] and 1.16 [95% CI 0.97 to 1.38]). The risk of TLR was higher in the ISR group compared with the de novo stenosis group (crude and adjusted hazard ratio 1.64 [95% CI 1.24 to 2.17] and 1.71 [95% CI 1.27 to 2.30]). In conclusion, the risk of MACE was similar between PCI for ISR and PCI for de novo lesions after 5 years. However, the risk of TLR was higher in the ISR group compared with the de novo stenosis group.","author_count":28,"contributors":["Jakobsen, Lars","Christiansen, Evald H.","Freeman, Phillip","Kahlert, Johnny","Veien, Karsten","Maeng, Michael","Ellert, Julia","Kristensen, Steen D.","Christensen, Martin Kirk","Terkelsen, Christian J","Thim, Troels","Lassen, Jens Flensted","Hougaard, Mikkel","Eftekhari, Ashkan","Jensen, Rebekka V.","Støttrup, Nicolaj B","Rasmussen, Jeppe Grøndahl","Junker, Anders","Jensen, Lisette O."],"cuid":["S03-100.00-784770"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Jakobsen, Lars"],"keyword":["In stent restenosis","Major adverse cardiac events","Percutaneous Coronary Intervention","target lesion revascularization"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of outcome after percutaneous coronary intervention for de novo and in stent restenosis indications","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.amjcard.2024.10.019","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-784770","identifier":[{"id":"85208463684","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39461401","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-171ff0f6-4698-4833-a3a5-de806ba4b4c1","au-d8e16af8-3411-4470-a610-6e0494713e6d","sdu-7b9ab785-4cac-4e1b-9e93-878552bb8c35"],"keyword":["in-stent restenosis","major adverse cardiac events","percutaneous coronary intervention","target lesion revascularization"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-04CFB5256F19463550A4F00249658D30"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.amjcard.2024.10.019","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/277261139/1-s2.0-S0002914924007343-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/761499959/Jakobsen_et_al._2025_._Comparison_of_Outcome_After_Percutaneous_Coronary_Intervention_for_De_Novo_and_In-Stent_Restenosis_Indications.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus unive