University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-160e77a3-9396-40d5-97e3-465ff845ef7e","sdu-3af5aa47-4acc-4e5c-958c-f4f64378ea02"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Biolimus-Eluting Biomatrix Stent vs a Dual-Therapy Sirolimus-Eluting Stent in PCI : The SORT OUT XI Randomized Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.76-813552","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"AIM: To describe the use of invasive mechanical ventilation core strategies, adjuvant treatments and the occurrence of barotrauma and prolonged ventilation in ICU patients with COVID-19 in Denmark, retrospectively. METHODS: All ICUs admitting COVID-19 patients in Denmark from 10 March 2020 to 2 April 2021 were invited to participate. All patients with COVID-19 who received invasive mechanical ventilation were included and data was retrospectively collected from electronic patient records. RESULTS: A total of 774 patients were invasively ventilated during the first two waves and included; 70% were males and the median age was 69 years. 340 (51.5%) of patients never exceeded tidal volumes of 8 mL/kg. For all patients, tidal volumes under 8 mL/kg were applied in 77.6% (IQR 54.5%-96.2%) of the time on ventilator in the ICU; plateau pressure was below 30 cm H2O in 125 (80.6%) patients; prone positioning was used in 44.7% of patients. In ICU, 169 of 774 (21.8%) patients experienced barotrauma and 220 (28.4%) prolonged ventilation. At 90 days, 306 (39.5%) had died. CONCLUSIONS: Lung protective ventilation and prone positioning were used in many of the Danish ICU patients with COVID-19, but barotrauma, prolonged ventilation and death occurred frequently.","author_count":31,"contributors":["Nielsen, Martine S.","Halekoh, Ulrich","Perner, Anders","Haberlandt, Trine","Larsen, Nikolai Arnold-","Weihe, Sarah","Garcia, Ricardo S.","Siegel, Hanna","Hagdrup, Christian","Skøtt, Mads R.","Jensen, Anne-Mette S.","Frische, Jonathan B.","Wethelund, Kasper","Christiansen, Søren H.","Aagaard, Søren Rosborg","Højlund, Sofie","Westergaard, Bo","Christiansen, Aage","Michagin, George","Worm, Marie S.","Svendsen, Ann-Kristine M.","la Cour, Kirstine N.","Jonassen, Trine B.","Jensen, Jens U.","Sørensen, Kasper M.","Haase, Nicolai","Rasmussen, Bodil Steen","Brøchner, Anne C."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-792978"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Brøchner, Anne C."],"keyword":["Adverse events","Aged","Aged 80 and over","COVID 19 therapy","Covid 19","Critical Care methods","Denmark epidemiology","Female","Humans","Intensive Care Units","Male","Mechanical ventilation","Middle Aged","Prone Position","Respiration Artificial","Retrospective Studies","Tidal Volume","barotrauma","core strategies"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"invasive mechanical ventilation strategies adjuvants treatments and adverse events among icu patients with covid 000000000019 in denmark","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85214083314&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-792978","identifier":[{"id":"85214083314","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39749940","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-a02894a7-caca-4762-84a4-805e881258a5","au-e061b348-927a-4073-817b-76be9824677d"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Barotrauma/etiology","COVID-19","COVID-19/therapy","Critical Care/methods","Denmark/epidemiology","Female","Humans","Intensive Care Units","Male","Middle Aged","Prone Position","Respiration, Artificial","Retrospective Studies","Tidal Volume","adverse events","barotrauma","core strategies","mechanical ventilation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-012B02B80A1B6E4440CB063E70608200"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR",