{"abstract":"I dette kapitel får du viden om ledighed og udsathed på arbejdsmarkedet. Vi introducerer kort til udviklingen i ledighed og retter derefter fokus mod individuelle og strukturelle faktorer, der har betydning for at blive inkluderet på det ordinære arbejdsmarked. Du får dernæst præsenteret en række teorier og begreber, der gør, at du forstår udsathed i et arbejdsmarkedsperspektiv.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Christensen, Anders Bøggild","Salado-Rasmussen, Julia"],"cuid":["S02-090.62-804401"],"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Socialt arbejde og sociale forhold"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum","soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ledighed i et historisk og teoretisk perspektiv","src":["kp","via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-090.62-804401","ids":["kp-2aa46f97-bb7b-413b-ac57-21f04d46888e","via-615f4dc0-9cb5-474d-aa2f-2f0f65005905"],"keyword":["Socialt arbejde og sociale forhold"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-AD2C80039FE94CF956545CB3343B6434"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for sundhed og samfund, Forsk.center for social udsathed","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for sundhed og samfund, Research Programme for Employment and Social Work","VIA, Uddannelser, Social- og samfundsuddannelserne, Socialrådgiveruddannelsen Aarhus C team A-B-C"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for pædagogiske og samfundsfaglige uddannelser-Dekan, Socialrådgiveruddannelsen Forskning og Udvikling","Socialt Arbejde - Institut for Socialrådgiveruddannelse, Beskæftigelse","Socialt Arbejde - Institut for Socialrådgiveruddannelse, Udsatte voksne"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Bøggild","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"15d3eb85-8ffe-4c32-b970-43d444374d12","name":"Christensen, Anders Bøggild","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Julia","key":"saladorasmussenpau","last":"Salado-Rasmussen","locid":"545adcc2-0b84-48c1-9a92-3f1eb78bafac","name":"Salado-Rasmussen, Julia","orcid":"0000-0003-1372-1782","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Inge Storgaard","key":"bonfilspedh","last":"Bonfils","name":"Bonfils, Inge Storgaard","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Julia","key":"saladorasmussenpedh","last":"Salado-Rasmussen","name":"Salado-Rasmussen, Julia","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788750063728"],"pages":"53-77","place":"København","publisher":"Akademisk Forlag","series":"Professions serien","status":"p","subtitle":"ved brug af Supported Employment og Individuelt Planlagt job med Støtte","title":"Arbejdsinkludering"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-2aa46f97-bb7b-413b-ac57-21f04d46888e","via-615f4dc0-9cb5-474d-aa2f-2f0f65005905"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","VIA University College"],"title":"Ledighed i et historisk og teoretisk perspektiv","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-090.62-804401","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Climate change, landscape homogenization, and the decline of beneficial insects threaten pollination services to wild plants and crops. Understanding how pollination potential (i.e. the capacity of ecosystems to support pollination of plants) is affected by climate change and landscape homogenization is fundamental for our ability to predict how such anthropogenic stressors affect plant biodiversity. Models of pollinator potential are improved when based on pairwise plant–pollinator interactions and pollinator's plant preferences. However, whether the sum of predicted pairwise interactions with a plant within a habitat (a proxy for pollination potential) relates to pollen deposition on flowering plants has not yet been investigated. We sampled plant–bee interactions in 68 Scandinavian plant communities in landscapes of varying land-cover heterogeneity along a latitudinal temperature gradient of 4–8°C, and estimated pollen deposition as the number of pollen grains on flowers of the bee-pollinated plants Lotus corniculatus and Vicia cracca. We show that plant–bee interactions, and the pollination potential for these bee-pollinated plants increase with landscape diversity, annual mean temperature, and plant abundance, and decrease with distances to sand-dominated soils. Furthermore, the pollen deposition in flowers increased with the predicted pollination potential, which was driven by landscape diversity and plant abundance. Our study illustrates that the pollination potential, and thus pollen deposition, for wild plants can be mapped based on spatial models of plant–bee interactions that incorporate pollinator-specific plant preferences. Maps of pollination potential can be used to guide conservation and restoration planning.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Sydenham, Markus Arne Kjær","Dupont, Yoko Luise","Nielsen, Anders","Olesen, Jens M.","Bang Madsen, Henning","Skrindo, Astrid B.","Rasmussen, Claus","S. Nowell, Megan","Venter, Zander S.","Hegland, Stein Joar","G. Helle, Anders","Skoog, Daniel I. J.","Torvanger, Marianne S.","Hanevik, Kaj-Andreas","Hinderaker, Sven Emil","Paulsen, Thorstein","Eldegard, Katrine","Reitan, Trond","Rusch, Graciela"],"cuid":["S02-098.18-756064"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Sydenham, Markus Arne Kjær"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Norwegian Institute for Nature Research","Norwegian Institute of Bioeconomy Research","Norwegian University of Life Sciences","University of Oslo","Western Norway University of Applied Sciences"],"keyword":["Ecological networks","Landscape diversity","Plant pollinator interactions","Pollination","ecosystem service mapping"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"climatic conditions and landscape diversity predict plant bee interactions and pollen deposition in bee pollinated plants","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/ecog.07138","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-098.18-756064","identifier":[{"id":"85197245889","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-a0494f57-17e9-4728-937f-e36f532b5014","ku-6d2c2d0c-59e7-462d-af85-f95a4f07655d"],"keyword":["ecological networks","ecosystem service mapping","landscape diversity","plant–pollinator interactions","pollination"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A1DC62DED2C1DF078EE8A3C0D53FBA6E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/403267756/Ecography_2024_Sydenham_Climatic_conditions_and_landscape_diversity_predict_plant_bee_interactions_and_pollen.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/ecog.07138","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"no","key":"norwegian institute for nature research","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Norwegian Institute for Nature Research","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Terrestrial Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"norwegian institute of bioeconomy research","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Norwegian Institute of Bioeconomy Research","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Biology, Ecology and Evolution"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"no","key":"western norway university of applied sciences","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Western Norway University of Applied Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"no","key":"norwegian university of life sciences","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Norwegian University of Life Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Markus Arne Kjær","key":"sydenhampau","last":"Sydenham","name":"S