{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Bang, Peter Fibiger","Rasmussen, Anders Holm","Thomsen, Christian Ammitzbøll"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-776795"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faculty of Humanities","civic life"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"between athens and rhodes a c o l l e c t i o n o f s t u d i e s i n h o n o u r o f vi n c e n t g a b r i e l s e n o n f l e e t s o f f i c e s a s s o c i a t i o n s a n d t h e e c o n o m y o f t h e a n c i e n t gr e e k w o r l d","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-776795","ids":["ku-01b742e9-5ca9-495f-b5cd-f75d9a6bbf65"],"keyword":["Faculty of Humanities","ancient economic history","civic life","the Hellenistic world"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-59250F6760ECF374F091523D5E062AD9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, SAXO-Institute - Archaeology, Ethnology, Greek & Latin, History","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, SAXO-Institute - Archaeology, Ethnology, Greek & Latin, History, Universal Empire","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Asian Dynamics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["National Museum of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Peter Fibiger","key":"bangped","last":"Bang","locid":"7c1e898b-c294-4049-925e-df0ac962e515","name":"Bang, Peter Fibiger","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anders Holm","key":"rasmussenped","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"0382398f-ba6a-4367-a3e8-a54da1aa6fd8","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Holm","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christian Ammitzbøll","key":"thomsenped","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Christian Ammitzbøll","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"issn":["01065815"],"issue":"2","pages":"207","place":"København","series":"Classica & Mediaevalia Supplementum","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-01b742e9-5ca9-495f-b5cd-f75d9a6bbf65"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"BETWEEN ATHENS AND RHODES : – a c o l l e c t i o n o f s t u d i e s i n h o n o u r o f Vi n c e n t G a b r i e l s e n o n f l e e t s , o f f i c e s , a s s o c i a t i o n s a n d t h e e c o n o m y o f t h e a n c i e n t Gr e e k w o r l d","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-776795","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Both adherence rates to pulmonary rehabilitation (PR) programmes and long-term attendance in exercise training after PR remain a challenge. In our previous randomised controlled trial (RCT), effects were positively associated with a dose-response pattern, regardless of whether PR contained conventional physical exercise training (PExT) or Singing for Lung Health (SLH) as a training modality within a 10 weeks' PR programme for chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). However, long-term status of this RCT cohort remains unknown. In this study, we investigated whether current status (=attendance in supervised exercise training or a lung choir and scoring in quality of life (QoL)) was related to initial PR completion, randomisation, or adherence. METHODS: We collected data via telephone, using a researcher-developed questionnaire on current self-reported attendance in supervised exercise training or a lung choir and on perceived benefits of the initial RCT intervention. Additionally, we used COPD-validated questionnaires (primarily: QoL (measure: St George's Respiratory Questionnaire; SGRQ). RESULTS: In 2023 (i.e., mean/median 4.7 years after initial PR), surviving participants were contacted ( n  = 196; 73% of 270), and 160 (82% of 196) were included. Out of the included participants, 30 (19%) had not completed initial PR. Compared to the initial PR-completers, non-completers reported less current attendance in exercise training or lung choir (24% vs. 46%, p  = 0.03) but SGRQ scores were comparable. Yet, those who attended exercise training or lung choir at present ( n  = 66/160; 41% out of 160) reported better QoL score than those with no current attendance (SGRQ; Attending: 39.9 ± 15.4; Not attending: 43.1 ± 16.7; p  = 0.02). Neither having had SLH instead of PExT, nor adherence level during initial PR, was related to current attendance or to QoL scores. CONCLUSION: This study indicates that long-term self-reported attendance and current QoL scores are positively related to initial completion of a PR programme. Surprisingly, neither initial PR content (PExT or SLH) nor initial PR adherence was related to long-term outcomes. We suggest that future PR programmes include special attention to those who do not complete PR to support long-term attendance and QoL status.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Kaasgaard, Mette","Bodtger, Uffe","Skou, Søren Thorgaard","Clift, Stephen","Hilberg, Ole","Rasmussen, Daniel Bech","Løkke, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-783358"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Kaasgaard, Mette"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Canterbury Christ Church University","York St John University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long term self reported attendance in exercise training or lung choir and status of quality of life following initial pulmonary rehabilitation for copd","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fresc.2024.1447765","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-783358","identifier":[{"id":"39363990","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC11446877","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85205781888","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-82e415b4-3b3b-49e2-a45a-514e5cf102d9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EC4E1C651C62E6C46FEDF6A2C850B0F3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fresc.2024.1447765","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/276255222/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Zealand University Hospital, Research Unit of Respiratory Medicine (Roskilde)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"canterbury christ church university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Canterbury Christ Church University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"york st john university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"York St John University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"kaasgaardpau","last":"Kaasgaard","locid":"2b472c7a-7c51-482b-9155-59dea1d8ae37","name":"Kaasgaard, Mette","orcid":"0000-0003-3833-2943","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Uffe","key":"bodtgerpau","last":"Bodtger","locid":"2f4e70da-63bb-4b8d-af09-2a959d6df5e8","name":"Bodtger, Uffe","orcid":"0000-0002-1231-9209","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Thorgaard","key":"skoupau","last":"Skou","locid":"656a59cf-32bc-4190-b072-4adf47d954c1","name":"Skou, Søren Thorgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-4336-7059","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Stephen","key":"cliftpau","last":"Clift","name":"Clift, Stephen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"hilbergpau","last":"Hilberg","locid":"6c545c65-1d94-45a3-a8b4-f90eae06d248","name":"Hilberg, Ole","orcid":"0000-0002-3075-3463","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"firs