e39-ab1d-d32b13b020ba"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Blood clot resolution using active fluid exchange in the treatment of intraventricular hemorrhage","type":"Preprint","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-706591","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Krista Stinne Greve"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-708868"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"grundtvigs værker midtvejsstatus","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-708868","ids":["au-ab14838f-a004-4e6a-91a1-591fdf2062d1"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F57E24D47D0715614C5BBF921D496E40"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Center for Grundtvig Studies, Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Krista Stinne Greve","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"abf85233-847b-4977-8faa-222fdc0ca0c5","name":"Rasmussen, Krista Stinne Greve","orcid":"0000-0003-3424-2334","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders","key":"holmpedh","last":"Holm","name":"Holm, Anders","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mark Bradshaw","key":"busbeepedh","last":"Busbee","name":"Busbee, Mark Bradshaw","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sune","key":"aukenpedh","last":"Auken","name":"Auken, Sune","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788788243291"],"issn":["01074164"],"pages":"181-215","publisher":"Grundtvig-Selskabet af 8. september 1947","series":"Grundtvig-Studier","status":"p","title":"Grundtvig Studier 2022-2023"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ab14838f-a004-4e6a-91a1-591fdf2062d1"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Grundtvigs Værker : midtvejsstatus","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-708868","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"The recent deuterium-tritium campaign in JET-ILW (DTE2) has provided a unique opportunity to study the isotope dependence of the L-H power threshold in an ITER-like wall environment (Be wall and W divertor). Here we present results from dedicated L-H transition experiments at JET-ILW, documenting the power threshold in tritium and deuterium-tritium plasmas, comparing them with the matching deuterium and hydrogen datasets. From earlier experiments in JET-ILW it is known that as plasma isotopic composition changes from deuterium, through varying deuterium/hydrogen concentrations, to pure hydrogen, the value of the line averaged density at which the threshold is minimum, n̄e,min, increases, leading us to expect that n̄e,min(T) < n̄e,min(DT) < n̄e,min(D) < n̄e,min(H). The new power threshold data confirms these expectations in most cases, with the corresponding ordering of the minimum power thresholds. We present a comparison of this data to power threshold scalings, used for extrapolation to future devices such as ITER and DEMO.","author_count":86,"contributors":["Solano, E.","Birkenmeier, G.","Silva, C.","Delabie, E.","Hillesheim, J.","Baciero, A.","Balboa, I.","Baruzzo, M.","Boboc, A.","Brix, M.","Bernardo, J.","Bourdelle, C.","Carvalho, I.","Carvalho, P.","Challis, C.","Chernyshova, M.","Chomiczewska, A.","Coelho, R.","Coffey, I.","Craciunescu, T.","de la Cal, E.","de la Luna, E.","Dumont, R.","Dumortier, P.","Fontana, M.","Fontdecaba, J.","Frassinetti, L.","Gallart, D.","Garcia, J.","Giroud, C.","Gromelski, W.","Henriques, R.","Hall, J.","Ho, A.","Horton, L.D.","Horvath, L.","Jacquet, P.","Jepu, I.","Joffrin, E.","Kappatou, A.","Keeling, D.","King, D.","Kiptily, V.","Kirov, K.","Kos, D.","Kowalska-Strzęciwilk, E.","Lennholm, M.","Lerche, E.","Litherland-Smith, E.","Loarte, A.","Lomanowski, B.","Lomas, P.J.","Maggi, C.F.","Mailloux, J.","Mantsinen, M.J.","Maslov, M.","Meigs, A.G.","Monakhov, I.","Morales, R.B.","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Nina, D.","Noble, C.","Pawelec, E.","Poradzinski, M.","Pucella, Gianluca","Puglia, P.","Réfy, D.","Rasmussen, Jens Juul","Righi, E.","Rimini, F.G.","Robinson, T.","Sertoli, M.","Silburn, S. A.","Sips, G.","Sirén, P.","Štancar, Žiga","Sun, H. J.","Szepesi, G.","Taylor, D.","Tholerus, E.","Thomas, Beth","Verdoolaege, G.","Vincenzi, P.","Viola, Bruno","Vianello, N","Wilson, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-710640"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corpau":["JET Contributors"],"corresponding_author":["Solano, E."],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","Hungary","Italy","Netherlands","Poland","Portugal","Romania","Spain","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Barcelona Supercomputing Center","CIEMAT","Centre for Energy Research","Commissariat à l’énergie atomique et aux énergies alternatives","Consorzio RFX","Dutch Institute for Fundamental Energy Research","Euratom-ENEA-CNR Association","European Commission","Ghent University","ICREA","ITER","Institute of Plasma Physics and Laser Microfusion","KTH Royal Institute of Technology","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics","National Institute for Laser, Plasma and Radiation Physics","Oak Ridge National Laboratory","Queen's University Belfast","Royal Military Academy","Technical University of Munich","United Kingdom Atomic Energy Authority","University of Lisbon","University of Opole","University of Padua"],"keyword":["DT","Isotope","JET ILW","L H transition","Power threshold","Tokamaks","Tritium"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"l h transition studies in tritium and deuterium tritium campaigns at jet with be wall and w divertor","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type