{"abstract":"Platform trials focus on the perpetual testing of many interventions in a disease or a setting. These trials have lasting organizational, administrative, data, analytic, and operational frameworks making them highly efficient. The use of adaptation often increases the probabilities of allocating participants to better interventions and obtaining conclusive results. The COVID-19 pandemic showed the potential of platform trials as a fast and valid way to improved treatments. This review gives an overview of key concepts and elements using the Intensive Care Platform Trial (INCEPT) as an example.","author_count":22,"contributors":["Perner, Anders","Kjær, Maj Brit Nørregaard","Thorsen-Meyer, Hans-Christian","Kaas-Hansen, Benjamin Skov","Munch, Marie Warrer","Collet, Marie Oxenbøll","Bruun, Camilla Rl","Jensen, Aksel Karl Georg","Lange, Theis","Albertsen, Trine","Pedersen, Claus Duedal","Poulsen, Lone M.","Mathiesen, Ole","Brøchner, Anne C.","Strøm, Thomas","Andersen, Lars W.","Christensen, Steffen","Rasmussen, Bodil S.","Schjørring, Olav L.","Maagaard, Mathias","Møller, Morten Hylander","Granholm, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-721115"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"OT":["Center for Kræft og Organsygdomme"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"platform trials platformsforsøg","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/375311794/V04230237_WEB.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-721115","identifier":[{"id":"85175661699","type":"scopus"},{"id":"37873986","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-90c012c9-7721-48f9-8862-7ab35689bf21"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-9-82DE3B2AEA7284BB596678032A1ACA8B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/platformsforsog","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/375311794/V04230237_WEB.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Anaesthesiology","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Center for Kræft og Organsygdomme"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Lillebaelt University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":