University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Sex-dimorphic neuroprotective effect of CD163 in an α-synuclein mouse model of Parkinson's disease","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.09-716129","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Target lesion failure (TLF) remains an issue with contemporary drug-eluting stents. The dual-therapy sirolimus-eluting and CD34 antibody-coated COMBO stent (DTS) was designed to improve early healing. AIMS: We aimed to compare the 3-year outcomes of the DTS and the sirolimus-eluting Orsiro stent (SES) in all-comer patients treated with percutaneous coronary intervention. METHODS: The SORT OUT X trial is a prospective multicentre randomised clinical trial with a registry-based follow-up comparing DTS and SES. The primary endpoint, TLF, is a composite of cardiac death, myocardial infarction or target lesion revascularisation (TLR). RESULTS: A total of 3,146 patients were randomised to treatment with the DTS (1,578 patients) or the SES (1,568 patients). At 3 years, an intention-to-treat analysis showed that 155 patients (9.8%) who were assigned the DTS and 118 patients (7.5%) who were assigned the SES met the primary endpoint (incidence rate ratio for TLF=1.33, 95% confidence interval: 1.04-1.70; p=0.02). This difference was caused by a significantly higher TLF rate in the DTS group compared to the SES group within the first year, which was mainly explained by a higher incidence of TLR in the DTS group compared to the SES group. Of note, the TLF rates were almost identical from 1 year to 3 years in both stent groups. CONCLUSIONS: At 3 years, the SES was superior to the DTS, mainly because the DTS was associated with an increased risk of TLF within the first year but not from 1 to 3 years. CLINICALTRIALS: gov: NCT03216733.","author_count":35,"contributors":["Jakobsen, Lars","Christiansen, Evald Høj","Freeman, Phillip","Kahlert, Johnny","Veien, Karsten","Maeng, Michael","Raungaard, Bent","Ellert, Julia","Villadsen, Anton B","Kristensen, Steen Dalby","Christensen, Martin K","Terkelsen, Christian Juhl","Aaroe, Jens","Thim, Troels","Lassen, Jens Flensted","Hougaard, Mikkel","Eftekhari, Ashkan","Jensen, Rebekka Vibjerg","Støttrup, Nicolaj Brejnholt","Rasmussen, Jeppe G","Junker, Anders","Jensen, Svend E","Hansen, Henrik S","Jensen, Lisette O"],"cuid":["S03-099.96-703873"],"filters":{"added":"2023-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Jakobsen, Lars"],"keyword":["Clinical trials","Drug eluting stent","no specific risk"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dual therapy cd000000000034 antibody covered sirolimus eluting combo stents versus sirolimus eluting orsiro stents in patients treated with percutaneous coronary intervention the three year outcomes of the sort out x randomised clinical trial","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10587840/pdf/EIJ-D-23-00330_Jakobsen.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The study is supported with equal unrestricted grants from BIOTRONIK, Bülach, Switzerland and OrbusNeich Medical, Fort Lauderdale, FL, USA."],"id":"S03-099.96-703873","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10587840","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85177073333","type":"scopus"},{"id":"37584207","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-e1157807-0ce0-478f-b1fb-36f90ee0c2c1","au-9b3b3801-646f-4b0b-8b2d-af5a6ec8b5ef","sdu-95315af2-02df-454a-9970-41f2f20dbe4c"],"keyword":["•clinical trials","•drug-eluting stent","•no specific risk"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-AFF68E7CDCC4727465B3D7F4058CB661"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10587840/pdf/EIJ-D-23-00330_Jak