{"abstract":"Erhvervsdidaktisk opslagsbog handler om, hvordan didaktisk teori og begreber kan forstås og anvendes i praksis på de uddannelser, der retter sig specifikt mod at uddanne til forskellige erhverv og brancher. I bogen findes opslag om klassiske og moderne erhvervsdidaktiske begreber såsom instruktion, multimodalitet, stilladsering og refleksion. Hvert opslag præsenterer begrebets teoretiske baggrund, dets betydning i en praksis og dets bidrag til professionel analyse, forberedelse eller evaluering af undervisning. Gennem et casebaseret format viser 58 opslag didaktiske begreber, som de kan “se ud” i praksis: Vi er med faglæreren i værkstedet, når hun giver feedback, med i dialogen, når lærerteams udvikler praksis, med, når undervisningen differentieres, og med, når lærere overvejer, hvordan undervisningen kan invitere til deltagelse og motivere elever og kursister.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders","Jensen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-648479"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Læring pædagogik og undervisning"],"level":"edu","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lærerroller","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://hansreitzel.dk/fag/paedagogik/paedagogik-alle-produkter/erhvervsdidaktisk-opslagsbog-bog-56026-9788702373929","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-648479","ids":["ucl-90530ffc-6fd3-458f-b66d-2cedf1facdfa"],"keyword":["Læring, pædagogik og undervisning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-883FBEDB8B2832784A8EF941312B5842"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Direktion, Kompetence- og Organisationsudvikling, Pædagogik og Læring","UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Styrket skoleledelse og udvikling af folkeskolen på Ærø i et elevperspektiv"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"2a136974-b782-43e4-9ff2-f630c2ddb5a1","name":"Rasmussen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"16754fea-fa46-4045-a85e-a64480532ca2","name":"Jensen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788702373929"],"pages":"209-213","publisher":"Hans Reitzels Forlag","status":"p","title":"Erhvervsdidaktisk opslagsbog"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UCL University College","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucl-90530ffc-6fd3-458f-b66d-2cedf1facdfa"],"src":["UCL University College"],"title":"Lærerroller","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-648479","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Crystallisation fouling is a challenge in numerous applications. To mitigate fouling we need to determine the basic mechanisms involved in the process. While ex situ techniques have been widely used in previous studies, they cannot capture complex dynamic effects. We conducted an in situ investigation of the dynamic effects of crystallisation fouling in a steel pipe (length 3 cm, diameter 3 mm) using X-ray micro-computed tomography (µCT) over more than six days. We employed a custom-developed image reconstruction algorithm, which ensured high spatiotemporal resolution from a laboratory instrument. We quantified the evolving fouling using advanced segmentation techniques of 4D images. To understand how the pipe interface structure impacts reactive transport, the experimental geometries of the flow system were used to perform computational fluid dynamic simulations. These new data allowed us to identify three growth phases: initiation, expansion, and densification","author_count":8,"contributors":["Løge, Isaac Appelquist","Rasmussen, Peter Winkel","Sørensen, Henning Osholm","Bruns, Stefan","AlBaraghtheh, Tamadur","Christensen, Anders Nymark","Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","Fosbøl, Philip Loldrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-669486"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Løge, Isaac Appelquist","Rasmussen, Peter Winkel"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Helmholtz-Zentrum Hereon"],"keyword":["CFD","Crystal growth","In situ tomography","Tomographic reconstruction"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"revealing the complex spatiotemporal nature of crystal growth in a steel pipe initiation expansion and densification","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2023.143157","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-669486","identifier":[{"id":"85158881403","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-e05aff72-0f2f-4d7e-ba55-c1d1be6f4328"],"keyword":["4D X-ray CT","CFD","Crystal growth","Crystallisation fouling","In situ tomography","Tomographic reconstruction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D54279A6549099241EEE57336B76DBA8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2023.143157","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/321272582/1_s2.0_S1385894723018880_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CERE – Center for Energy Ressources Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"helmholtz zentrum hereon","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Helmholtz-Zentrum Hereon","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Isaac Appelquist","key":"løgepau","last":"Løge","locid":"b3068444-b2dd-4952-a98c-8ab0293bf3ae","name":"Løge, Isaac Appelquist","orcid":"0000-0003-3454-7189","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Winkel","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"89913c01-b575-4d5d-b4b6-8da181afb384","name":"Rasmussen, Peter Winkel","orcid":"0000-0002-0823-0316","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henning Osholm","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"04ff82b1-ff20-4053-bfbc-a0909cdb5430","name":"Sørensen, Henning Osholm","orcid":"0000-0002-7004-547X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Stefan","key":"brunspau","last":"Bruns","name":"Bruns, Stefan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Tamadur","key":"albaraghthehpau","last":"AlBaraghtheh","name":"AlBaraghtheh, Tamadur","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Nymark","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"ad9ef4bc-d943-459d-b52f-a11c61a9ab0d","name":"Christensen, Anders Nymark","orcid":"0000-0002-3668-3128","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Bjorholm","key":"dahlpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"c2bad3c8-b172-481b-bb99-d3c2bc4004ef","name":"Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","orcid":"0000-0002-0068-8170","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Philip Loldrup","key":"fosbølpau","last":"Fosbøl","locid":"9328240a-2f8a-4f3e-b14b-2b1276211a32","name":"Fosbøl, Philip Loldrup","orcid":"0000-0003-1067-2348","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.cej.2023.143157","issn":["13858947","18733212"],"issn_org":["13858947"],"journal":"Chemical Engineering Journal","paperid":"143157","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Chemical Engineering Journal","volume":"466"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85158881403"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e05aff72-0f2f-4d7e-ba55-c1d1be6f4328"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Revealing the complex spatiotemporal nature of crystal growth in a steel pipe : Initiation, expansion, and densification","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-669486","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"INTRODUCTION: Programmed cell death ligand-1 (PD-L1) expression may help identify patients with non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) who would benefit from immunotherapy. We assessed PD-L1 expression, and epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) and V-Ki-Ras2 Kirsten rat sarcoma (KRAS) mutations in NSCLC patients receiving adjuvant chemotherapy. METHODS: Data for stage IB/II/IIIA NSCLC patients (diagnosed: 2001-2012) were retrieved from Danish population-based registries. Tumor tissue samples were tested for PD-L1 expression using VENTANA PD-L1 (SP263) Assay in tumor cells (TC) at ≥25% cutoff and immune cells (IC) at ≥1% and ≥25% cutoffs. KRAS and EGFR mutations were tested using PCR-based assays. Follow-up began 120 days after diagnosis until death/emigration/January 1, 2015, whichever came first. Using Cox proportional hazard regression, hazard ratios (HRs) were computed for overall survival (OS) for each biomarker, adjusting for age, sex, histology, comorbidities, and tissue specimen age. RESULTS: Among 391 patients identified, 40.4% had stage IIIA disease, 49.9% stage II, and 8.7% stage IB. PD-L1-TC was observed in 38% of patients, EGFR mutations in 4%, and KRAS mutations in 29%. KRAS mutations were more frequent among patients with PD-L1 TC≥25% versus TC<25% (37% versus 24%). OS was not associated with PD-L1 TC≥25% versus TC<25% (stage II: adjusted HR = 1.15 [95% confidence interval: 0.66-2.01]; stage IIIA: 0.72 [0.44-1.19]). No significant association was observed with OS and PD-L1-IC ≥1% and ≥25%. EGFR and KRAS mutations were not associated with a prognostic impact. CONCLUSION: A prognostic impact for NSCLC patients receiving adjuvant chemotherapy was not associated with PD-L1 expression, or with EGFR and KRAS mutations.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Dalvi, Tapashi","Nørgaard, Mette","Fryzek, Jon P","Movva, Naimisha","Pedersen, Lars","Pham Hansen, Hanh","Walker, Jill","Midha, Anita","Shire, Norah","Boothman, Anne-Marie","Rigas, James","Mellemgaard, Anders","Rasmussen, Torben Riis","Hamilton-Dutoit, Stephen Jacques","Cronin-Fenton, Deirdre"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-675108"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Cronin-Fenton, Deirdre"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","AstraZeneca UK"],"keyword":["B7 H1 Antigen metabolism","Biomarkers Tumor","Carcinoma Non Small Cell Lung pathology","Denmark","ErbB Receptors metabolism","Humans","Lung Neoplasms pathology","Proto Oncogene Proteins p21 ras metabolism"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Astra-Zeneca A/S (DK)"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"biomarker expression and survival in patients with non small cell lung cancer receiving adjuvant chemotherapy in denmark","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0284037","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-675108","identifier":[{"id":"85152244502","type":"scopus"},{"id":"37040387","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC10089313","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-6be7e46e-a8a1-4f1a-a640-2d3a8057ae52"],"keyword":["B7-H1 Antigen/metabolism","Biomarkers, Tumor","Carcinoma, Non-Small-Cell Lung/pathology","Denmark","ErbB Receptors/metabolism","Humans","Lung Neoplasms/pathology","Proto-Oncogene Proteins p21(ras)/metabolism"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B197BDC6222172E30F2861F6DB380FFA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0284037","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Astra-Zeneca A/S (DK)"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Clinical Epidemiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"astrazeneca uk","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"AstraZeneca UK","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Hospital of Bornholm"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tapashi","key":"dalvipau","last":"Dalvi","name":"Dalvi, Tapashi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette","key":"nørgaardpau","last":"Nørgaard","locid":"3cb2ae19-c1b9-4dad-9928-adbd1c51b4b7","name":"Nørgaard, Mette","orcid":"0000-0001-6110-5891","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jon P","key":"fryzekpau","last":"Fryzek","name":"Fryzek, Jon P","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Naimisha","key":"movvapau","last":"Movva","name":"Movva, Naimisha","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a0fdd247-3fb1-4c38-a1b2-f37d89f8f5c9","name":"Pedersen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0002-9341-3888","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","correspon