{"abstract":"En indføring til Schellings filosofi og mere specifikt til hans senfilosofi, som den fremstilles i den oversatte tekst.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ziethen, Morten","Frølund, Lars","Rasmussen, Anders Moe","Willert, Kristoffer Balslev"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-705348"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"introduktion","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dbp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://philosophia.dk/?product=aabenbaringens-filosofi","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-705348","ids":["aau-684d0266-191a-4c38-b64b-8206bebf6d57"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-310030F5218ED20C12056241B1BFC34D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, Collaborative Organizational Learning (CO-LEARN)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"ziethenpau","last":"Ziethen","locid":"426d64e7-50c8-4484-becd-62b23777ac4a","name":"Ziethen, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-3826-7344","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"frølundpau","last":"Frølund","name":"Frølund, Lars","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Moe","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Moe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristoffer Balslev","key":"willertpau","last":"Willert","name":"Willert, Kristoffer Balslev","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788793041585"],"pages":"13-52","publisher":"Forlaget Philosophia","status":"p","title":"Åbenbaringens Filosofi"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-684d0266-191a-4c38-b64b-8206bebf6d57"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Introduktion","type":"Book Preface, Encycl. Entry","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-705348","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: We recently conducted a double-blinded randomised controlled trial showing that fish-oil supplementation during pregnancy reduced the risk of persistent wheeze or asthma in the child by 30%. Here, we explore the mechanisms of the intervention. Methods: 736 pregnant women were given either placebo or n-3 long-chain polyunsaturated fatty acids (LCPUFAs) in the third trimester in a randomised controlled trial. Deep clinical follow-up of the 695 children in the trial was done at 12 visits until age 6 years, including assessment of genotype at the fatty acid desaturase (FADS) locus, plasma fatty acids, airway DNA methylation, gene expression, microbiome and metabolomics. Results: Supplementation with n-3 LCPUFA reduced the overall risk of non-atopic asthma by 73% at age 6 (relative risk (RR) 0.27 (95% CI 0.06 to 0.85), p=0.042). In contrast, there was no overall effect on asthma with atopic traits (RR 1.42 (95% CI 0.63 to 3.38), p=0.40), but this was significantly modified by maternal FADS genotype and LCPUFA blood levels (interaction p<0.05), and supplementation did reduce the risk of atopic asthma in the subgroup of mothers with FADS risk variants and/or low blood levels of n-3 LCPUFA before the intervention (RR 0.31 (95% CI 0.11 to 0.75), p=0.016). Furthermore, n-3 LCPUFA significantly reduced the number of infections (croup, gastroenteritis, tonsillitis, otitis media and pneumonia) by 16% (incidence rate ratio 0.84 (95% CI 0.74 to 0.96), p=0.009). Conclusions: n-3 LCPUFA supplementation in pregnancy showed protective effects on non-atopic asthma and infections. Protective effects on atopic asthma depended on maternal FADS genotype and n-3 LCPUFA levels. This indicates that the fatty acid pathway is involved in multiple mechanisms affecting the risk of asthma subtypes and infections. Trial registration number: NCT00798226.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Bisgaard, Hans","Mikkelsen, Marianne","Rasmussen, Morten Arendt","Sevelsted, Astrid","Schoos, Ann Marie Malby","Brustad, Nicklas","Eliasen, Anders U.","Thorsen, Jonathan","Chawes, Bo","Gürdeniz, Gözde","Morin, Andreanne","Stark, Ken","Stokholm, Jakob","Ober, Carole","Pedersen, Casper Emil Tingskov","Bønnelykke, Klaus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-720871"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["Canada","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","The University of Chicago","University of Waterloo"],"keyword":["Asthma","Respiratory infection"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"atopic and non atopic effects of fish oil supplementation during pregnancy","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/398722544/Atopic_and_non_atopic_effects.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-720871","identifier":[{"id":"37696621","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85172396767","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10777305","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-7fb6af49-eb72-4d0a-af64-a133f00bc779"],"keyword":["asthma","respiratory infection"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F95AD20FC1743D18339C24F80F63846E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/398722544/Atopic_and_non_atopic_effects.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","n