{"abstract":"In diabetes prevention and care, invasiveness of glucose measurement impedes efficient therapy and hampers the identification of people at risk. Lack of calibration stability in non-invasive technology has confined the field to short-term proof of principle. Addressing this challenge, we demonstrate the first practical use of a Raman-based and portable non-invasive glucose monitoring device used for at least 15 days following calibration. In a home-based clinical study involving 160 subjects with diabetes, the largest of its kind to our knowledge, we find that the measurement accuracy is insensitive to age, sex, and skin color. A subset of subjects with type 2 diabetes highlights promising real-life results with 99.8% of measurements within A + B zones in the consensus error grid and a mean absolute relative difference of 14.3%. By overcoming the problem of calibration stability, we remove the lingering uncertainty about the practical use of non-invasive glucose monitoring, boding a new, non-invasive era in diabetes monitoring.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Pors, Anders","Rasmussen, Kaspar G.","Inglev, Rune","Jendrike, Nina","Philipps, Amalie","Ranjan, Ajenthen G.","Vestergaard, Vibe","Henriksen, Jan Erik","Nørgaard, Kirsten","Freckmann, Guido","Hepp, Karl D.","Gerstenberg, Michael C.","Weber, Anders"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-681542"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Weber, Anders"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ludwig-Maximilian University of Munich","Ulm University","University of Ulm"],"keyword":["Diabetes","Multivariate data analysis","Tissue diagnostics","calibration stability","in vivo Raman spectroscopy","non invasive glucose monitoring","portable sensor"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-STENO"],"OT":["RSP Systems"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-STENO","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"accurate post calibration predictions for noninvasive glucose measurements in people using confocal raman spectroscopy","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssensors.2c02756","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors wish to acknowledge the support from the colleagues at RSP Systems, Steno Diabetes Center in Odense and Copenhagen, and the Institute for Diabetes Technology in Ulm. The staff at KLIFO is recognized for the support in execution of the trial."],"id":"S02-100.00-681542","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10043934","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"36877178","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85149821427","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-547724a4-e98a-4fcf-9eee-3750a52758e9","sdu-01418af7-e207-4850-b1ec-a988b6773cf0"],"keyword":["calibration stability","diabetes","in vivo Raman spectroscopy","multivariate data analysis","non-invasive glucose monitoring","portable sensor","tissue diagnostics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-90747FF08437B0937697BABE0B16CAA3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/362330065/acssensors.2c02756.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssensors.2c02756","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/226401937/acssensors.2c02756.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["RSP Systems A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["RSP Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"university of ulm","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Ulm","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"ulm university","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ulm University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"steno diabetes centers","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-STENO","l3nn":"Steno Diabetes Centers","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Steno Diabetes Centers","namevar":["Steno Diabetes Center Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-STENO","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of SDCO - Steno Diabetes Center Odense"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"7","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal Medicine: Endocrinology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-