{"abstract":"How are we to understand the historical context of the refugee situation in Jordan? What are the conditions that existed long before the current situation and how have they impacted on the ways Syrian refugees have been received and incorporated into their neighbouring country? And what are the most likely future scenarios? In this interview, Dawn Chatty, Emeritus Professor of Anthropology and Forced Migration, unpacks how cross-border ties and networks make the situation in Jordan special. Chatty explains how this legacy persists and continuously shapes not just the past but also the present predicament. A central viewpoint that Chatty offers is that Syrian youth need to know their past – their heritage – in order to move towards the future. Similarly, Chatty sees education as key to personal and collective flourishing but has found that, with access to education restricted, Syrian youth have had to find pragmatic approaches to life and livelihoods.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bandak, Andreas","Holst, Birgitte Stampe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-722132"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"understanding the situation of syrian refugee youth in jordan in historical context an interview with emeritus professor at oxford university dawn chatty","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/376203857/Viable_Futures_Articulations_EN_Final.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-722132","ids":["ku-ded17608-f048-43c7-95f7-ed61312049f0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DA783E3707F00CC8049BD0459B331268"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/376203857/Viable_Futures_Articulations_EN_Final.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Cross-Cultural and Regional Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Andreas","key":"bandakpau","last":"Bandak","locid":"e358540c-8467-40d4-ae35-b9b52bddfa3a","name":"Bandak, Andreas","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birgitte Stampe","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"3cc4e77d-f94f-4945-9a73-405a828afaa5","name":"Holst, Birgitte Stampe","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andreas","key":"bandakpedh","last":"Bandak","name":"Bandak, Andreas","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Birgitte","key":"stampeholstpedh","last":"Stampe Holst","name":"Stampe Holst, Birgitte","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders","key":"hastruppedh","last":"Hastrup","name":"Hastrup, Anders","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nick","key":"soltanipedh","last":"Soltani","name":"Soltani, Nick","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Hannah","key":"arndalrasmussenpedh","last":"Arndal Rasmussen","name":"Arndal Rasmussen, Hannah","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"pages":"54-60","publisher":"Københavns Universitet, Humanistisk Fakultet","status":"p","subtitle":"Syrian Articulations of the Protracted Crisis in Jordan","title":"Viable Futures"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["A