Hall","locid":"55a9b111-6dbb-4a42-a9ab-d5f3785fbdae","name":"van Hall, Gerrit","orcid":"0000-0002-2519-8127","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37339940"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1152/ajpgi.00242.2022","issn":["01931857","15221547"],"issn_org":["01931857"],"issue":"2","journal":"American Journal of Physiology: Gastrointestinal and Liver Physiology","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Physiology: Gastrointestinal and Liver Physiology","volume":"325"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85166393444"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","All University Colleges","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Hospitals","KP","Universities","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-260fb3aa-27d3-4b04-8f32-5fc74de3daac"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Skeletal muscle protein turnover responses to parenteral nutrition in patients with alcoholic liver cirrhosis and sarcopenia","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-683778","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"With the Doughnut for Urban Development we are using doughnut economics as a model for urban development and construction for the first time. Doughnut Economics has previously been used with great success globally and for urban strategies ranging from Amsterdam to Copenhagen. We have developed the Manual to provide the entire industry with a practical tool to evaluate the sustainability of their projects and what they can do to make them even more sustainable. The manual embraces both social and planetary sustainability and incorporates both local and global dimensions. The Doughnut for Urban Development is an open-source project and all the following resources can be downloaded for free: - The Manual - A scientific Appendix providing background for the Manual - A Database of impact areas used in the manual - A tool to assess a project's biodiversity impacts throughout its life cycle","author_count":19,"contributors":["Birgisdottir, Harpa","Bjørn, Anders","Branny, Artur","Clausen, Caroline","Fanning, Andrew","Fetzer, Ingo","Francart, Nicolas","Grcheva, Leonora","Heide, Mia","Lassen, Emil","Leonardsen, Jonathan","Moberg, Fredrik","Nørgaard, Rasmus","Pham, Dan","Kjørup Rasmussen, Kristine","Raworth, Kate","Ryberg, Morten","Hill-Hansen, Dani","Guldager Jensen, Kasper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-692414"],"event":{"end":"2023-06-22","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2023-06-22","title":"Launch event of the Doughnut for Urban Development","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-11","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Doughnut Economics Action Lab","Stockholm University","Sweco AB"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Home.Earth"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U