{"abstract":"Det er enormt dyrt for samfundet at rense rør for begroning – herunder kalk. Hvis vi gør det smartere, kan vi spare milliarder.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Løge, Isaac Appelquist","Rasmussen, Peter Winkel","Sørensen, Henning Osholm","Christensen, Anders Nymark","Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","Fosbøl, Philip Loldrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-368424"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"træt af at afkalke din elkedel tilkalkede rør er et større problem end du tror","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://videnskab.dk/forskerzonen/teknologi-innovation/traet-af-at-afkalke-din-elkedel-tilkalkede-roer-er-et-stoerre-problem-end-du","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-368424","ids":["dtu-d5b2e6f3-2518-498d-9eef-cc8d3f1d52d1"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DFB45E3DFC9E1FC42983EEA6D25AE7AC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://videnskab.dk/forskerzonen/teknologi-innovation/traet-af-at-afkalke-din-elkedel-tilkalkede-roer-er-et-stoerre-problem-end-du","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CERE – Center for Energy Ressources Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Isaac Appelquist","key":"løgepau","last":"Løge","locid":"b3068444-b2dd-4952-a98c-8ab0293bf3ae","name":"Løge, Isaac Appelquist","orcid":"0000-0003-3454-7189","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Winkel","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"89913c01-b575-4d5d-b4b6-8da181afb384","name":"Rasmussen, Peter Winkel","orcid":"0000-0002-0823-0316","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henning Osholm","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"04ff82b1-ff20-4053-bfbc-a0909cdb5430","name":"Sørensen, Henning Osholm","orcid":"0000-0002-7004-547X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Nymark","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"ad9ef4bc-d943-459d-b52f-a11c61a9ab0d","name":"Christensen, Anders Nymark","orcid":"0000-0002-3668-3128","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Bjorholm","key":"dahlpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"c2bad3c8-b172-481b-bb99-d3c2bc4004ef","name":"Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","orcid":"0000-0002-0068-8170","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Philip Loldrup","key":"fosbølpau","last":"Fosbøl","locid":"9328240a-2f8a-4f3e-b14b-2b1276211a32","name":"Fosbøl, Philip Loldrup","orcid":"0000-0003-1067-2348","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["dtu-d5b2e6f3-2518-498d-9eef-cc8d3f1d52d1"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Træt af at afkalke din elkedel? Tilkalkede rør er et større problem, end du tror","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-368424","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background Treatment with medical cannabis for chronic pain is in popular demand, and a rising number of countries allow physicians to prescribe medical cannabis for pain management. However, data on drug-safety is scarce. Studies have showed a risk of cardiovascular side effects following use of recreational cannabis warranting further investigations into the safety of prescribing medical cannabis. Purpose We investigated risk of new-onset arrhythmias (tachy- or bradyarrhythmia and conduction disorders), acute coronary syndrome (ACS) and heart failure (HF) following use of prescribed medical cannabis compared with no use in a nationwide cohort of patients with chronic pain. Methods Using nationwide Danish registers, a cohort of patients with chronic pain and without prior history of arrhythmias, ACS, HF or prescribed medical cannabis (cannabinoid, cannabidiol or dronabinol) use were followed from 2018–2021. Any patient from the cohort initiating first-time treatment with medical cannabis was identified and matched 1:10 to corresponding controls within the cohort using incidence density sampling. Matching parameters were age group, sex, and chronic pain diagnosis. Follow-up was initiated at the date of the first claimed prescription of medical cannabis or the corresponding date among controls. We reported 180-day standardized absolute risks (AR) with 95% confidence intervals (CI) and risk ratios (RR) from fitted multivariable logistic regression models comparing patients exposed to medical cannabis with patients not exposed. Separate analyses for each chronic pain group were conducted as well. Results Among 1.6 million patients with chronic pain, 4,562 patients claimed at least one prescription of medical cannabis (exposed) and were each matched to 10 controls (non-exposed). Exposed and non-exposed patients were identical in relation to matching parameters; however, exposed patients were slightly more comorbid, and a larger proportion was concomitantly treated with other pain medication (Table). The risk of new-onset arrhythmia was elevated among exposed patients with 180-day AR of 0.71% (95% CI 0.47%–0.94%) compared with 0.43% (95% CI 0.37%–0.49%) yielding a RR of 1.64 (95% CI 1.04–2.23). The risk of new-onset ACS and HF was not increased comparing exposed to non-exposed with corresponding 180-day ARs of 0.13% (95% CI 0.03%-0.23%) vs 0.11% (95% CI 0.08%–0.14% and 0.13% (95% CI 0.03%–0.24%) vs 0.14% (95% CI 0.11%–0.17% (corresponding RRs of 1.2 [95% CI 0.3–2.1] and 0.9 [95% CI 0.2–1.7]) (Figure). Subgroup analyses of each chronic pain group yielded similar results. Conclusion In a nationwide cohort of patients with chronic pain, use of medical cannabis was associated with a 64% risk increase of arrhythmias compared with no use. This poses a potential health concern and is vital knowledge for any physician prescribing medical cannabis. Use of medical cannabis was not associated with an elevated risk of ACS or HF.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Holt, Anders","Strange, Jarl Emanuel","Rasmussen, Peter Vibe","Blanche, Paul","Nouhravesh, N.","Jensen, M. H.","Schjerning, A. M.","Schou, M.","Torp-Pedersen, C.","Gislason, Gunnar","Hansen, M. L.","McGettigan, P.","Lamberts, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-409428"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Queen Mary University of London"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cardiovascular risk following cannabinoid treatment for patients with chronic pain","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-409428","identifier":[{"id":"000894947902013","type":"wos"}],"ids":["ku-1ac3c6e3-3fe8-47c9-9123-1e3058d6fa23"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-361423749FCFA17080D8216CA0C9D6A6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"queen mary university of london","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Queen Mary University of London","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"A.","key":"holtpau","last":"Holt","locid":"7b64b1ed-698a-4d01-8987-02e878b5674c","name":"Holt, Anders","name_org":"Holt, A.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"J. E.","key":"strangepau","last":"Strange","locid":"8abc6f65-e1b6-4c15-9876-3985f814fe09","name":"Strange, Jarl Emanuel","name_org":"Strange, J. E.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"P. V.","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"ca186b96-3318-42e7-8fe1-34aa087a51b0","name":"Rasmussen, Peter Vibe","name_org":"Rasmussen, P. V.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"P.","key":"blanchepau","last":"Blanche","locid":"92ff477f-3b2c-4873-a4f5-dbe701671e1c","name":"Blanche, Paul","name_org":"Blanche, P.","orcid":"0000-0003-1415-7976","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"N.","key":"nouhraveshpau","last":"Nouhravesh","name":"Nouhravesh, N.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"M. H.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, M. H.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"A. M.","key":"schjerningpau","last":"Schjerning","name":"Schjerning, A. M.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"M.","key":"schoupau","last":"Schou","name":"Schou, M.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"C.","key":"torppedersenpau","last":"Torp-Pedersen","name":"Torp-Pedersen, C.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"G. H.","key":"gislasonpau","last":"Gislason","locid":"c0f678a6-eb13-49a3-9485-8fae1e72e2a1","name":"Gislason, Gunnar","name_org":"Gislason, G. H.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"M. L.","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, M. L.","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"P.","key":"mcgettiganpau","last":"McGettigan","name":"McGettigan, P.","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"M. K.","key":"lambertspau","last":"Lamberts","locid":"ced953f0-cd5e-4af3-8c41-7311decea61f","name":"Lamberts, Morten","name_org":"Lamberts, M. K.","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/eurheartj/ehac544.2731","issn":["0195668X","15229645"],"issn_org":["0195668X"],"journal":"European Heart Journal","pages":"2731","status":"p","title":"European Heart Journal","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1ac3c6e3-3fe8-47c9-9123-1e3058d6fa23"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Cardiovascular risk following cannabinoid treatment for patients with chronic pain","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-409428","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background: Testicular germ cell tumours (TGCTs) have a high sensitivity to chemotherapy and a high cure rate, although with serious adverse effects. In the search for tumour suppressive drugs, the RANKL inhibitor Denosumab, used to treat osteoporosis, came up as a candidate since RANKL signalling was recently identified in the testis. Methods: Expression of RANKL, RANK and OPG, and the effects of RANKL inhibition were investigated in human TGCTs, TGCT-derived cell-lines, and TGCT-xenograft models. Serum RANKL was measured in TGCT-patients. Results: RANKL, RANK, and OPG were expressed in germ cell neoplasia in situ (GCNIS), TGCTs, and TGCT-derived cell lines. RANKL-inhibition reduced proliferation of seminoma-derived TCam-2 cells, but had no effect on embryonal carcinoma-derived NTera2 cells. Pretreatment with Denosumab did not augment the effect of cisplatin in vitro. However, inhibition of RANKL in vivo reduced tumour growth exclusively in the TCam-2-xenograft model and Denosumab-treatment decreased proliferation in human GCNIS cultures. In TGCT-patients serum RANKL had no prognostic value. Conclusions: This study shows that the RANKL signalling system is expressed in GCNIS and seminoma where RANKL inhibition suppresses tumour growth in vitro and in vivo. Future studies are needed to determine whether RANKL is important for the malignant transformation or transition from GCNIS to invasive tumours.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Andreassen, Christine Hjorth","Lorenzen, Mette","Nielsen, John E.","Kafai Yahyavi, Sam","Toft, Birgitte Grønkær","Ingerslev, Lars Roed","Clemmensen, Christoffer","Rasmussen, Lene Juel","Bokemeyer, Carsten","Juul, Anders","Jørgensen, Anne Juul","Jensen, Martin Blomberg"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-419563"],"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Hamburg"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rankl regulates testicular cancer growth and denosumab treatment has suppressive effects on gcnis and advanced seminoma","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/about/copyright/","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9345904/pdf/41416_2022_Article_1810.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-419563","identifier":[{"id":"85128104591","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000783462000002","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC9345904","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"35418213","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-2bda32dd-75ef-4afb-b063-affb41cb6d7f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E92D517A20729C40E4F57B0ED138FC0F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/about/copyright/","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9345904/pdf/41416_2022_Article_1810.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"university of hamburg","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Hamburg","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Christine Hjorth","key":"andreassenpau","last":"Andreassen","locid":"02dd3617-929e-4d5c-a806-8ddb813378f5","name":"Andreassen, Christine Hjorth","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mette","key":"lorenzenpau","last":"Lorenzen","locid":"00cb4d70-9777-4ea1-83c0-5cf6fd9c555e","name":"Lorenzen, Mette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"John E.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, John E.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Sam","key":"kafaiyahyavipau","last":"Kafai Yahyavi","name":"Kafai Yahyavi, Sam","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birgitte Grønkær","key":"toftpau","last":"Toft","locid":"84bc5492-2a5b-4e35-8630-aeb31e7be454","name":"Toft, Birgitte Grønkær","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lars R.","key":"ingerslevpau","last":"Ingerslev","locid":"26f3d9d2-f555-4a5b-9fda-25333d1838ed","name":"Ingerslev, Lars Roed","name_org":"Ingerslev, Lars R.","orcid":"0000-0002-4164-7690","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christoffer","key":"clemmensenpau","last":"Clemmensen","locid":"cb6d6cab-88bf-4650-9bd9-7759c2dc0be6","name":"Clemmensen, Christoffer","orcid":"0000-0003-2456-9667","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lene Juel","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"54d5267c-3c91-45bc-ace5-1d0edb1b250d","name":"Rasmussen, Lene Juel","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Carsten","key":"bokemeyerpau","last":"Bokemeyer","name":"Bokemeyer, Carsten","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anders","key":"juulpau","last":"Juul","locid":"f9b11983-c7c8-4111-b119-4de471572898","name":"Juul, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-0534-4350","rank":10,"roleco