"first":"Maj-Brit Nørregaard","key":"kjaerpau","last":"Kjaer","locid":"e1004550-4b86-45e5-9ed3-42b2f37f32b6","name":"Kjær, Maj Brit Nørregaard","name_org":"Kjaer, Maj-Brit Nørregaard","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Maj-Brit Nørregaard","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","name":"Kjær, Maj-Brit Nørregaard","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"strømpau","last":"Strøm","locid":"d8661084-479b-4746-96af-9cfd0b539d72","name":"Strøm, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-1868-0978","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 5 1 3","first":"Anders","key":"pernerpau","last":"Perner","locid":"8a389541-d529-4ee3-8364-66bfc85f77c9","name":"Perner, Anders","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bodil Steen","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"3162c449-94c3-4d28-8dbb-c134d6eb76e1","name":"Rasmussen, Bodil Steen","orcid":"0000-0003-2190-145X","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 5 1 3","first":"Morten Hylander","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"9463b017-3c43-470d-b95b-cf3cba8a27d4","name":"Møller, Morten Hylander","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34811741"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/aas.14001","issn":["00015172"],"issue":"2","journal":"Acta Anaesthesiologica Scandinavica","pages":"295-301","publisher":"Blackwell Munksgaard","status":"p","title":"Acta Anaesthesiologica Scandinavica","volume":"66"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85120475587"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Other Hospitals","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Undetermined","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","collaboration for research in intensive care"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-7de4ab81-841d-4dec-a7e3-8dd9256617b5","ku-3599900c-d8c7-410a-bea7-5af640524463","sdu-fa03231a-12dd-4f8a-8968-cc05a9301a1d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Health-related quality of life and days alive without life support or out of hospital : Protocol","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-093.83-006095","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"INTRODUCTION: Different outcomes are reported in randomised clinical trials (RCTs) in intensive care unit (ICU) patients, and no core outcome set (COS) is available for ICU patients in general. Accordingly, we aim to develop a COS for ICU patients in general. METHODS: The COS will be developed in accordance with the Core Outcome Measures in Effectiveness Trials (COMET) Handbook, using a modified Delphi consensus process and semi-structured interviews involving adults who have survived acute admission to an ICU, family members, clinicians, researchers and other stakeholders. The modified Delphi process will include two steps. Step 1: conduction of a modified Delphi survey, developed and informed by combining the outputs of a literature search of outcomes in previous COSs and semi-structured interviews with key stakeholders. We plan at least two survey rounds to obtain consensus and refine the COS. Step 2: a consensus process regarding instruments or definitions to be recommended for the measurements of the outcomes selected in Step 1. A 'patient and public involvement panel' consisting of a smaller group of patients, family members, clinicians and researchers will be included in the development, analysis and interpretation of the COS. DISCUSSION: The outlined multiple method studies will establish a COS for ICU patients in general, which may be used to increase the standardisation and comparability of results of RCTs conducted in patients in the ICU setting.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Kjaer, Maj-Brit Nørregaard","Granholm, Anders","Vesterlund, Gitte Kingo","Estrup, Stine","Sivapalan, Praleene","Bruun, Camilla Rahbek Lysholm","Mortensen, Camilla Bekker","Poulsen, Lone Musaeus","Møller, Morten Hylander","Christensen, Steffen","Strøm, Thomas","Laerkner, Eva","Brøchner, Anne Craveiro","Rasmussen, Bodil Steen","Vestergaard, Stine Rom","Barot, Emily","Madsen, Martin Bruun","Egerod, Ingrid","Perner, Anders","Collet, Marie Oxenbøll"],"cuid":["S04-095.00-004378"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corresponding_author":["Kjaer, Maj-Brit Nørregaard","Kjær, Maj Brit Nørregaard"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development of a core outcome set for general intensive care unit patients a protocol","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/320359804/LINI_Acta_Anaesthesiol_Scand_2022_Kj_r_Development_of_a_core_outcome_set_for_general_intensive_care_unit_patients_a.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S04-095.00-004378","identifier":[{"id":"85122889743","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34961916","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-59bbc635-5016-46f4-88f7-8fb056a295b8","au-ca138d67-155a-46ed-a4be-7bfefecc94bb","ku-bd856ae7-3a8c-4260-97a7-aae6982d3d16","sdu-65121192-ede5-4525-89c1-36c5c3109320"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-889DD475DB2F5027209A0CC6B1C6B3B8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/320359804/LINI_Acta_Anaesthesiol_Scand_2022_Kj_r_Development_of_a_core_outcome_set_for_general_intensive_care_unit_patients_a.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/532531171/Development_of_a_core_outcome_set_for_general_intensive_care_unit_patients_a_protocol.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sd