ull,"first":"Henrik Gerner","key":"rasmussenhenrikgernerpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"34e03678-2096-4e14-99db-78ed0bf34a29","name":"Rasmussen, Henrik Gerner","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"rafnjanpau","last":"Rafn","locid":"432bb1b7-20e9-4e87-9efb-d4b98a222761","name":"Rafn, Jan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne Pia","key":"lindahlmariannepiapau","last":"Lindahl","locid":"56fba2a2-de56-4bf6-8492-ef23d2d0646e","name":"Lindahl, Marianne Pia","orcid":"0000-0002-9183-083X","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Signe","key":"andersensignepau","last":"Andersen","locid":"f77024fd-782b-459d-807e-2fae698272a6","name":"Andersen, Signe","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeanette","key":"præstegaardjeanettepau","last":"Præstegaard","locid":"d86f2e93-47f7-49c1-9cd4-018cb1baeb78","name":"Præstegaard, Jeanette","orcid":"0000-0002-6856-9442","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rebecca Stephanie","key":"helqvistrebeccastephaniepau","last":"Helqvist","name":"Helqvist, Rebecca Stephanie","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"pedersenanderspau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Anders","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Henriette","key":"hemmingsenhenriettepau","last":"Hemmingsen","name":"Hemmingsen, Henriette","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jette","key":"lomanjettepau","last":"Loman","name":"Loman, Jette","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Hinsby","key":"mathiesenrikkehinsbypau","last":"Mathiesen","name":"Mathiesen, Rikke Hinsby","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Juul","key":"sønderskovannejuulpau","last":"Sønderskov","name":"Sønderskov, Anne Juul","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"301","publisher":"Professionshøjskolen Absalon","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","University College Absalon","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["pha-ddeaba9b-c0ee-4f1d-b8c5-bff6b0b68b0b"],"src":["AB University College Absalon"],"title":"Fællesskab med nydanskere - et skridt på vejen til beskæftigelse","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-555588","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background: Estimates of the severity of the emerging Omicron variant are critical to assess the public health impact associated with its rapid global dissemination. We estimated the risk of SARS-CoV-2-related hospitalisations after infection with Omicron compared with Delta in Denmark, a country with high mRNA vaccination coverage and an extensive free-of-charge PCR test capacity. Methods: Observational cohort study of all RT-PCR SARS-CoV-2 positive individuals in Denmark between 21 November and 19 December, 2021, the period Omicron emerged while Delta was still dominant. Individuals were identified in the national COVID-19 surveillance system database which include results of a variant specific RT- PCR detecting Omicron cases, SARS-CoV-2 related hospitalisations (primary outcome of the study). The risk ratio (RR) of hospitalisation after infection with Omicron compared with Delta, overall and stratified by vaccination status, was calculated in a Poisson regression model with robust standard errors, adjusted à priori for reinfection status, sex, age, region, comorbidities, and period. Findings: Among the 188,980 SARS-CoV-2 infected individuals, 38,669 (20.1%) were Omicron vPCR positive. SARS-CoV-2 related hospitalisations and Omicron cases increased during the study period. Overall, 124,313 (65.8 %) were vaccinated and vaccination was associated with a lower risk of hospitalisation (adjusted RR 0.24, 95%CI 0.22-0.26), compared with cases with no or one vaccination. Compared with Delta infection, Omicron was associated with an adjusted RR of hospitalisation of 0.64 (95%CI 0.56-0.75; 222 Omicron and 2,213 Delta hospitalisations). For the similar comparison by vaccination status, the RR of hospitalisation was 0.57 (95%CI 0.44- 0.75) among cases with no or one vaccination, 0.71 (95%CI 0.60-0.86) among two- dose vaccinated, and 0.50 (95%CI 0.32-0.76) among three-dose vaccinated. Interpretation: We found a significantly lower risk of hospitalisation with Omicron infection compared with Delta among both vaccinated and unvaccinated individuals, suggesting an inherent reduced severity of Omicron. Our results can guide modelling of the impact of the ongoing global Omicron wave and thus health care system preparedness.","author_count":47,"contributors":["Bager, Peter","Wohlfahrt, Jan","Bhatt, Samir","Edslev, Sofie Marie","Sieber, Raphael Niklaus","Ingham, Anna Cäcilia","Stegger, Marc","Legarth, Rebecca","Møller, Camilla Holten","Skov, Robert Leo","Valentiner-Branth, Palle","Overvad, Maria","Agermose Gram, Mie","Kristensen Lomholt, Frederikke","Hallundbæk, Louise","Hjorth Espensen, Caroline","Gubbels, Sophie","Voldstedlund, Marianne","Karakis, Marianne","Lauenborg Møller, Karina","Schytte Olsen, Stefan","K. Fischer, Thea","Barrella Harboe, Zitta","Klint Johannesen, Caroline","van Wijhe, Maarten","Gitz Holler, Jon","Simonsen, Lone","Benny Christian Dessau, Ram","Barfred Friis, Martin","Fuglsang-Damgaard, David","Pinholt, Mette","Søren Kirkby, Nikolai","Kragh Thomsen, Marianne","Vognbjerg Sydenham, Thomas","Eugenio Coia, John","Sofie Marmolin, Ea","Fomsgaard, Anders","Fonager, Jannik","Rasmussen, Morten","Spiess, Katja","Marving, Ellinor","Cohen, Arieh","Balle Larsen, Nicolai","Lillebaek, Troels","Ullum, Henrik","Mølbak, Kåre","Grove Krause, Tyra"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-565799"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Imperial College London"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"re