g Foundation, Stig and Ragna Gorthon Foundation, Knutsson Foundation, Laerdal Founda-tion, Hans-Gabriel and Alice Trolle-Wachtmeister Foundation for Medical Research, and Regional Research Support in Region Skåne) and by governmental funding of clinical research within the Swedish National Health Service. No further fundings were requested for this sub-analysis."],"id":"S03-091.99-755953","identifier":[{"id":"36271410","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85140287744","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC9585831","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-07146dfb-3e4a-4150-a314-0556d3cc9af2","ku-99203cdb-ab2c-4f33-a398-74fc8f02fd8a","sdu-766338ce-6f5e-437a-996e-cef1f4163b2b"],"keyword":["Aged","Cardiac arrest","Female","Humans","Hyperoxemia","Hypothermia/complications","Hypoxemia","Hypoxia/complications","Male","Middle Aged","Mortality","Neurological outcome","Out-of-Hospital Cardiac Arrest/complications","Oxygen","Partial Pressure"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-1DCF874705C3845A30B483FE958C1481"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/212010284/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s13054-022-04186-8","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/403987210/s13054_022_04186_8.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"san martino hospital genoa","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"San Martino Hospital Genoa","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"university of genoa","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Genoa","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"irccs azienda ospedaliera universitaria san martino ist","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"IRCCS Azienda Osp