ing trefoil factors in relation to lung cancer, age and lung function : a cross-sectional study in patients referred for suspected lung cancer","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-246454","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"I dette afsnit taler vi om femininitet og maskulinitet – med en særlig fokus på, hvordan spillereglerne for at være mand og kvinder er under forandring. Forfatter og journalist Anders Haahr Rasmussen er gæst hos Trine Askholm og professor Sara Louise Muhr. Anders har blandt andet skrevet bogen \"En Fandens Mand\", som handler om mænd i det 21- århundrede. Gennem personlige historier, essays og interviews behandles emner som #metoo, grænser, sexisme og sex.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Haahr Rasmussen, Anders","Askholm, Trine","Muhr, Sara Louise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-297278"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Innovator Q"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000002 feminitet og maskulinitet","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5j8BFHttNsLE60njnw2hux?si=aGERhrPoS629CiXZA2UQMA","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-297278","ids":["cbs-e5f2a1b7-978c-4a47-a4bf-b15765c2d430"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2C93EBD0A549103DEC480ED2ECCDBC8E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5j8BFHttNsLE60njnw2hux?si=aGERhrPoS629CiXZA2UQMA","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Innovator Q"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities"