{"abstract":"In June-November 2020, SARS-CoV-2-infected mink were detected in 290 of 1,147 Danish mink farms. In North Denmark Region, 30% (324/1,092) of people found connected to mink farms tested SARS-CoV- 2-PCR-positive and approximately 27% (95% confidence interval (CI): 25-30) of SARS-CoV-2-strains from humans in the community were mink-associated. Measures proved insufficient to mitigate spread. On 4 November, the government ordered culling of all Danish mink. Farmed mink constitute a potential virus reservoir challenging pandemic control.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Larsen, Helle Daugaard","Fonager, Jannik","Lomholt, Frederikke Kristensen","Dalby, Tine","Benedetti, Guido","Kristensen, Brian","Urth, Tinna Ravnholt","Rasmussen, Morten","Lassaunière, Ria","Rasmussen, Thomas Bruun","Strandbygaard, Bertel","Lohse, Louise","Chaine, Manon","Møller, Karina Lauenborg","Berthelsen, Ann Sofie Nicole","Nørgaard, Sarah Kristine","Sönksen, Ute Wolff","Boklund, Anette","Hammer, Anne Sofie Vedsted","Belsham, Graham","Krause, Tyra Grove","Mortensen, Sten","Bøtner, Anette","Fomsgaard, Anders","Mølbak, Kåre"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-400254"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"preliminary report of an outbreak of sars cov 000000000002 in mink and mink farmers associated with community spread denmark june to november 000000002020","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2807/1560-7917.ES.2021.26.5.210009","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-400254","identifier":[{"id":"85101275732","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7863232","typ