{"abstract":"In a recent paper, Chen et al. report the findings of a systematic review with meta-analysis concerning conservative versus conventional oxygen therapy for critically ill patients. We wish to commend the authors for their interest in the matter. However, the authors appear to misquote findings, fail to report results for all specified analyses, do not identify all relevant trials, have post hoc changed the eligibility criteria, and have seemingly switched directions of effects in analyses of secondary outcomes. These issues have led to incorrect conclusions concerning the effects of targeted oxygen therapy in critically ill patients.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Lass Klitgaard, Thomas","Schjørring, Olav Lilleholt","Nielsen, Frederik Mølgaard","Meyhoff, Christian Sylvest","Barbateskovic, Marija","Wetterslev, Jørn","Perner, Anders","Rasmussen, Bodil Steen"],"cuid":["S02-095.92-011538"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Lass Klitgaard, Thomas"],"keyword":["Critical care","Meta analysis","Oxygen","Systematic review"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"letter the editor serious methodological concerns about a recently published meta analysis on oxygen therapy","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s40560-021-00573-5","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-095.92-011538","identifier":[{"id":"PMC8649324","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85120855626","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34876227","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-f17d05de-2909-419e-bc53-3e1e866e33e4","ku-7af385df-3204-429b-959a-e1e70ad83f7e"],"keyword":["Critical care","Meta-analysis","Oxygen","Systematic review"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-FC1465CEF9C178463E5ACC0D3A30FFD9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/301343819/Letter.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s40560-021-00573-5","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/456054278/Klitgaard_et_al._2021_._Letter_the_editor_serious_methodological_concerns_about_a_recently_published_meta_analysis_on_oxygen_therapy.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Anaesthesiology and Intensive Care","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Anæstesi, Børn, Kredsløb og Kvinder","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other hospitals","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-OTH","l3nl":"Other Hospitals","l3nn":"Other Hospitals","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Hospitals","namevar":["Collaboration for Research in Intensive Care"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospit