{"abstract":"This study aims to evaluate and compare extremity-MRi with specialized radiography by measuring articular cartilage height in patients with knee osteoarthritis. A prospective study, including sixty patients. Measurements on MRi images, Rosenberg view, and coronal stress radiographs were performed. MRI was compared to specialized radiography. Measurements in the medial compartment showed negligible/weak correlation between MRi and Rosenber/varus stress. In the lateral compartment, MRi and the Rosenberg/valgus stress view were strongly correlated. We conclude that MRi cannot replace radiographs for the measurement of articular cartilage thickness. MRi should, however, be reserved for more unusual cases of atypical clinical findings.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Mortensen, Jacob Fyhring","Mongelard, Kristian Breds Geoffroy","Radev, Dimitar Ivanov","Kappel, Andreas","Rasmussen, Lasse Enkebølle","Østgaard, Svend Erik","Odgaard, Anders"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-005869"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Mortensen, Jacob Fyhring"],"keyword":["Agreement","Joint space width","Knee","Magnetic Resonance Imaging","Osteoarthritis","Radiography","Reliability","Rosenberg","Skyline","Stress","Stress radiography","Valgus","Varus"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mri of the knee compared to specialized radiography for measurements of articular cartilage height in knees with osteoarthritis","src":["aau","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jor.2021.05.014","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Appreciation goes to the Herlev-Gentofte Orthopedic Department for all help received. The radiology department, where Frank Agner and Lars Jansen provided an essential logistical and technical service in planning and performing all radiographs and MRi-scans, was invaluable."],"id":"S03-100.00-005869","identifier":[{"id":"85106213430","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34045822","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8141415","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["aau-78dcf849-e694-447e-ad65-7d6d07cb11e6","ku-94579d11-9b7e-4cc1-bd7a-2cf53ff0a936","sdu-99227698-b40a-416c-a7f5-1f96069f010c"],"keyword":["Agreement","Joint space width","Knee","Magnetic resonance imaging","Osteoarthritis","Radiography","Reliability","Rosenberg","Skyline","Stress","Stress radiography","Valgus","Varus"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-23885D2A0B3067D1E1290068250026A3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/182941064/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jor.2021.05.014","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/285802184/1_s2.0_S0972978X21001227_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/435427078/Mortensen_et_al_2021_MRi_of_the_knee_compared_to_specialized_radiography_for_measurements_of_articular_cartilage_height_in_knees_with_osteoarthritis.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmar