{"abstract":"En introduktion til F.W.J Schellings hovedværk \"Den transcendentale idealismes system\" fra 1800 med en fremstilling af de historiske forudsætninger for værket samt en systematisk gennemgang af værkets hovedtanker.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders Moe","Rasmussen, Jesper Lundsfryd"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-193773"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"introduktion","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dbp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-193773","ids":["au-70dd2f5c-3b37-4316-81e4-3fbae3a98881"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E7859242A4E04112EA474B8241073C1D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Philosophy, subject"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark (SDU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Moe","key":"rasmussenandersmoepau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"e9773c7c-a46d-4591-b659-4151bea40a43","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Moe","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Lundsfryd","key":"rasmussenjesperlundsfrydpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Jesper Lundsfryd","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders Moe","key":"rasmussenandersmoepedh","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Moe","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristoffer","key":"willertkristofferpedh","last":"Willert","name":"Willert, Kristoffer","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788793041578"],"isbn":["9788793041561"],"pages":"13-51","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Forlaget Philosophia","status":"p","title":"Den transcendentale idealismes system"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-70dd2f5c-3b37-4316-81e4-3fbae3a98881"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Introduktion","type":"Book Preface, Encycl. Entry","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-193773","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: Our aim was to compare the diagnostic performance of quantitative dual-layer spectral computed tomography (DLSCT) and axillary ultrasound (US) for diagnosing lymph node metastases in breast cancer patients. Methods: DLSCT and axillary US were prospectively performed in 70 needle biopsy-verified breast cancer patients. Histopathology and imaging data were available for evaluation in 36 axillae from 34 patients. In each patient, ipsilateral, contralateral, and inguinal lymph nodes (LNs) were semiautomatically segmented, and iodine density, spectral slope, Z effective, virtual non-contrast (VNC), conventional CT HU values, and Δ contrast enhancement (ΔCE, conventional CT HU minus VNC) were measured. Using histopathology as reference, the diagnostic performance of DLSCT and axillary US was compared. Results: Of 36 axillae, 23 had metastatic lymph nodes. Compared with non-metastatic LNs, metastatic LNs had significantly different iodine density (p = 0.021), spectral slope (p < 0.001), Z effective (p < 0.001), conventional CT HU values (p < 0.01), and ΔCE (p < 0.01). All DLSCT parameters were significantly different between arterial phase and portal-venous phase (p < 0.001) except for VNC (p = 0.092). ΔCE had the highest diagnostic performance (sensitivity 0.79, specificity 0.92, positive predictive value 0.95, negative predictive value 0.69) with a significantly increased sensitivity compared with conventional CT HU (p = 0.027). There were no significant differences between ΔCE and axillary US for sensitivity (p = 1.000) or specificity (p = 0.320). Conclusions: DLSCT is a promising quantitative technique for evaluating LN metastases and could potentially reduce the need for sentinel LN biopsy.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Buus, Thomas Winther","Sandahl, Mads","Thorup, Kennet","Rasmussen, Finn","Redsted, Søren","Christiansen, Peer","Jensen, Anders Bonde","Pedersen, Erik Morre"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-250763"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Buus, Thomas Winther"],"keyword":["Axilla","Breast Neoplasms","Lymphatic Metastasis","Ultrasonography"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"breast cancer comparison of quantitative dual layer spectral ct and axillary ultrasonography for preoperative diagnosis of metastatic axillary lymph nodes","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s41747-021-00212-6","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-250763","identifier":[{"id":"85104084567","type":"scopus"},{"id":"33834317","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8032829","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-d4ad92da-364b-4afa-b716-29fedb5f1a4f"],"keyword":["Axilla","Breast neoplasms","Lymphatic metastasis","Tomography (x-ray","Ultrasonography","computed)"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-31408AF9C4DC27FE2289A29157B35332"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s41747-021-00212-6","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Radiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Winther","key":"buuspau","last":"Buus","locid":"ba41fa4b-3c35-4101-9145-13bbd7c6f503","name":"Buus, Thomas Winther","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads","key":"sandahlpau","last":"Sandahl","locid":"8b409dfd-c31e-42cf-9525-ad9d5ffc15fe","name":"Sandahl, Mads","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kennet Sønderstgaard","key":"thoruppau","last":"Thorup","locid":"553c96cd-3b3e-4721-9d18-1be53da825dc","name":"Thorup, Kennet","name_org":"Thorup, Kennet Sønderstgaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Finn","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"1c4dadf5-d001-4c6c-9f23-347af298c53d","name":"Rasmussen, Finn","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"redstedpau","last":"Redsted","locid":"38b754df-0d43-42fd-9aeb-967defc7c5b5","name":"Redsted, Søren","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peer","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"31f1ce54-ae25-4084-b4fc-798d3e0eb07d","name":"Christiansen, Peer","orcid":"0000-0003-2748-9240","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Bonde","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"bc1410f2-b563-4741-8f04-b019a2562102","name":"Jensen, Anders Bonde","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Morre","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"397a353e-5325-4d03-b334-b0841f4e8daf","name":"Pedersen, Erik Morre","orcid":"0000-0001-6798-3644","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33834317"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s41747-021-00212-6","issn":["25099280"],"issue":"1","journal":"European Radiology Experimental","paperid":"16","publisher":"Springer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH","status":"p","title":"European Radiology Experimental","volume":"5"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85104084567"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d4ad92da-364b-4afa-b716-29fedb5f1a4f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Breast cancer : comparison of quantitative dual-layer spectral CT and axillary ultrasonography for preoperative diagnosis of metastatic axillary lymph nodes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-250763","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Coronakrisen har kickstartet nordiske samarbejder indenfor forskning, uddannelse og innovation nedefra. Næste skridt er, at politikerne griber bolden og får samarbejdet på tværs af sektorer op i gear, skriver en række aktører.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Leth Andersen, Hanne","Blaabjerg, Frede","Bjarklev, Anders","Malchow-Møller, Nikolaj","Barlebo Rasmussen, Søren"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-296807"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danmarks Forsknings- og Innovationspolitiske Råd"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nye forskningssamarbejder i norden har brug for politisk opbakning","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","text":"Undefined","type":"url","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/aktoerer-nye-forskningssamarbejder-i-norden-har-brug-for-politisk-opbakning","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-296807","ids":["cbs-e1268514-e0d1-4b95-9148-a4324e0dd607"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-788C62AAE65C349BFA4513AAB4BFD637"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danmarks Forsknings- og 