{"abstract":"Severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 has caused a pandemic in humans. Farmed mink (Neovison vison) are also susceptible. In Denmark, this virus has spread rapidly among farmed mink, resulting in some respiratory disease. Full-length virus genome sequencing revealed novel virus variants in mink. These variants subsequently appeared within the local human community.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Hammer, Anne Sofie Vedsted","Quaade, Michelle Lauge","Rasmussen, Thomas Bruun","Fonager, Jannik","Rasmussen, Morten","Mundbjerg, Karin","Lohse, Louise","Strandbygaard, Bertel","Jørgensen, Charlotte Sværke","Alfaro-Núñez, Alonzo","Rosenstierne, Maiken Worsøe","Boklund, Anette","Halasa, Tariq","Fomsgaard, Anders","Belsham, Graham","Bøtner, Anette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-457549"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sars cov 000000000002 transmission between mink i neovison vison i and humans denmark","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3201/eid2702.203794","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-457549","identifier":[{"id":"PMC7853580","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"33207152","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85098704463","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-6b5eb949-23e0-4e13-85e4-2eb701f72237"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CF7757987F1CB889D1728210EF00F298"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/259671249/20_3794.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3201/eid2702.203794","version":"Published Ve