","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d0519afc-82c0-4d50-ae21-8ca7bf6be95a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Slope hydrology and permafrost : The effect of snowmelt N transport on downslope ecosystem","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-517891","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
