{"abstract":"I artiklen beskrives kort et nyt depotfund bestående af smykkegenstande fra yngre bronzealder, som i 2017 blev fundet med metaldetektor på Vestlolland.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-830375"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bronzealder","Depotfund","Metaldetektor"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"storkehøjfundet et spændende depotfund fra yngre bronzealder","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","text":"Undefined","type":"url","url":"https://kalejdoskop.atavist.com/storkehjfundet","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-830375","ids":["kum-5846b4d1-18b8-4408-ada4-9c49c73c72aa"],"keyword":["Bronzealder","Depotfund","Metaldetektor"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D8010C6594B9039E1560091244AB277E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, Museum Lolland-Falster"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"831558a0-727f-45a9-bbbb-8f8b30058802","name":"Rasmussen, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-6769-9122","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["kum-5846b4d1-18b8-4408-ada4-9c49c73c72aa"],"src":["KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark"],"title":"Storkehøjfundet : Et spændende depotfund fra yngre bronzealder","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-830375","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To describe spontaneous changes in time spent physically inactive measured continuously by accelerometry during an 8-week weight loss intervention in overweight/obese individuals with knee osteoarthritis. METHOD: This study was designed as an observational cohort study including individuals with concomitant overweight/obesity and symptomatic knee osteoarthritis from an osteoarthritis outpatient clinic. Participants completed an 8-week dietary intervention previously shown to induce substantial weight loss. The main outcome was accelerometer-based measurement of physical inactivity for 24 hours daily during the 8-week intervention period presented as change in the average daily time spent inactive (sitting, reclined or sleeping) from one week prior to intervention to the last week of the intervention. RESULTS: A total of 124 participants completed the dietary intervention and had valid accelerometer recordings. The mean weight loss was 12.7 kg [95% CI -13.2 to -12.1; P<.0001] after 8 weeks corresponding to a decrease in BMI of 4.3 kg/m2 [95%CI -4.5 to -4.2; P<.0001]. Significant improvements in osteoarthritis symptoms (assessed by the Knee Injury and Osteoarthritis Outcome Score) was found across all subscales; for KOOS pain an improvement of 12.8 points [95% CI, 10.6 to 15.0; P<.0001] was observed. No statistically significant change occurred in the average daily time spent inactive from baseline to follow-up (mean change: 8.8 minutes/day [95% CI, -12.1 to 29.7]; P=0.41). CONCLUSION: Physical inactivity remains stable despite a clinically significant weight loss and improvements in knee osteoarthritis symptoms. Change in inactivity does not seem to occur spontaneously, suggesting that focused efforts to reduce inactive behaviors are needed. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Bartholdy, Cecilie","Christensen, Robin","Kristensen, Lars Erik","Gudbergsen, Henrik","Bliddal, Henning","Overgaard, Anders","Rasmussen, Marianne U","Henriksen, Marius"],"cuid":["S02-097.29-040619"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association between weight loss and spontaneous changes in physical inactivity in overweight obese individuals with knee osteoarthritis an 000000000008 week prospective cohort study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/258826942/Association_between_weight_loss_and_spontaneous_changes_in_physical_inactivity_in_overweight_obese_individuals_with_knee_osteoarthritis_an_8_week_prospective_cohort_study_Acc._manuscript_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-097.29-040619","identifier":[{"id":"85079720281","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30821925","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-1b9ab9f1-ad1f-4ab9-8bd8-e66fc0b77450","sdu-ac6bbdfe-c86c-4981-bea9-fb46ec0ec56e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-78919966B54D4E4E398ACCD07BACB33C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/151604828/Association_between_weight_loss_and_spontaneous_changes_in_physical_inactivity_in_overweight_obese_individuals_with_knee_osteoarthritis.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/258826942/Association_between_weight_loss_and_spontaneous_changes_in_physical_inactivity_in_overweight_obese_individuals_with_knee_osteoarthritis_an_8_week_prospective_cohort_study_Acc._manuscript_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg Hospitals"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Rheumatology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Cecilie","key":"bartholdypau","last":"Bartholdy","name":"Bartholdy, Cecilie","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Robin","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"04bf2bf9-a6d8-4be8-93fd-82f3f2ddc9ba","name":"Christensen, Robin","orcid":"0000-0002-6600-0631","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","first":"Lars Erik","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"abb37858-fdb4-4151-a6d2-8b0d5b81141c","name":"Kristensen, Lars Erik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"gudbergsenpau","last":"Gudbergsen","name":"Gudbergsen, Henrik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","first":"Henning","key":"bliddalpau","last":"Bliddal","locid":"b9301e7d-d932-44d7-8fdc-b467e8ff1aa8","name":"Bliddal, Henning","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"overgaardpau","last":"Overgaard","name":"Overgaard, Anders","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne U","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Marianne U","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","first":"Marius","key":"henriksenpau","last":"Henriksen","locid":"0cadf7d6-9539-4ade-9bc4-98402453e742","name":"Henriksen, Marius","orcid":"0000-0003-1091-2962","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30821925"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/acr.23868","issn":["2151464X"],"issue":"3","journal":"Arthritis Care & Research","pages":"397-404","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"Arthritis Care & Research","volume":"72"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85079720281"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1b9ab9f1-ad1f-4ab9-8bd8-e66fc0b77450","sdu-ac6bbdfe-c86c-4981-bea9-fb46ec0ec56e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Association between weight loss and spontaneous changes in physical inactivity in overweight/obese individuals with knee osteoarthritis : An Eight-Week Prospective Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.29-040619","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Projektets formål er, på baggrund af data, at tjene som fagligt grundlag for en videnbaseret plan for en bæredygtig udvikling af erhvervs-, samfunds- og miljømæssige forhold og aktiviteter i det vestlige Kattegat. I rapporten er der opstillet fire scenarier for en bæredygtig udvikling i området. Resultaterne viser, at uanset hvilke scenarie man vælger, er der en række konflikter, muligheder for sameksistens og konsekvenser, som vil påvirke jobskabelse og økonomi. Resultaterne skal anvendes som grundlag for et høringssvar til den nationale havplan, som ni kommuner i Østjylland ønsker at indsende.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Riemann, Bo","Abay, Abrha Teklay","Ankjærø, Torben","Bruhn, Annette","Dahl, Karsten","Galatius, Anders","Göke, Cordula","Hasler, Berit","Jiminez, Elvia Rufus","Kaae, Berit Charlotte","Olafsson, Anton Stahl","Petersen, Ib Krag","Rasmussen, Michael Bo","Termansen, Mette","Zandersen, Marianne"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-013267"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["havplan"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"regional havplanlægning i det vestlige kattegat natur erhvervs og samfundsmæssige forhold og scenarier","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR403.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-013267","ids":["au-0935cb7b-d6c9-4c28-a8e2-ab352e0f2c78","ku-ac16c35d-4a7c-4ce7-bb78-2fd72a444c0d"],"keyword":["bæredygtig udvikling for erhvervs-, samfunds- og miljømæssige forhold i det vestlige Kattegat","havplan"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"