{"abstract":"I 1962 og 1963 udgraver det daværende Lolland-Falsters Stiftsmuseum resterne af en overpløjet gravhøj ved byen Udstolpe, nogle få kilometer syd for Sakskøbing. Efter at have afdækket tomten fra gravhøjen står det klart for museets folk, at der foran dem ligger resterne af Lollands hidtil eneste gravhøj med to separate jættestuekamre, hver anlagt i forlængelse af hinanden med hver deres indgang. I højfylden ligger adskillige menneskeknogler og oldsager af rav, ben, flint og keramik, hvilket alle vidner om, at kamrene i begge jættestuer har været flittigt brugt i bondestenalderen, hvor fortidsmindet blev opført.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-546800"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Lolland Falster"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kirkehøj en enestående jættestue fra lolland","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-546800","ids":["kum-19166699-4ccc-4b0b-83ab-057d8dd3f19b"],"keyword":["Lolland-Falster"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-406F33C474445A15CAC58811F0540FAC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, Museum Lolland-Falster"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","