All Universities","Carlsberg","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","ecolab aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-133ff575-28ab-418f-9b79-e3b4f5e88868"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Anomaly Analysis in Cleaning-in-Place Operations of an Industrial Brewery Fermenter","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-310387","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Battery electric vehicles (BEVs) play an important role in the increasing effort by governments to curtail the pollution from the transport sector and reduce the dependence from fossil fuels of internal combustion engine vehicles (ICEVs). Although traffic assignment models exist for BEVs, the assumption of shortest path search on the basis of time constrained by energy consumption does not have any empirical basis. The current paper presents a revealed preference study of route choice behaviour of drivers participating in a large-scale experiment with BEVs. Observed routes while driving BEVs and ICEVs were map matched and a joint route choice model was specified and estimated to reveal whether the type of vehicle is related to the preference structure. Significantly different parameters for trip length for BEV and ICEV are obtained in the model estimation, indicating a higher sensitivity to the distance travelled when driving BEVs. Moreover, the level of charge of the battery and the travel in the morning peak make drivers less sensitive to distance. The findings from this study suggest the need to revise the cost functions in the literature about traffic assignment with BEVs as these functions should not consider similar parameters regardless of the vehicle type, but instead a higher sensitivity to distance that reflects heterogeneity in driving behaviour with BEVs.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Jensen, Anders Fjendbo","Rasmussen, Thomas Kjær","Prato, Carlo G."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-374117"],"event":{"end":"2018-01-11","place":"Washington DC, us","start":"2018-01-07","title":"Transportation Research Board 97th Annual Meeting","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a joint route choice model for capturing preferences of electric and conventional car drivers","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-374117","ids":["dtu-e88649a8-f320-401a-8fec-8a697eba82e5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3ED52E35BD2F15B1EAEE197E32BE78FB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport DTU","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport Modelling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Fjendbo","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a2c7f544-715a-412f-9cb7-cd660c27004b","name":"Jensen, Anders Fjendbo","orcid":"0000-0002-1952-7617","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Kjær","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"6499d80a-6f70-4824-91c8-d34b630c2e24","name":"Rasmussen, Thomas Kjær","orcid":"0000-0003-0979-9667","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Carlo G.","key":"pratopau","last":"Prato","name":"Prato, Carlo G.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e88649a8-f320-401a-8fec-8a697eba82e5"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"A Joint Route Choice Model for Capturing Preferences of Electric and Conventional Car Drivers","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-374117","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Professor i etik ved Roskilde Universitet, Thomas Søbirk Petersen, argumenterer for at legalisere doping i en ny bog. Vi mener ikke, at dette er forsvarligt, og vil her fremhæve videnskabelig evidens, der underbygger dette udsagn. Vi vil dog gøre opmærksom på, at vi bl.a. modtager økonomisk støtte fra diverse anti-doping organisationer. Vi mener alligevel at kunne levere et nuanceret billede af konsekvenserne ved dopingmisbrug.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Breenfeldt Andersen, Andreas","Rasmussen, Jon Jarløv","Bejder, Jacob","Juul, Anders","Hostrup, Morten","Solheim, Sara Amalie","Bonne, Thomas Christian","Nordsborg, Nikolai Baastrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-399566"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Det Natur og Biovidenskabelige Fakultet","Doping","Legalisering","Risikovurdering"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Anti Doping Danmark, Brøndby"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"legalisering af doping er uforsvarligt og praktisk umuligt","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/kronikker/legalisering-af-doping-er-uforsvarligt-og-praktisk-umuligt","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-399566","ids":["ku-0a2bbc9d-cecc-4f96-9d17-7ac48412a031"],"keyword":["Det Natur- og Biovidenskabelige Fakultet","Doping","Legalisering","Risikovurdering","Sundhedsrisiko"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9DC751395997161C7304905D998EF576"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["D