{"abstract":"Aims: Contemporary data regarding atrial fibrillation (AF) management and current use of oral anticoagulants (OACs) for stroke prevention are needed. Methods and results: The EURObservational Research Programme on AF (EORP-AF) Long-Term General Registry analysed consecutive AF patients presenting to cardiologists in 250 centres from 27 European countries. From 2013 to 2016, 11 096 patients were enrolled (40.7% female; mean age 69 ± 11 years). At discharge, OACs were used in 9379 patients (84.9%), with non-vitamin K antagonists (NOACs) accounting for 40.9% of OACs. Antiplatelet therapy alone was used by 20% of patients, while no antithrombotic treatment was prescribed in 6.4%. On multivariable analysis, age, hypertension, previous ischaemic stroke, symptomatic AF and planned cardioversion or ablation were independent predictors of OAC use, whereas lone AF, previous haemorrhagic events, chronic kidney disease and admission for acute coronary syndrome (ACS) or non-cardiovascular causes independently predicted OAC non-use. Regarding the OAC type, coronary artery disease, history of heart failure, or valvular heart disease, planned cardioversion and non-AF reasons for admission independently predicted the use of vitamin K antagonists (VKAs). Wide variability among the European regions was observed in the use of NOACs, independently from other clinical factors. Conclusion: The EORP-AF Long-Term General Registry provides a full picture of contemporary use of OAC in European AF patients. The overall rate of OACs use was generally high (84.9%), and a series of factors were associated with the prescription of OAC. A significant geographical heterogeneity in prescription of NOACs vs. VKAs was evident.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Boriani, Giuseppe","Proietti, Marco","Laroche, Cécile","Fauchier, Laurent","Marin, Francisco","Nabauer, Michael","Potpara, Tatjana","Dan, Gheorghe-Andrei","Kalarus, Zbigniew","Diemberger, Igor","Tavazzi, Luigi","Maggioni, Aldo P","Lip, Gregory Y H","Joensen, Albert Marni","Gammelmark, Anders","Rasmussen, Lars Hvilsted","Dinesen, Pia Thisted","Riahi, Sam","Venø, Stine Krogh","Sørensen, Bodil Ginnerup","Korsgaard, Anne Marie","Andersen, Karen Petrea","Hellum, Camilla Fragtrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-091309"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corpau":["EORP-AF Long-Term General Registry Investigators"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Birmingham"],"keyword":["Atrial fibrillation","Epidemiology","Journal Article","Mortality","Registry","Stroke","Thromboembolic risk"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"contemporary stroke prevention strategies in 000000000011 000000000096 european patients with atrial fibrillation a report from the eurobservational research programme on atrial fibrillation eorp af long term general registry","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85046996464&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-091309","identifier":[{"id":"29016832","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85046996464","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8de782dc-ba6b-4163-a821-678ad91b0f21"],"keyword":["Atrial fibrillation","Epidemiology","Journal Article","Mortality","Registry","Stroke","Thromboembolic risk"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-81DAA0EF5DC345EA4FA1E01C44716200"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1},{"affno":3,"key":"eorp af long term general registry investigators","name":"EORP-AF Long-Term General Registry Investigators","role":"oau"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Giuseppe","key":"borianipau","last":"Boriani","name":"Boriani, Giuseppe","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marco","key":"proiettipau","last":"Proietti","name":"Proietti, Marco","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Cécile","key":"larochepau","last":"Laroche","name":"Laroche, Cécile","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Laurent","key":"fauchierpau","last":"Fauchier","name":"Fauchier, Laurent","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Francisco","key":"marinpau","last":"Marin","name":"Marin, Francisco","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"nabauerpau","last":"Nabauer","name":"Nabauer, Michael","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Tatjana","key":"potparapau","last":"Potpara","name":"Potpara, Tatjana","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Gheorghe-Andrei","key":"danpau","last":"Dan","name":"Dan, Gheorghe-Andrei","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Zbigniew","key":"kalaruspau","last":"Kalarus","name":"Kalarus, Zbigniew","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Igor","key"