{"abstract":"Mange byer investerer i at forbedre transportnettet, så det bedre tilgodeser cyklister. Cykeltransport indgår imidlertid fortsat meget forsimplet i de fleste transportmodeller. Så der er ikke samme grundige grundlag for at vurdere cykelprojekter, som der er for vej og kollektiv trafik. På DTU arbejder vi derfor på at forbedre rutevalgsmodeller for cyklister, så de bl.a. kan tage højde for stigninger, omgivelser og stitype samt cyklisters individuelle præferencer.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jensen, Anders Fjendbo","Fernández Palao, Andrés","Nielsen, Otto Anker","Rasmussen, Thomas Kjær"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-325934"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Jensen, Anders Fjendbo"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modellering af cykeltrafik","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/164670882/9142.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-325934","ids":["dtu-47d42700-ef69-40b9-b230-1766c36f3bf4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F9C84B95046346A04FEEFAD42DAEC807"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/201156863/Transportmodeller_Cykelrutevalg_V8_opdateretTabel_V2.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/164670882/9142.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport DTU","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport Modelling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Fjendbo","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a2c7f544-715a-412f-9cb7-cd660c27004b","name":"Jensen, Anders Fjendbo","orcid":"0000-0002-1952-7617","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrés","key":"fernándezpalaopau","last":"Fernández Palao","locid":"07832e27-4ddf-4d2a-a652-5b40a4da5a57","name":"Fernández Palao, Andrés","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Otto Anker","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0b46cbc2-23db-4c0b-bc64-91094ef11adb","name":"Nielsen, Otto Anker","orcid":"0000-0001-7901-7021","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Kjær","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"6499d80a-6f70-4824-91c8-d34b630c2e24","name":"Rasmussen, Thomas Kjær","orcid":"0000-0003-0979-9667","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19037384"],"journal":"Trafik & Veje","pages":"8-12","publisher":"Dansk Vejtidsskrift ApS","status":"p","title":"Trafik & Veje","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-47d42700-ef69-40b9-b230-1766c36f3bf4"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Modellering af cykeltrafik","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-325934","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"This report serves as an example report on how to perform an LCA according to the guidance given in Chap. 37 and how to structure the report according to the reporting template in Chap. 38. The goals of the LCA were (i) to perform a benchmarking of a prototype wood/composite (W/C) window made out of glass fibre against three alternative window types currently offered in the market (made of wood (W), wood/aluminium (W/ALU), and PVC) and (ii) to identify environmental hotspots for each window system.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Owsianiak, Mikołaj","Bjørn, Anders","Bugge, Heidi","Carvalho, Sónia","Jebahar, Leise","Rasmussen, Jon Holbech","White, Caroline","Olsen, Stig Irving"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-333403"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"edu","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"illustrative case study life cycle assessment of four window alternatives","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85037629847","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-333403","identifier":[{"id":"85037629847","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-60df04f2-a7db-4bb2-980e-30fd3f0b67cf"],"lang":"English","level":"Educational","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BF298B5E1A8F9FFC2A3BCC582F833FA0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"pers