rs Bo","orcid":"0000-0001-8739-680X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anne Schou","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"1c02512e-802e-49d5-a1ae-5ff6353c424e","name":"Hansen, Anne Schou","orcid":"0000-0002-6285-586X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mads Georg","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Mads Georg","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik Grum","key":"kjærgaardpau","last":"Kjærgaard","locid":"ba186a2f-7300-4f50-8112-232ae6eb0f09","name":"Kjærgaard, Henrik Grum","orcid":"0000-0002-7275-8297","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kurt Valentin","key":"mikkelsenpau","last":"Mikkelsen","locid":"bf3a0546-2072-435f-a306-d2dffbd5ef15","name":"Mikkelsen, Kurt V.","name_org":"Mikkelsen, Kurt Valentin","orcid":"0000-0003-4090-7697","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mogens Brøndsted","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d5a042aa-d63e-45b0-a022-f3de910fde75","name":"Nielsen, Mogens Brøndsted","orcid":"0000-0001-8377-0788","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28853882"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.joc.7b01760","issn":["00223263","15206904"],"issn_org":["00223263"],"issue":"19","journal":"Journal of Organic Chemistry","pages":"10398-10407","status":"p","title":"Journal of Organic Chemistry","title_org":"The Journal of Organic Chemistry","volume":"82"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85047490720"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-11443134-b87d-42ee-aefe-f1d61c242008"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Photoswitchable Dihydroazulene Macrocycles for Solar Energy Storage : The Effects of Ring Strain","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-403662","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Coronary artery disease (CAD) is a leading cause of morbidity and mortality worldwide. Although 58 genomic regions have been associated with CAD thus far, most of the heritability is unexplained, indicating that additional susceptibility loci await identification. An efficient discovery strategy may be larger-scale evaluation of promising associations suggested by genome-wide association studies (GWAS). Hence, we genotyped 56,309 participants using a targeted gene array derived from earlier GWAS results and performed meta-analysis of results with 194,427 participants previously genotyped, totaling 88,192 CAD cases and 162,544 controls. We identified 25 new SNP-CAD associations (P < 5 × 10(-8), in fixed-effects meta-analysis) from 15 genomic regions, including SNPs in or near genes involved in cellular adhesion, leukocyte migration and atherosclerosis (PECAM1, rs1867624), coagulation and inflammation (PROCR, rs867186 (p.Ser219Gly)) and vascular smooth muscle cell differentiation (LMOD1, rs2820315). Correlation of these regions with cell-type-specific gene expression and plasma protein levels sheds light on potential disease mechanisms.","author_count":54,"contributors":["Howson, Joanna M. M.","Zhao, Wei","Barnes, Daniel R","Ho, Weang Kee","Young, Robin","Paul, Dirk S","Waite, Lindsay","Freitag, Daniel F","Fauman, Eric B","Salfati, Elias L","Sun, Benjamin B","Eicher, John D","Johnson, Andrew D","Sheu, Wayne H-H","Nielsen, Sune F","Lin, Wei-Yu","Surendran, Praveen","Malarstig, Anders","Wilk, Jemma B","Tybjærg-Hansen, Anne","Rasmussen, Katrine L","Kamstrup, Pia R","Deloukas, Panos","Erdmann, Jeanette","Kathiresan, Sekar","Samani, Nilesh J","Schunkert, Heribert","Watkins, Hugh","Do, Ron","Rader, Daniel J","Johnson, Julie A","Hazen, Stanley L","Quyyumi, Arshed A","Spertus, John A","Pepine, Carl J","Franceschini, Nora","Justice, Anne E","Reiner, Alex P","Buyske, Steven","Hindorff, Lucia A","Carty, Cara L","North, Kari E","Kooperberg, Charles","Boerwinkle, Eric","Young, Kristin L","Graff, Mariaelisa","Peters, Ulrike","Absher, Devin","Hsiung, Chao A","Nordestgaard, Børge G","Assimes, Themistocles L","Danesh, J","Butterworth, Adam S","Saleheen, D"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-445682"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["CARDIoGRAMplusC4D","EPIC-CVD Consortium"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fifteen new risk loci for coronary artery disease highlight arterial wall specific mechanisms","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-445682","identifier":[{"id":"85021756461","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28530674","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5555387","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-57663103-4cdc-4f34-a677-b2e94a9c52f1"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-ED8A2E339697D606CBF052BC1C8D303E"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Clinical Biochemistry","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Regi