gen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-8af073db-83a7-4a56-ab65-5dc20e236099","ku-de1886db-b957-425b-8288-a4e12159bf8a","sdu-47915075-8519-42c8-b2ad-ad8b4285f513"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Genomic Epidemiology of a Major <i>Mycobacterium tuberculosis</i> Outbreak : Retrospective Cohort Study in a Low-Incidence Setting Using Sparse Time-Series Sampling","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-096.47-035784","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Helminthic therapy of immune-mediated diseases has gained attention in recent years, but we know little of how helminths modulate human immunity. In this study, we investigated how self-infection with Trichuris (T.) trichiura in an adult man without intestinal disease affected mucosal and systemic immunity. Colonic mucosal biopsies were obtained at baseline, during T. trichiura infection, and after its clearance following mebendazole treatment. Unexpectedly, the volunteer experienced a Campylobacter colitis following T. trichiura clearance, and this served as a positive infectious control. Trichuris trichiura colonization induced equally increased expressions of T-helper (h)1-, Th2-, Th17- and Treg-associated cytokines and transcription factors, measured by quantitative polymerase chain reaction. We observed several indicators of modulation of systemic immunity during the T. trichiura infection. Plasma eosinophils and anti-Trichuris antibodies rose markedly during the inoculation phase, and a shift towards a Th2-dominated T cell response at the expense of the Th1-response was observed in circulating T cells. Taken together, our findings corroborate that helminths modulate regional and systemic human immunity.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Dige, Anders","Rasmussen, Tue Kruse","Nejsum, Peter","Hagemann-Madsen, Rikke","Williams, Andrew R","Agnholt, Jørgen","Dahlerup, Jens Frederik","Hvas, Christian Lodberg"],"cuid":["S03-099.29-015553"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Adult","Animals","Campylobacter Infections","Case Reports","Cytokines","Helminths","Humans","Immunity Mucosal","Immunology","Intestinal Mucosa","Journal Article","Male","Mebendazole","T Lymphocytes Regulatory","Trichuriasis","Trichuris"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mucosal and systemic immune modulation by trichuris trichiura in a self infected individual","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85006927651","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-099.29-015553","identifier":[{"id":"27743501","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85006927651","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-28a44b0f-b731-44d1-b42a-a6ef2b180f37","ku-c6aa1f04-81f2-43ac-a23c-2c8b5f8eeab3","sdu-7ed0f62d-a01a-4e33-b11c-19abe3e07948"],"keyword":["Adult","Animals","Campylobacter Infections","Case Reports","Cytokines","Humans","Immunity, Mucosal","Intestinal Mucosa","Journal Article","Male","Mebendazole","T-Lymphocytes, Regulatory","Trichuriasis","Trichuris","helminths","immunology","trichiura"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-D38329FF0FD799197DF2F387A8EB0B47"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Hepatology and Gastroenterology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l