{"abstract":"The reaction mechanism of dimethyl ether carbonylation to methyl acetate over mordenite was studied theoretically with periodic density functional theory calculations including dispersion forces and experimentally in a fixed bed flow reactor at pressures between 10 and 100 bar, dimethyl ether concentrations in CO between 0.2 and 2.0%, and at a temperature of 438 K. The theoretical study showed that the reaction of CO with surface methyl groups, the rate-limiting step, is faster in the eight-membered side pockets than in the twelve-membered main channel of the zeolite; the subsequent reaction of dimethyl ether with surface acetyl to form methyl acetate was demonstrated to occur with low energy barriers in both the side pockets and in the main channel. The present analysis has thus identified a path, where the entire reaction occurs favourably on a single site within the side pocket, in good agreement with previous experimental studies. The experimental study of the reaction kinetics was consistent with the theoretically derived mechanism and in addition revealed that the methyl acetate product inhibits the reaction - possibly by sterically hindering the attack of CO on the methyl groups in the side pockets.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Dominik Bjørn","Christensen, Jakob Munkholt","Temel, B.","Studt, F.","Moses, P.G.","Rossmeisl, Jan","Riisager, Anders","Jensen, Anker Degn"],"cuid":["S02-093.09-037153"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","SLAC National Accelerator Laboratory","SUNCAT Center for Interface Science and Catalysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-HLT"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-HLT","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reaction mechanism of dimethyl ether carbonylation to methyl acetate over mordenite a combined dft experimental study","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/202200455/Reaction_mechanism_of_dimethyl_ether_carbonylation_to_methyl_acetate_over_mordenite_2017_accepted.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-093.09-037153","identifier":[{"id":"85026881479","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ca4227e8-0f3b-4b2d-b5af-88824bb96236","ku-adf8c553-bc83-45e9-b641-6087f963bebc"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-9C9F2070A66715FC0AF02D6B926A46B3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/202200455/Reaction_mechanism_of_dimethyl_ether_carbonylation_to_methyl_acetate_over_mordenite_2017_accepted.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151673123/1353213.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"topsoe","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-HLT","l3nl":"Haldor Topsoe","l3nn":"Topsoe","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Topsoe","namevar":["Haldor Topsoe AS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-HLT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"slac national accelerator laboratory","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"SLAC National Accelerator Laboratory","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"suncat center for interface science and catalysis","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"SUNCAT Center for Interface Science and Catalysis","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dominik Bjørn","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"ee97b3cd-8660-4999-acbd-871120ce5a66","name":"Rasmussen, Dominik Bjørn","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob Munkholt","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"6f21553f-2138-4351-ac60-3eb41d7d88fa","name":"Christensen, Jakob Munkholt","orcid":"0000-0002-2495-8905","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B.","key":"temelpau","last":"Temel","name":"Temel, B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"F.","key":"studtpau","last":"Studt","name":"Studt, F.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"P.G.","key":"mosespau","last":"Moses","name":"Moses, P.G.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 5","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"rossmeislpau","last":"Rossmeisl","locid":"b4106c7a-279d-4625-bf64-b07389264fef","name":"Rossmeisl, Jan","orcid":"0000-0001-7749-6567","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"riisagerpau","last":"Riisager","locid":"ccf85ca7-c97b-48e6-bfa8-30ea97d6e9b8","name":"Riisager, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-7086-1143","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anker Degn","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"cbdc5a0f-1286-4071-bb03-0e1be55ff36f","name":"Jensen, Anker Degn","orcid":"0000-0002-7341-4859","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c6cy01904h","issn":["20444753","20444761"],"issn_org":["20444753"],"issue":"5","journal":"Catalysis Science & Technology","pages":"1141-1152","publisher":"Royal Society of Chemistry","status":"p","title":"Catalysis Science & Technology","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85026881479"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Haldor Topsoe","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-ca4227e8-0f3b-4b2d-b5af-88824bb96236","ku-adf8c553-bc83-45e9-b641-6087f963bebc"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Reaction mechanism of dimethyl ether carbonylation to methyl acetate over mordenite : a combined DFT/experimental study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-093.09-037153","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Background: Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of death in renal transplant recipients. An association between haptoglobin genotype 2-2 and cardiovascular disease has been found in patients with diabetes mellitus and liver transplant recipients. To date, the role of haptoglobin genotype after renal transplantation has not been studied. Methods: In this single-center retrospective cohort study of 1975 adult Norwegian transplant recipients, who underwent transplantation between 1999 and 2011, we estimated the risk of all-cause and cardiovascular mortality and overall and death-censored graft loss for patients with haptoglobin genotype 2-2 compared to genotype 2-1 or 1-1, after adjustment for confounders and competing risks. Results: We found no associations between haptoglobin genotype 2-2 and cardiovascular mortality (subdistributional hazard ratio 1.08, 95% confidence interval 0.78-1.49; P = .63). We also failed to detect any association between haptoglobin 2-2 genotype and all-cause mortality, overall graft loss, and death-censored graft loss. Similar results were found in the subpopulation of transplant recipients with diabetes. Conclusion: In this large cohort of kidney transplant recipients, we could not demonstrate any association between haptoglobin 2-2 genotype and patient or graft survival after renal transplantation.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Dupont, Laust","Eide, Ivar Anders","Hartmann, Anders","Christensen, Jeppe Hagstrup","Åsberg, Anders","Jenssen, Trond","Krarup, Henrik","Svensson, My"],"cuid":["S02-093.18-011256"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Oslo University Hospital","University of Oslo"],"keyword":["Cardiovascular System","Cardiovascular disease","Haptoglobin genotype","Kidney transplantation recipients","Mortality","Oxidative stress","Renal graft loss"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"haptoglobin 000000000002 000000000002 genotype patient and graft survival in renal transplant recipients","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1526924817732020","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-093.18-011256","identifier":[{"id":"29187131","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85037036665","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000414998000010","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-eb9341fa-e5e8-416e-bde0-cdcbc8f751d9","au-71065e1c-871a-41f8-b5dc-47faed432f71"],"keyword":["cardiovascular disease","cardiovascular system","haptoglobin genotype","kidney transplantation recipients","mortality","oxidative stress","renal graft loss"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-37F140B9277B8448F5ADAE042670E9C2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1526924817732020","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Medicine and Nephrology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Nyremedicin (Nefrologi) [Klinik Medicin]"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"oslo university hospital","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Oslo University Hospital","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Laust Dupont","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"23844c22-78ab-4e12-b8cf-99f5d3626de0","name":"Rasmussen, Laust Dupont","orcid":"0000-0002-2790-2608","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Laust","key":"dupontpau","last":"Dupont","name":"Dupont, Laust","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ivar Anders","key":"eidepau","last":"Eide","name":"Eide, Ivar Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Eide","key":"ivaranderspau","last":"Ivar Anders","name":"Ivar Anders, Eide","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"hartmannpau","last":"Hartmann","name":"Hartmann, Anders","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jeppe Hagstrup","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"8b0514a3-d3aa-4fa6-acd2-2d32e219593f","name":"Christensen, Jeppe Hagstrup","orcid":"0000-0003-1208-833X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"åsbergpau","last":"Åsberg","name":"Åsberg, Anders","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trond","key":"jenssenpau","last":"Jenssen","name":"Jenssen, Trond","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1",