{"abstract":"I den tyske idealisme blev der tænkt nogle af de mest komplekse og smukke tanker, menneskeheden har præsteret, om mennesket, åndelighed, frihed, og virkelighed, og ikke at forglemme GUDI denne antologi giver en række en af landets forskere i idealismen kvalificerede bud på, hvorledes de idealistiske og post-idealistiske filosoffers tanker udviklede sig i dialog med hinanden, og hvorfor det endnu er filosofisk højaktuelt at beskæftige sig med idealismen","author_count":2,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders Moe","Ziethen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-071081"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Filosoffer","Filosofi","Idealisme"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"system frihed og virkelighed en indføring i den tyske idealismes hovedpositioner","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://ereolen.dk/ting/object/870970-basis%3A52494451","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-071081","ids":["aau-4880f2d4-61a6-46a6-9080-f824c34023a4"],"keyword":["Filosofi","filosoffer","idealisme"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3448E813807AA4A820AD03F4649F7E96"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Center for Applied Philosophy (Learning)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Moe","key":"rasmussenped","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Moe","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"ziethenped","last":"Ziethen","locid":"426d64e7-50c8-4484-becd-62b23777ac4a","name":"Ziethen, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-3826-7344","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788793041356"],"pages":"256","publisher":"Forlaget Philosophia","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-4880f2d4-61a6-46a6-9080-f824c34023a4"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"System, frihed og virkelighed : En indføring i den tyske idealismes hovedpositioner","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-071081","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: To evaluate effectiveness and safety of rivaroxaban versus warfarin or dabigatran etexilate in a prospective cohort of routine care non-valvular atrial fibrillation (AF) patients during February 2012 to August 2014. METHODS: We identified in nationwide health registries a cohort of AF patients who were new-users of rivaroxaban 15 mg (R15) or 20 mg (R20); dabigatran 110 mg (D110) or 150 mg (D150); or warfarin. Propensity-adjusted Cox regression was used to compare outcome rates in four settings: 'R15 vs. warfarin'; 'R15 vs. D110'; 'R20 vs. warfarin'; and 'R20 vs. D150'. RESULTS: Rivaroxaban users (R15: n = 776; R20: n = 1629) were older and with more comorbidities than warfarin (n = 11 045) and dabigatran users (D110: n = 3588; D150: n = 5320). Rivaroxaban 15-mg users had the overall highest crude mortality rate. After propensity adjustment, rivaroxaban had lower stroke rates vs. warfarin (R15: hazard ratio [HR] 0.46, 95% confidence interval [CI]: 0.26-0.82; R20 HR: 0.72, 95%CI: 0.51-1.01), and similar stroke rates vs. dabigatran. The bleeding rate was similar to warfarin and moderately higher vs. dabigatran (R15 vs. D110 HR: 1.28, 95%CI: 0.82-2.01; R20 vs. D150 HR: 1.81, 95%CI: 1.25-2.62). The mortality rate was higher vs. dabigatran (R15 vs. D110 HR: 1.43, 95%CI: 1.13-1.81; R20 vs. D150 HR: 1.52, 95%CI: 1.06-2.19). CONCLUSIONS: Rivaroxaban was associated with similar or lower stroke rates, but higher bleeding and mortality rates. Channeling of rivaroxaban towards elderly and less healthy patients may have generated residual confounding. In particular, our findings cannot stand alone when deciding which oral anticoagulant to prescribe. Copyright © 2016 John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","Lip, Gregory Y H","Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-072818"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","City Hospital in Birmingham","University of Birmingham"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rivaroxaban versus warfarin and dabigatran in atrial fibrillation comparative effectiveness and safety in danish routine care","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-072818","identifier":[{"id":"27229855","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84971287271","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000387124000003","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-4e9749ea-5d73-4789-8ee4-85bad94c89b4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-70057E6EB84B3706F5D54FC1DBF92D3B"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Forskning, Uddannelse og Innovation","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Unit of Clinical Biostatistics","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"city hospital in birmingham","loc":[