gh-risk copy number variants affecting the dopamine transporter gene in mental disorders","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-506706","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"CONTEXT: Follistatin is a liver-derived inhibitor of the muscle-growth inhibitor myostatin. Reduction in acute follistatin release may help explain muscle loss in liver cirrhosis. OBJECTIVE: The study aimed to investigate the capacity of acute follistatin release in patients with liver cirrhosis compared to healthy control participants. DESIGN, SETTING, AND PARTICIPANTS: To experimentally increase the glucagon-insulin ratio (mimicking the hormonal effect of exercise), we infused glucagon/somatostatin (to inhibit insulin secretion) and compared the acute follistatin increase in eight male cirrhosis patients with eight healthy control participants. Patients and controls received 1-hour glucagon/somatostatin and saline infusions on 2 separate days. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURE: Follistatin was measured during and 5 hours after termination of infusions. RESULTS: The peak follistatin change was significantly decreased in patients with liver cirrhosis compared to healthy control participants (1.9 (interquartile range, 1.4-2.5) versus 3.6 (interquartile range, 3.0-4.0), respectively; P = .003). Patients with liver cirrhosis demonstrated significantly decreased amounts of appendicular lean mass compared to healthy controls (27.6 ± 3.8 vs 34.5 ± 2.9%, respectively; P = .001). CONCLUSIONS: Patients with cirrhosis show impaired capacity to acutely secrete follistatin. The decrease in acute follistatin release may contribute to the loss of muscle mass in liver cirrhosis.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rinnov, Anders Rasmussen","Plomgaard, Peter","Pedersen, Bente Klarlund","Gluud, Lise Lotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-524813"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"impaired follistatin secretion in cirrhosis","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-524813","identifier":[{"id":"84981251762","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27399349","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-dbfac705-1fb7-47c5-85ea-0544bf8575f7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-481DF374D7B083BD044EA4F948B8BBE0"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Anders Rasmussen","key":"rinnovpau","last":"Rinnov","name":"Rinnov, Anders Rasmussen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"plomgaardpau","last":"Plomgaard","name":"Plomgaard, Peter","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Bente Klarlund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"5d38d54e-e0d1-4397-98ca-6d8c9b78606d","name":"Pedersen, Bente Klarlund","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lise Lotte","key":"gluudpau","last":"Gluud","locid":"5f316a6f-fef0-44ac-ad8d-522731684721","name":"Gluud, Lise Lotte","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27399349"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1210/jc.2016-1923","issn":["0021972X","19457197"],"issn_org":["0021972X"],"issue":"9","journal":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","pages":"3395-3400","status":"p","title":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","title_org":"The Journal of clinical endocrinology and metabolism","volume":"101"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84981251762"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-dbfac705-1fb7-47c5-85ea-0544bf8575f7"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Impaired Follistatin Secretion in Cirrhosis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-524813","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
