{"abstract":"I dag foregår mange kriminelle handlinger via internettet uden at der sættes mange spor i den fysiske verden. Samtidig kender internettet i sagens natur ingen grænser, og det giver udfordringer både for lovgiver, politi, anklagemyndighed og den enkelte borger.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Langsted, Lars Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-107814"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cybercrime","Jurisdiktion"],"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"it kriminalitet kender ingen grænser","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dkr.dk/media/9781/naar-forbrydelser-bliver-digitale.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-107814","ids":["aau-c702bff2-fa80-4438-8f4a-c6ed2744a739"],"keyword":["cybercrime","jurisdiktion"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0926FC59D9B27FB65FA1B23451DD679E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dkr.dk/media/9781/naar-forbrydelser-bliver-digitale.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Center for Cyberkriminalitet og Cybersikkerhed","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Human