tz, Anders Juul","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Signe M. U.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Signe M. U.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sabine Karin","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","locid":"07d8e99f-7f00-4412-bd68-57c9cc3b1f9d","name":"Clausen, Sabine Karin","orcid":"0000-0003-0947-968X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Bjarne","key":"jørnsgårdpau","last":"Jørnsgård","name":"Jørnsgård, Bjarne","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren Kjærsgaard","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"95b8db6a-2621-49dc-bf1f-dbba5884b8da","name":"Rasmussen, Søren Kjærsgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-6169-2504","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sven Bode","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"553a5564-bac9-49ce-91d5-18e88f7dccf6","name":"Andersen, Sven Bode","orcid":"0000-0001-5063-4122","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Åsmund","key":"rinnanpau","last":"Rinnan","locid":"dabc01b5-a8ad-49b8-8971-5a27722e4f7d","name":"Rinnan, Åsmund","orcid":"0000-0002-7754-7720","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26988469"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.foodchem.2016.02.107","issn":["03088146","18737072"],"issn_org":["03088146"],"journal":"Food Chemistry","pages":"7-13","status":"p","title":"Food Chemistry","volume":"204"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84959018994"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ff3e410b-e322-4720-bb02-4df3a4613132"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Fast, cross cultivar determination of total carotenoids in intact carrot, tissue by Raman spectroscopy and Partial Least Squares calibration","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-545714","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The American Civil War, 1861-1865, broke out during a time of intense debate over slavery and fear of foreign-born influence on American society. The war’s outbreak, however, provided both freedmen and immigrants an opportunity to prove their loyalty to the United States. Scandinavian Americans, among other ethnic groups, seized the opportunity. This article argues that the Scandinavian elite implicitly constructed at least three different forms of ethnic identity – here termed exclusive, political, and national – to spur enlistment at the ground level, gain political influence, and demonstrate American allegiance. In the process the Scandinavian war effort strengthened these immigrant soldiers’ ties to their adopted nation, while a political ethnic identity, initially constructed in opposition to other ethnic groups, was weakened by the Scandinavians’ experience in the American multiethnic military crucible. The Civil War thereby hastened Scandinavian immigrants’ path towards the American mainstream, where many veterans subsequently served as a bridge between their local communities and broader American society, and reinforced their belief in American civic nationalism.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-613969"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Americanization","Civic Nationalism","Civil war","Ethnic identity","Ethnicity","Immigrants","Immigration","Scandinavianism","Whiteness"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"drawn together in a blood brotherhood civic nationalism amongst scandinavian immigrants in the american civil war crucible","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22439/asca.v48i2.5450","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-613969","identifier":[{"id":"85018171904","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-8e3a9d46-3b48-4575-b9e3-3a806b4bb305"],"keyword":["Americanization","Civic Nationalism","Civil War","Ethnic identity","Ethnicity","Immigrants","Immigration","Scandinavian Americans","Scandinavianism","Whiteness"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8117B340B0712A88EBF9EEDFE1DF9AE0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22439/asca.v48i2.5450","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/135436080/Drawn_Together_in_a_Blood_Brotherhood.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Culture and Language, Uses of Literature","SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of History","SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of History, Center for American Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Bo","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"f284f3a3-297f-4882-81e1-b591c41ead80","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Bo","orcid":"0000-0001-9817-9595","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.22439/asca.v48i2.5450","issn":["00448060"],"issue":"2","journal":"American Studies in Scandinavia","pages":"7-31","publisher":"University Press of Southern Denmark","status":"p","title":"American Studies in Scandinavia","volume":"48"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85018171904"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-8e3a9d46-3b48-4575-b9e3-3a806b4bb305"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"“Drawn Together in a Blood Brotherhood” : Civic Nationalism amongst Scandinavian Immigrants in the American Civil War Crucible","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-613969","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
