,"rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788793041257"],"pages":"124-157","place":"Århus","publisher":"Forlaget Philosophia","status":"p","subtitle":"En indføring i den tyske idealismes hovedpositioner","title":"System, frihed og virkelighed"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6562d94b-e83a-4354-950d-e6e3ce40d54f"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Schelling - panlogisme vs. Pan-logisme : Eller om de fornuftige grunde til at afvise fornuftens totalitet","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-079491","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Pulmonary embolism (PE) is associated with a higher long-term mortality than deep vein thrombosis (DVT). This association may be related to inadequate antithrombotic therapy. METHODS: Incident VTE patients during the period 1997-2012 were identified in Danish nationwide registries. Two landmark populations were defined, consisting of patients alive at 30days (30d), and at 180days (180d) after discharge. Patients were classified according to anticoagulant usage at the landmark (30d: prescription purchase 0-30d post-discharge; 180d: prescription purchase in 0-30d and 90-180d). Mortality rates were compared using multivariate Cox regression. RESULTS: The 30d mortality risk among PE patients was high compared to DVT patients (19.9% vs. 4.4%). In the 30d-landmark population (n=62695), 34.9% of DVT patients and 21.3% of PE patients had not redeemed a prescription for anticoagulants. There was no material difference in 10-year mortality between anticoagulated PE patients and anticoagulated DVT patients. There was a higher 10-year mortality rate among non-anticoagulated PE patients compared to anticoagulated DVT patients (MRR: 1.26, 95% CI: 1.20-1.33). Findings in the 180d-landmark population also indicated materially similar 10-year mortality rates between anticoagulated PE patients and anticoagulated DVT patients. CONCLUSIONS: The 10-year mortality rate of patients surviving the initial 30d critical period following incident PE was not increased compared to patients with incident DVT, as long as patients initiated and persisted with anticoagulant therapy. Increased focus on antithrombotic therapy in PE patients and reasons for early therapy discontinuation may be warranted.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard","Lip, Gregory Y H","Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115127"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","City Hospital in Birmingham","University of Birmingham"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anticoagulant therapy after venous thromboembolism and 000000000010 year mortality","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-115127","identifier":[{"id":"26828386","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84959293748","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000371274000018","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-dfd68f8f-b1a1-4e36-bb58-de6cd073b03a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8D5DFF2609E8E1FBFE4E9B590DC5B261"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hjertemedicin (Kardiologi) [Klinik Hjerte-Lunge]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hjerte-Lunge","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"city hospital in birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"City Hospital in Birmingham","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben Bjerregaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a3c6747f-b9db-488b-8eb9-887d38742880","name":"Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard","orcid":"0000-0002-8485-8674","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y H","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenpau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26828386"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijcard.2016.01.190","issn":["01675273","18741754"],"issn_org":["01675273"],"journal":"International Journal of Cardiology","pages":"72-78","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Cardiology","volume":"208"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84959293748"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dfd68f8f-b1a1-4e36-bb58-de6cd073b03a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Anticoagulant therapy after venous thromboembolism and 10-year mortality","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-115127","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Birth and death; the two seemingly opposite extremes that appear to frame our existence are also possibly the most incomprehensible. As Françoise Dastur (2012) remarks, they are the two all-important events of our lives that we will never experience for ourselves. How we confront death thus becomes a question of how we confront the death of others.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jeanette Lykkegård"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-157825"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the third burial passing between worlds and points of transformation among the siberian chukchi","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84995592819","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-157825","identifier":[{"id":"84995592819","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-31cfcc8e-026d-4d18-8fca-479a01e37f49"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DF3B425C73F5F70385638DF787A57D7D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Department of Anthropology","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Arctic Research Centre"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jeanette Lykkegård","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"aee2e90f-b564-44ff-92af-ac5d2b12b381","name":"Nielsen, Jeanette Lykkegård","rank":1,"rolecode":