{"abstract":"A generalized traveling wave ansatz is used to investigate compound shock waves in a higher order nonlinear model of a thermoviscous fluid. The fluid velocity potential is written as a traveling wave plus a linear function of space and time. The latter offers the possibility of predicting the outcome of interacting shock waves, i.e. shock jump heights and wave velocities after collisions and overtakes. The stability of the linear solution part is investigated and a criterion for its stability is determined. For a number of instances, the numerical results show formation of rarefaction waves. By using a similarity transformation, analytical expressions for these rarefaction waves are found in the limit of no dissipation. Examples of compound shock waves are illustrated by numerical simulations.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rønne Rasmussen, Anders","Sørensen, Mads Peter","Gaididei, Yuri B.","Christiansen, Peter Leth"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-345704"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU"],"country":["Ukraine"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bogolyubov Institute for Theoretical Physics"],"keyword":["Shock waves"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["GreenHydrogen.dk"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"compound waves in a higher order nonlinear model of thermoviscous fluids","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84897361235","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-345704","identifier":[{"id":"84897361235","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-89f91617-2b01-4860-8054-97e64b4c35fe"],"keyword":["Shock interactions","Shock waves","Thermoviscous fluids","Traveling fronts"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F747122F4B60950E15D9A1FAB315BB4F"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["GreenHydrogen.dk"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Dynamical Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ua","key":"bogolyubov institute for theoretical physics","loc":["Ukraine","Europe, Non-EU"],"name":"Bogolyubov Institute for Theoretical Physics","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"rønnerasmussenpau","last":"Rønne Rasmussen","name":"Rønne Rasmussen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Peter","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"651b67f7-1e41-4719-8369-01b34075cd6b","name":"Sørensen, Mads Peter","orcid":"0000-0003-0820-8722","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuri B.","key":"gaidideipau","last":"Gaididei","name":"Gaididei, Yuri B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Leth","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"3b3fdeaf-d129-4067-bde8-00498361d5b7","name":"Christiansen, Peter Leth","orcid":"0000-0002-1465-9987","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.matcom.2014.01.009","issn":["03784754","18727166"],"issn_org":["03784754"],"journal":"Mathematics and Computers in Simulation","pages":"236-251","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Mathematics and Computers in Simulation","volume":"127"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84897361235"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-89f91617-2b01-4860-8054-97e64b4c35fe"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Compound waves in a higher order nonlinear model of thermoviscous fluids","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-345704","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Interactions between plasma and neutrals are investigated with particular attention to the influence of large amplitude blob structures that mediate a significant particle and energy transport through the scrape-off layer (SOL). We perform a statistical analysis of the mean-field approximation for plasma parameters in the SOL, and this approximation is shown to be poor in a SOL with a high level of fluctuations, as the plasma fields are strongly correlated. A 1D neutral fluid model which account for both cold and hot neutrals is formulated and the effects of blobs on the ionization in the SOL and edge are investigated. Simulations suggest that neutrals originating from dissociation of hydrogen molecules only fuel in the outermost edge region of the plasma, whereas hot neutrals from charge exchange collisions penetrate deep into the bulk plasma. The results are recovered in a simplified 2D model.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Thrysøe, Alexander Simon","Tophøj, Laust Emil Hjerrild","Naulin, Volker","Rasmussen, Jens Juul","Madsen, Jens","Nielsen, Anders Henry"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-355452"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Blob","Charge exchange","Edge","Interaction","Ionization","Neutral","Transport"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the influence of blobs on neutral particles in the scrape off layer","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84961717935","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-355452","identifier":[{"id":"84961717935","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-aa5c383b-cdb3-435b-8f90-413d3286b28f"],"keyword":["Blob","Charge-exchange","Edge","Interaction","Ionization","Neutral","Transport"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-424F392D812D417B8D7648B1434F1EA3"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alexander Simon","key":"thrysøepau","last":"Thrysøe","locid":"39b78f9b-adc1-4e59-9d7c-7072f09a73bc","name":"Thrysøe, Alexander Simon","orcid":"0000-0002-7761-5156","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Laust Emil Hjerrild","key":"tophøjpau","last":"Tophøj","locid":"97568333-0da3-44e9-aab0-420816644463","name":"Tophøj, Laust Emil Hjerrild","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Volker","key":"naulinpau","last":"Naulin","locid":"68cb67c0-c64d-4fef-a301-67ab58d8ace6","name":"Naulin, Volker","orcid":"0000-0001-5452-9215","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Juul","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"125b9658-f84c-4e0e-859e-5899413288ee","name":"Rasmussen, Jens Juul","orcid":"0000-0002-3543-690X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"ed287c2f-88ab-4d2f-8609-c89f2c2f7633","name":"Madsen, Jens","orcid":"0000-0002-6874-2970","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Henry","key":"nielse