from MRI using sulcal morphology","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-094604","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: There is a perception among physicians that lack of routine monitoring with non-vitamin K antagonist oral anticoagulants (NOACs) may lead to poor medication adherence. We studied adherence during the first year of usage in a cohort of patients with newly diagnosed non-valvular atrial fibrillation (AF) started on the NOAC, dabigatran etexilate. METHODS AND RESULTS: Nationwide Danish patient and prescription purchase registries were used to identify newly diagnosed AF patients initiating dabigatran, co-morbidities, and refill patterns under a twice-daily, one pill regimen. Adherence was characterised among remaining users (N=2,960) after 1 year using the proportion of days covered (PDC), gap rates, and restart rates. The overall 1-year PDC was 83.9%, with 76.8% patients having a 1-year PDC in excess of 80%. Patients with CHA2 DS2 -VASc score ≥2 were more adherent than patients with CHA2 DS2 -VASc score of 1 (PDC ratio: 1.12; 95% confidence interval [CI]: 1.08-1.17) and generally patients with higher morbidity were more adherent. In particular, patients with prior bleeding were more adherent than patients with no prior bleeding (PDC ratio: 1.02; 95% CI: 0.98-1.06). The overall gap rate was 1.4 gaps per year. There were no clear tendencies in gap rates among subgroups, although patients with higher morbidity tended to have slightly more, but shorter gap periods. CONCLUSION: More than 75% of patients were adherent >80% during the first year. Patients with higher morbidity, including patients with a higher risk of stroke or bleeding, exhibited better adherence. This improvement may be attributable to more regular contact with the health care system. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","Skjøth, Flemming","Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard","Rasmussen, Lars Hvilsted","Lip, Gregory Y H","Lane, Deirdre A."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-119573"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","City Hospital in Birmingham","University of Birmingham"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dabigatran adherence in atrial fibrillation patients during the first year after diagnosis a nationwide cohort study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jth.12845","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-119573","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000352309700003","type":"wos"},{"id":"84926120551","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25594442","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-ef27a3ce-1d6c-413e-aa5e-bbb0ab330507"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-82971AE8E10F4794A92BCBD297172A30"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/jth.12845/pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jth.12845","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Aalborg AF Study Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hjertemedicin (Kardiologi) [Klinik Hjerte-Lunge]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hjerte-Lunge","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"city hospital in birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"City Hospital in Birmingham","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenpau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"skjøthpau","last":"Skjøth","locid":"6166e832-f5f5-47be-82bb-07962be7c943","name":"Skjøth, Flemming","orcid":"0000-0003-2975-647X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben Bjerregaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a3c6747f-b9db-488b-8eb9-887d38742880","name":"Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard","orcid":"0000-0002-8485-8674","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Hvilsted","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"20cfd847-7f3e-4c77-88c0-32d3432496ed","name":"Rasmussen, Lars Hvilsted","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y H","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Deirdre A","key":"lanepau","last":"Lane","locid":"1548b799-ac6c-4eff-b8b8-44dc11e2799e","name":"Lane, Deirdre A.","name_org":"Lane, Deirdre A","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25594442"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/jth.12845","issn":["15387836","15387933"],"issn_org":["15387933"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of Thrombosis and Haemostasis","pages":"495-504","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Thrombosis and Haemostasis","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84926120551"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ef27a3ce-1d6c-413e-aa5e-bbb0ab330507"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Dabigatran adherence in atrial fibrillation patients during the first year after diagnosis : a nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-119573","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"One set of tools that has become predominant in the recent decades is the series of digital drawing and modelling software that today more than anything else defines the architect’s workflow. Digital drawing has become the keystone throughout the process from early sketching to building realisation. One of the reasons the digital drawing has become essential is clearly because of the level of interchange and versatility it provides. However, this is also where much capacity is still left unexplored and unused. Digital material has enormous potential to intermingle with the world, in which we live and for which architecture is created. Through the interface of digital drawing, data can feed into digital production, linking the architect directly to the materials. Drawing can morph directly into materialisation instead of representation.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Kruse Aagaard, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-124794"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Digital fabrication","Digital fabrikation","Representation","Repræsentation","Tools","Værktøjer","realisation"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-ART"],"level3":{"ART":["DI-ART-AAA","DI-ART-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-ART-AAA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"architects and materials","src":["arka"],"src-code":["DI-ART-AAA"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-124794","ids":["arka-491eb660-340d-494b-a3f3-cbf57df3e4a5"],"keyword":["No","digital fabrication","digital fabrikation","realisation","representation","repræsentation","tools","værktøjer"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D58AE0C9735C6DF329DB36DCD5718B10"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aarhus school of architecture","l2":"DI-ART","l2n":"Artistic Higher Education Institutions","l3":"DI-ART-AAA","l3nn":"Aarhus School of Architecture","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aarhus School of Architecture","namevar":["Aarhus School of Architecture","Aarhus School of Architecture, Digital tectonics/Architectural workshop"],"nora_code":"DI-ART-AAA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"kruseaagaardpau","last":"Kruse Aagaard","locid":"9582b0da-dc4c-4d07-afaa-2c5644dbc7f4","name":"Kruse Aagaard, Anders","orcid":"0000-0001-6592-9396","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andriette","key":"ahrenkielpedh","last":"Ahrenkiel","name":"Ahrenkiel, Andriette","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"daugaardpedh","last":"Daugaard","name":"Daugaard, Morten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Johan","key":"verbekepedh","last":"Verbeke","name":"Verbeke, Johan","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper","key":"rasmussenpedh","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Jesper","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788790979515"],"issue":"11","pages":"29-30","place":"Aarhus","series":"ARKIPELAGET","status":"p","title":"Engaging through Architecture"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Artistic Higher Education Institutions","All Danish Affiliations","Artistic Higher Education Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-ART-ALL"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["arka-491eb660-340d-494b-a3f3-cbf57df3e4a5"],"src":["Aarhus School of Architecture"],"title":"Architects and Materials","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-124794","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
