-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-cfed72cc-60e8-47c0-baf1-ef9b869982c8"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Psychosocial consequences of venous thromboembolism in youth : Results from a mixed methods study","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-110403","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Intestinal CD4(+) T cell depletion is rapid and profound during early HIV-1 infection. This leads to a compromised mucosal barrier that prompts chronic systemic inflammation. The preferential loss of intestinal T helper 17 (Th17) cells in HIV-1 disease is a driver of the damage within the mucosal barrier and of disease progression. Thus, understanding the effects of new therapeutic strategies in the intestines has high priority. Histone deacetylase (HDAC) inhibitors (e.g., panobinostat) are actively under investigation as potential latency reversing agents in HIV eradication studies. These drugs have broad effects that go beyond reactivating virus, including modulation of immune pathways. We examined colonic biopsies from ART suppressed HIV-1 infected individuals (clinicaltrials.gov: NCT01680094) for the effects of panobinostat on intestinal T cell activation and on inflammatory cytokine production. We compared biopsy samples that were collected before and during oral panobinostat treatment and observed that panobinostat had a clear biological impact in this anatomical compartment. Specifically, we observed a decrease in CD69(+) intestinal lamina propria T cell frequency and increased IL-17A mRNA expression in the intestinal epithelium. These results suggest that panobinostat therapy may influence the restoration of mucosal barrier function in these patients.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Bjerg Christensen, Ane","Dige, Anders","Vad-Nielsen, Johan","Brinkmann, Christel Rothe","Bendix, Mia","Østergaard, Lars Jørgen","Tolstrup, Martin","Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz","Rasmussen, Thomas A","Nyengaard, Jens Randel","Agnholt, Jørgen","Denton, Paul W"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179071"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"administration of panobinostat is associated with increased il 000000000017a mrna in the intestinal epithelium of hiv 000000000001 patients","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2015/120605","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-179071","identifier":[{"id":"85017055573","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26696749","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC4678094","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-5737c597-83fa-4ec4-a10c-f9f96b208c23"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-881A1B53CD0C9F8F0426DA68EE9A83DB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2015/120605","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University (AU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ane","key":"bjergchristensenpau","last":"Bjerg Christensen","name":"Bjerg Christensen, Ane","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"digepau","last":"Dige","locid":"c5b7ed9d-4c85-4d70-b215-6b023bdc20f5","name":"Dige, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Johan","key":"vadnielsenpau","last":"Vad-Nielsen","locid":"4e820f9a-3d0a-4675-bf78-3ffa9749a20f","name":"Vad-Nielsen, Johan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christel R","key":"brinkmannpau","last":"Brinkmann","locid":"0da818c5-ce73-47d3-9421-ccafc627d618","name":"Brinkmann, Christel Rothe","name_org":"Brink