","name":"Nielsen, Rasmus","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristian","key":"kristiansenkristianpau","last":"Kristiansen","name":"Kristiansen, Kristian","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Eske","key":"willersleveskepau","last":"Willerslev","locid":"21d2e042-0513-44fe-8acd-56b0d00a603e","name":"Willerslev, Eske","orcid":"0000-0002-7081-6748","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26496604"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.cell.2015.10.009","issn":["00928674","10974172"],"issn_org":["00928674"],"issue":"3","journal":"Cell","pages":"571-582","publisher":"Cell Press","status":"p","title":"Cell","volume":"163"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84975744563"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-f73471e1-2d39-4025-967c-d9030d86eedc","ku-d0db0bca-bb22-49c3-ad16-5559ab73ea15"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Early Divergent Strains of <i>Yersinia pestis</i> in Eurasia 5,000 Years Ago","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.18-038078","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND AND PURPOSE: The CHA2DS2VASc score and the Essen Stroke Risk Score are respectively used for risk stratification in patients with atrial fibrillation and in patients with cerebrovascular incidents. We aimed to test the ability of the 2 scores to predict stroke recurrence, death, and cardiovascular events (stroke, transient ischemic attack, myocardial infarction, or arterial thromboembolism) in a nationwide Danish cohort study, among patients with incident ischemic stroke and no atrial fibrillation. METHODS: We conducted a registry-based study in patients with incident ischemic stroke and no atrial fibrillation. Patients were stratified according to the CHA2DS2VASc score and the Essen Stroke Risk Score and were followed up until stroke recurrence or death. We estimated stratified incidence rates and hazard ratios and calculated the cumulative risks. RESULTS: 42 182 patients with incident ischemic stroke with median age 70.1 years were included. The overall 1-year incidence rates of recurrent stroke, death, and cardiovascular events were 3.6%, 10.5%, and 6.7%, respectively. The incidence rates, the hazard ratios, and the cumulative risk of all outcomes increased with increasing risk scores. C-statistics for both risk scores were around 0.55 for 1-year stroke recurrence and cardiovascular events and correspondingly for death around 0.67 for both scores. CONCLUSIONS: In this cohort of non-atrial fibrillation patients with incident ischemic stroke, increasing CHA2DS2VASc score and Essen Stroke Risk Score was associated with increasing risk of recurrent stroke, death, and cardiovascular events. Their discriminatory performance was modest and further refinements are required for clinical application.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Andersen, Søren Due","Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","Lip, Gregory Y H","Bach, Flemming W","Larsen, Torben Bjerregaard"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-005743"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Birmingham"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged 80 and over","Brain Ischemia","Cohort Studies","Denmark","Female","Follow Up Studies","Humans","Incidence","Ischemic Attack Transient","Journal Article","Male","Middle Aged","Myocardial Infarction","Prognosis","Recurrence","Registries","Research Support Non U S Gov t","Risk","Severity of Illness Index","Stroke","Thromboembolism"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"recurrent stroke the value of the cha000000000002ds000000000002vasc score and the essen stroke risk score in a nationwide stroke cohort","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84940377585","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-005743","identifier":[{"id":"26304862","type":"pmid"},{"id":"WOS:000360919700027","type":"wos"},{"id":"84940377585","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-7667537c-c8d8-41bb-87b1-008a2c338959","au-3ba13097-02e8-427a-81a5-c80b7a3a9d44"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Brain Ischemia","Cohort Studies","Denmark","Female","Follow-Up Studies","Humans","Incidence","Ischemic Attack, Transient","Journal Article","Male","Middle Aged","Myocardial Infarction","Prognosis","Recurrence","Registries","Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Risk","Severity of Illness Index","Stroke","Thromboembolism"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-80EF83A1B266B3D0DA772D15AD85C175"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Neurology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hoved-Orto","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Neurologisk afdeling, AAL"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Birmingham","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Due","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"2cedb454-848a-46cf-b759-b24b7ea59428","name":"Andersen, Søren Due","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenpau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y H","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Flemming W","key":"bachpau","last":