"University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-c5c8161e-d23e-495c-b73c-08ed021c67ad"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Disease-free survival after complete mesocolic excision compared with conventional colon cancer surgery : a retrospective, population-based study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-511496","year":"2015","yearsub":"2016"}
