for individually tailored interdisciplinary interventions in children with cerebral palsy : a randomised controlled trial protocol","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-636583","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
