{"abstract":"An electrostatic coherent mode near the electron diamagnetic frequency (20–90 kHz) is observed in the steep-gradient pedestal region of long pulse H-mode plasmas in the Experimental Advanced Super-conducting Tokamak, using a newly developed dual gas-puff-imaging system and diamond-coated reciprocating probes. The mode propagates in the electron diamagnetic direction in the plasma frame with poloidal wavelength of ∼8 cm. The mode drives a significant outflow of particles and heat as measured directly with the probes, thus greatly facilitating long pulse H-mode sustainment. This mode shows the nature of dissipative trapped electron mode, as evidenced by gyrokinetic turbulence simulations.","author_count":27,"contributors":["Wang, H.Q.","Xu, G.S.","Wan, B.N.","Ding, S.Y.","Guo, H.Y.","Shao, L.M.","Liu, S.C.","Xu, X.Q.","Wang, E.","Yan, Ning","Naulin, Volker","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Rasmussen, Jens Juul","Candy, J.","Bravenec, R.","Sun, Y.W.","Shi, T.H.","Liang, Y.F.","Chen, R.","Zhang, W.","Wang, L.","Chen, L.","Zhao, N.","Li, Y.L.","Liu, Y.L.","Hu, G.H.","Gong, X.Z."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-330608"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences","Fourth State Research","General Atomics","Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"new edge coherent mode providing continuous transport in long pulse h mode plasmas","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97994131/Wang_et_al_EAST_Edge_Coh_Mode_PhysRevLett.112_2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-330608","identifier":[{"id":"84900424980","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24856704","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-579d387f-f987-4522-bea2-bc37d5089d4b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-719D6ADDC4967FD8BC56B907CBABED3D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97994131/Wang_et_al_EAST_Edge_Coh_Mode_PhysRevLett.112_2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.112.185004","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"lawrence livermore national laboratory","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"general atomics","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"General Atomics","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"fourth state research","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Fourth State Research","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"H.Q.","key":"wanghqpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, H.Q.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"G.S.","key":"xugspau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, G.S.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"B.