{"abstract":"Ofte kæmper Facilities Managers for at få lov til at bidrage med driftserfaringer til nye byggeprojekter, men ikke på Danmarks Tekniske Universitet (DTU) i Campus Service, hvor ”spørg driften” det sidste år er blevet et mantra ved ethvert byggeprojekt, og p.t. er der 15 byggeprojekter i gang. Men hvordan organiseres denne vidensoverførsel i praksis, så både byggeafdelingen og driftsafdelingen oplever en god og effektiv proces?","author_count":3,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Helle Lohmann","Nielsen, Susanne Balslev","Møller, Anders B."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-338341"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ja til driftsvenligt byggeri på dtu men hvordan i praksis","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/99832112/Rasmussen_Nielsen_M_ller2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-338341","ids":["dtu-7125bd5d-590e-4363-8acf-793d76186d94"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-ECDD122E5C7AE5E38BC1C9EFCF18645C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/99832112/Rasmussen_Nielsen_M_ller2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Administration, Campus Service"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Helle Lohmann","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"ada8d657-b359-4389-abdf-b7b3c8cc2c5a","name":"Rasmussen, Helle Lohmann","orcid":"0000-0001-6230-9431","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Susanne Balslev","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"37d6b355-4468-4f72-8256-afc593b8426e","name":"Nielsen, Susanne Balslev","orcid":"0000-0002-8269-6771","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders B.","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"b1b3fb45-03da-4f51-99bf-c14c21a37ad9","name":"Møller, Anders B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"3","journal":"FM Update","pages":"22-25","publisher":"Dansk Facilities Management Netværk","status":"p","title":"FM Update"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-7125bd5d-590e-4363-8acf-793d76186d94"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Ja! Til driftsvenligt byggeri på DTU - men hvordan i praksis?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-338341","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"A reciprocating probe head with six pins was used for localized measurements of electric fields and densities in the scrape-off layer (SOL) of ASDEX Upgrade (AUG) up to the edge shear layer (SL) near the Last Closed Flux Surface (LCFS). The edge SL is characterized by a strong sudden change in the poloidal velocity v close to the separatrix. The probes were used to determine this velocity by different methods which are critically compared to each other concerning their reliability. By the first method the poloidal velocity was deduced from the radial electric field E-r measured by two radially staggered probe pins, with v being due to the E-r x B-phi-drift (B-phi is the toroidal field). The two other methods utilized the cross correlation of two poloidally staggered ion-biased probes and two poloidally staggered floating probes, respectively. In this case the time lags with maximum cross correlation were used to determine the poloidal velocity and its jump, yielding comparable results to the first method. Also the method of conditional averaging was applied to the latter signals. ((c) 2014 WILEY-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim).","author_count":12,"contributors":["Mehlmann, F.","Costea, S.","Schrittwieser, R..","Naulin, Volker","Rasmussen, Jens Juul","Müller, H.W.","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Vianello, N.","Carralero, D.","Rohde, V.","Lux, C.","Ionita, C."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-356287"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria","Germany","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Consorzio RFX","EURATOM Association","Max Planck Institute","University of Innsbruck"],"keyword":["Plasma diagnostics","Scrape off layer"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electric probe measurements of the poloidal velocity in the scrape off layer of asdex upgrade","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ctpp.201410078","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-356287","identifier":[{"id":"84897998905","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ad2509be-c097-48af-88f3-768c07d7e447"],"keyword":["Electric probe array","Plasma diagnostics","Poloidal velocity","Scrape-off layer","Shear layer"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-75DF466C710821800FC69D901EA80E6C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ctpp.201410078","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"at","key":"university of innsbruck","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Innsbruck","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"max planck institute","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"consorzio rfx","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Consorzio RFX","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"it","key":"euratom association","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"EURATOM Association","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"F.","key":"mehlmannpau","last":"Mehlmann","name":"Mehlmann, F.","rank":1,"rolecode":