"first":"Boris","key":"malyarchukborispau","last":"Malyarchuk","name":"Malyarchuk, Boris","rank":28,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Miroslava","key":"derenkomiroslavapau","last":"Derenko","name":"Derenko, Miroslava","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Toomas","key":"kivisildtoomaspau","last":"Kivisild","name":"Kivisild, Toomas","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25449608"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ajhg.2014.09.016","issn":["00029297","15376605"],"issn_org":["00029297"],"issue":"5","journal":"American Journal of Human Genetics","pages":"584-589","publisher":"Cell Press","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Human Genetics","volume":"95"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84920567005"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-6f232757-1e01-4f87-9605-1d2c604a242e","ku-bfe3e31c-9b13-4e56-b8f5-d218a88a9632"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Selective Sweep on a Deleterious Mutation in CPT1A in Arctic Populations","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-088.59-035136","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Asthma exacerbations are among the most frequent causes of hospitalization during childhood, but the underlying mechanisms are poorly understood. We performed a genome-wide association study of a specific asthma phenotype characterized by recurrent, severe exacerbations occurring between 2 and 6 years of age in a total of 1,173 cases and 2,522 controls. Cases were identified from national health registries of hospitalization, and DNA was obtained from the Danish Neonatal Screening Biobank. We identified five loci with genome-wide significant association. Four of these, GSDMB, IL33, RAD50 and IL1RL1, were previously reported as asthma susceptibility loci, but the effect sizes for these loci in our cohort were considerably larger than in the previous genome-wide association studies of asthma. We also obtained strong evidence for a new susceptibility gene, CDHR3 (encoding cadherin-related family member 3), which is highly expressed in airway epithelium. These results demonstrate the strength of applying specific phenotyping in the search for asthma susceptibility genes.","author_count":36,"contributors":["Bønnelykke, Klaus","Sleiman, Patrick","Nielsen, Kasper","Kreiner-Møller, Eskil","Mercader, Josep M","Belgrave, Danielle","den Dekker, Herman T","Husby, Anders","Sevelsted, Astrid","Faura-Tellez, Grissel","Mortensen, Li Juel","Paternoster, Lavinia","Flaaten, Richard","Mølgaard, Anne","Smart, David E","Thomsen, Philip Francis","Rasmussen, Morten","Bonàs-Guarch, Silvia","Holst, Claus","Nohr, Ellen A","Yadav, Rachita","March, Michael E","Blicher, Thomas Holberg","Lackie, Peter M","Jaddoe, Vincent W V","Simpson, Angela","Holloway, John W","Duijts, Liesbeth","Custovic, Adnan","Davies, Donna E","Torrents, David","Gupta, Ramneek","Hollegaard, Mads Vilhelm","Hougaard, David M","Hakonarson, Hakon","Bisgaard, Hans Flinker"],"cuid":["S04-099.89-724487"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Bønnelykke, Klaus"],"country":["Netherlands","Spain","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC-CNS)","Catalan Institution for Research and Advanced Studies","Children's Hospital of Philadelphia","Childrens Hosp Philadelphia, University of Pennsylvania, Childrens Hospital of Philadelphia, Div Neurol","Erasmus University Medical Center Rotterdam","Erasmus University Rotterdam","ICREA","Manchester University NHS Foundation Trust","Polytechnic University of Catalonia","Southampton General Hospital","Southampton University Hospitals NHS Trust","University Hospital Southampton NHS Foundation Trust","University Hospital of South Manchester NHS Foundation Trust","University Medical Center Groningen","University of Bristol","University of Groningen","University of Manchester","University of Southampton"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Danish Centre for Neonatal Screening"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a genome wide association study identifies cdhr000000000003 as a susceptibility locus for early childhood asthma with severe exacerbations","src":["au","dtu","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/ng.2830","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-099.89-724487","identifier":[{"id":"84891372721","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24241537","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-17ddc8c0-23ea-46af-8233-141ab9339d68","dtu-b0ec6ece-a73d-497e-b688-b5b810b430ba","ku-9d66e55d-cc71-4