{"abstract":"Facilities managers often fight to be allowed to contribute their operational experiences to new building projects, but not at Campus Service of the Technical University of Denmark (DTU), where “ask the operations manager” has become a mantra for every building project in recent years, and there are currently 15 building projects under way. But how is this knowledge transfer organized in practice so that both the buildings department and the operations department maintain a good and effective relationship?","author_count":3,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Helle Lohmann","Nielsen, Susanne Balslev","Møller, Anders B."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-377450"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dtu says yes to operational friendly buildings but how should it be done in practice","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103748234/DTU_says_yes.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-377450","ids":["dtu-f38883a5-7200-4a1c-8178-a44c1d1f01f8"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C3FE3CA95F27E60040456091902C43DF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103748234/DTU_says_yes.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Administration, Campus Service"],"