{"abstract":"Since 2010, the INTIMATE (INTegration of Ice-core, MArine and TErrestrial records) network has been operating as a COST Action (designated ES0907). This paper outlines the accomplishments of the INTIMATE COST Action in the context of how the INTIMATE ideas have evolved during the network's twenty-year life span, and highlights a number of challenges that can guide further work. In the second part of the paper, the contributions that comprise this INTIMATE special issue are introduced","author_count":13,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Sune Olander","Birks, H","Blockley, Simon P.","Brauer, Achim","Hajdas, Irka","Hoek, W.Z.","Lowe, John","Moreno, A.","Renssen, H.","Roche, D.M.","Svensson, Anders","Valdes, Paul J.","Walker, Mike J."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-512671"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Royal Holloway University of London","University of Bergen","University of Bristol"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dating synthesis and interpretation of palaeoclimatic records and model data integration advances of the intimate project integration of ice core marine and terrestrial records cost action es000000000907","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://webmail.ku.dk/OWA/redir.aspx?C=sBG-RZ7xVESXNTqfPemrZG53zB_l59EIvgBRPiEE3P53tIa_xSkXFzW5UHv5ia7ZbFEPesVpkx8.&URL=http%3a%2f%2fwww.sciencedirect.com%2fscience%2fjournal%2f02773791%2f106","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-512671","identifier":[{"id":"84924373987","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-c7c2f19c-f352-4cd4-afed-fec97c7f0013"],"lang":"English","lev