{"abstract":"The discovery of receptors using templated synthesis enables the selection of strong receptors from complex mixtures. In this contribution we describe a study of the condensation of d-biotin and formaldehyde in acidic water. We have discovered that halide anions template the formation of a single isomer of a 6 + 6 macrocycle. The macrocycle (biotin[6]uril) is water-soluble, chiral and binds halide anions (iodide, bromide and chloride) with selectivity for iodide in water, and it can be isolated on a gram scale in a one-pot reaction in 63% yield.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lisbjerg, Micke","Jessen, Bo M.","Rasmussen, Brian","Nielsen, Bjarne Enrico","Madsen, Anders Østergaard","Pittelkow, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-533787"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discovery of a cyclic 000000000006 000000000006 hexamer of d biotin and formaldehyde","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/c4sc00990h","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-533787","identifier":[{"id":"84901856569","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-eb0d8c30-e595-49fc-a8a6-9599d9fa1f73"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-080AF98B4F656281102FC56C3C4C3BA3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/c4sc00990h","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europ