{"abstract":"Training with a robotic training partner, is a physical, powerful, and yet intimate form of robot/human interaction (RHI). In this paper we report on the early stages of a project, that aims to study and use the human kinesthetic \"language\" of co-motion, used in physical human/robot interaction such as training.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Sørensen, Anders Stengaard","Rasmussen, Gitte","Day, Dennis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-598512"],"event":{"end":"2014-03-06","place":"Bielefeld, de","start":"2014-03-03","title":"2014 ACM/IEEE International Conference on Human Robot Interaction","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Kinesthetic interaction","Rehabilitation Robot"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kinesthetic human robot coordination the coordination of movements for interaction","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2559636.2563715&coll=DL&dl=GUIDE&CFID=299550548&CFTOKEN=84118121","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-598512","identifier":[{"id":"84896993640","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-5856309a-a7f5-4db5-a6e0-292dd9dd7360"],"keyword":["Kinesthetic interaction","Rehabilitation robot","Training robot"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E62C3C0B8B98E4DE78FE351306564E3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2559636.2563715&coll=DL&dl=GUIDE&CFID=299550548&CFTOKEN=84118121","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU Univers