{"abstract":"The ASETA project develops theory and methods for robotic agricultural systems. In ASETA, unmanned aircraft and unmanned ground vehicles are used to automate the task of identifying and removing weeds in sugar beet fields. The framework for a working automatic robotic weeding system is presented along with the implemented computer vision systems.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hansen, Karl Damkjær","Garcia Ruiz, Francisco Jose","Kazmi, Wajahat","Bisgaard, Morten","la Cour-Harbo, Anders","Rasmussen, Jesper","Andersen, Hans Jørgen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-119760"],"event":{"end":"2013-06-28","place":"Goald Coast, au","start":"2013-06-26","title":"Intelligent Autonomous Vehicles Symposium 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Agriculture","Automation","Autonomous mobile robots","Co operation","Computer vision","Trajectory planning"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["2013 Afgrødevidenskab"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an autonomous robotic system for mapping weeds in fields","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/186257309/paper.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-119760","identifier":[{"id":"84885611549","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-efd5ade5-debb-483e-af41-cfd93441469e"],"keyword":["Agriculture","Automation","Autonomous mobile robots","Co-operation","Computer vision","Trajectory planning"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3BBA6B7D3DCBB1E84899187416A40956"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3182/20130626-3-AU-2035.00055","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https