{"abstract":"The importance of risk management increases as farmers become more exposed to risk. But risk management is a difficult topic because income risk is the result of the complex interaction of multiple risk factors combined with the effect of an increasing array of possible risk management tools. In this paper we use Bayesian networks as an integrated modelling approach for representing uncertainty and analysing risk management in agriculture. It is shown how historical farm account data may be efficiently used to estimate conditional probabilities, which are the core elements in Bayesian network models. We further show how the Bayesian network model RiBay is used for stochastic simulation of farm income, and we demonstrate how RiBay can be used to simulate risk management at the farm level. It is concluded that the key strength of a Bayesian network is the transparency of assumptions, and that it has the ability to link uncertainty from different external sources to budget figures and to quantify risk at the farm level.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Svend","Madsen, Anders Læsø","Lund, Mogens"],"cuid":["S02-087.50-007676"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["HUGIN EXPERT A/S a"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bayesian network as a modelling tool for risk management in agriculture","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://econpapers.repec.org/paper/foiwpaper/2013_5f12.htm","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-087.50-007676","ids":["aau-9e23cd7d-7024-41e4-92d8-4900bcaa9ba6","ku-a28a1aba-6432-4bf5-bd27-6c813ea8906b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-D3EEB30E23B6DE119FFFB5FE4D6AD807"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://econpapers.repec.org/RePEc:foi:wpaper:2013_12","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://econpapers.repec.org/paper/foiwpaper/2013_5f12.htm","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food and Resource Economics, Section for Production, Markets and Policy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Machine Intelligence"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["HUGIN EXPERT A/S a"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Svend","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"0a1709fe-3eac-4be1-8ae6-c7a6eb895c26","name":"Rasmussen, Svend","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Læsø","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"608a9583-5ceb-4789-951a-069178eee380","name":"Madsen, Anders Læsø","orcid":"0000-0003-0633-9411