{"abstract":"Introduktion til temanummer 'Fra TR til HR? Arbejdsmiljøets rolle i moderne arbejdspladsudvikling'","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hagedorn-Rasmussen, Peter","Gleerup, Janne","Bojesen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-556914"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["HK Stat"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fra tr til hr mellem samarbejde ledelse og overlevelse","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.nyt-om-arbejdsliv.dk/images/pdf/2013/nr1/tfa1_2013_005_010.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-556914","ids":["ruc-0d867e62-8bdc-4ca6-a2a3-1a121a05c338"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2EDCFF178CB69908643A57E2A39F426A"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business, Management and organization","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["HK Stat"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"hagedornrasmussenpau","last":"Hagedorn-Rasmussen","locid":"cccef43a-82d0-4805-bddb-42ee8de3b6c2","name":"Hagedorn-Rasmussen, Peter","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Janne","key":"gleeruppau","last":"Gleerup","locid":"40825d51-8646-4c21-916b-18343a623e9c","name":"Gleerup, Janne","orcid":"0000-0001-6743-0644","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Anders","key":"bojesenpau","last":"Bojesen","name":"Bojesen, Anders","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["13991442"],"issue":"1","journal":"Tidsskrift for Arbejdsliv","pages":"5-10","status":"p","title":"Tidsskrift for Arbejdsliv","volume":"2013"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-0d867e62-8bdc-4ca6-a2a3-1a121a05c338"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Fra TR til HR? : Mellem samarbejde, ledelse og overlevelse","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-556914","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Microfibrillar-associated protein 4 (MFAP4) is located in the extracellular matrix (ECM). We sought to identify tissues with high levels of MFAP4 mRNA and MFAP4 protein expression. Moreover, we aimed to evaluate the significance of MFAP4 as a marker of cardiovascular disease (CVD) and to correlate MFAP4 with other known ECM markers, such as fibulin-1, osteoprotegerin (OPG), and osteopontin (OPN). Quantitative real-time PCR demonstrated that MFAP4 mRNA was more highly expressed in the heart, lung, and intestine than in other elastic tissues. Immunohistochemical studies demonstrated high levels of MFAP4 protein mainly at sites rich in elastic fibers and within blood vessels in all tissues investigated. The AlphaLISA technique was used to determine serum MFAP4 levels in a clinical cohort of 172 patients consisting of 5 matched groups with varying degrees of CVD: 1: patients with ST elevation myocardial infarction (STEMI), 2: patients with non-STEMI, 3: patients destined for vascular surgery because of various atherosclerotic diseases (stable atherosclerotic disease), 4: apparently healthy individuals with documented coronary artery calcification (CAC-positive), and 5: apparently healthy individuals without signs of coronary artery calcification (CAC-negative). Serum MFAP4 levels were significantly lower in patients with stable atherosclerotic disease than CAC-negative individuals (p","author_count":16,"contributors":["Wulf-Johansson, Helle","Johansson, Sofie Lock","Schlosser, Anders","Holm, Anne Trommelholt","Rasmussen, Lars Melholt","Mickley, Hans","Diederichsen, Axel Cosmus Pyndt","Munkholm, Henrik","Poulsen, Tina S","Tornøe, Ida","Nielsen, Vicki","Marcussen, Niels","Vestbo, Jørgen","Sækmose, Susanne Gjørup","Holmskov, Uffe","Sorensen, Grith Lykke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-634244"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"localization of microfibrillar associated protein 000000000004 mfap000000000004 in human tissues clinical evaluation of serum mfap000000000004 and its association with various cardiovascular conditions","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0082243","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-634244","identifier":[{"id":"84892630535","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24349233","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3862580","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-d503744b-f29e-4cb2-b42b-8af051abe356"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BFAD10EE7A8849FD0CD5C4E1468ABB1F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0082243","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Vejle Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helle","key":"wulfjohanssonpau","last":"Wulf-Johansson","name":"Wulf-Johansson,