{"abstract":"The treelet transform is a recent data reduction technique from the field of machine learning. Sharing many similarities with principal component analysis, the treelet transform can reduce a multidimensional dataset to the projections on a small number of directions or components that account for much of the variation in the original data. However, in contrast to principal component analysis, the treelet transform produces sparse components. This can greatly simplify interpretation. I describe the tt Stata add-on for performing the treelet transform. The add-on includes a Mata implementation of the treelet transform algorithm alongside other functionality to aid in the practical application of the treelet transform. I demonstrate an example of a basic exploratory data analysis using the tt add-on.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-113898"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Dimension reduction","Factor analysis","Principal component analysis","treelet","tt"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tt treelet transform with stata","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.stata-journal.com/article.html?article=st0249","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-113898","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000303616500007","type":"wos"},{"id":"84859070846","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-dba3cfd0-b985-4b4f-9a58-cd1ea0e234bc"],"keyword":["Principal component analysis","dimension reduction","factor analysis","treelet","tt","ttcv","ttdendro","ttloading","ttpredict","ttscree","ttstab"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CAED18CA0D8FEBA35C6C2E10C765EAEF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.stata-journal.com/article.html?article=st0249","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenpau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["1536867X","15368734"],"issn_org":["1536867X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Stata Journal","pages":"130-146","publisher":"SAGE Publications","status":"p","title":"Stata Journal","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84859070846"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dba3cfd0-b985-4b4f-9a58-cd1ea0e234bc"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"tt: Treelet transform with Stata","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-113898","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
