{"abstract":"A reciprocating probe was used for localized measurements of the radial transport of poloidal momentum in the scrape-off layer (SOL) of ASDEX Upgrade (AUG). The probe measured poloidal and radial electric field components and density. We concentrate on three components of the momentum transport: Reynolds stress, convective momentum flux and triple product of the fluctuating components of density, radial and poloidal electric field. For the evaluation we draw mainly on the probability density functions (PDFs).","author_count":9,"contributors":["Mehlmann, F.","Schrittwieser, R.","Naulin, Volker","Rasmussen, Jens Juul","Müller, H.W.","Ionita, C.","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Vianello, N.","Rohde, V."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-368126"],"event":{"end":"2012-07-06","place":"Stockholm, se","start":"2012-07-02","title":"39th European Physical Society Conference on Plasma Physics and 16th International Congress on Plasma Physics","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria","Germany","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Consorzio RFX","Max Planck Institute","University of Innsbruck"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"radial transport of poloidal momentum in asdex upgrade in l mode and h mode","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/9875137/Radial_transport_of_poloidal_momentum.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-368126","identifier":[{"id":"84876914408","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-d4cfec9e-d4e4-4ac7-a39d-31c3ea8324ea"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-C836F5B37CB9C6