{"abstract":"Clinical practice does not reflect current clinical guidelines recommending an early multimodal non-surgical treatment for knee and hip osteoarthritis (OA). The purpose of this study was to examine the feasibility of such an initiative (Good Life with osteoArthritis in Denmark (GLA:D) in persons with mild to moderate knee and/or hip OA-related pain.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Skou, Søren Thorgaard","Odgaard, Anders","Rasmussen, Jens Ole","Roos, Ewa M."],"cuid":["S03-100.00-000608"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-OTH"],"OT":["Ortopædkirurgien, Aalborg Sygehus, Aarhus Universitetshospital"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"group education and exercise is feasible in knee and hip osteoarthritis","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.danmedj.dk/portal/page/portal/danmedj.dk/dmj_forside/PAST_ISSUE/2012/DMJ_2012_12/A4554","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-000608","identifier":[{"id":"23290290","type":"pmid"},{"id":"WOS:000314508700010","type":"wos"},{"id":"84873145307","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000314508700010","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-0b95bd41-4c9d-4a5b-93bc-0a262b515d37","au-9b138f71-d021-4bef-b4ce-d5cf4ebfdb48","sdu-376d4d61-3b14-42ea-9fef-50a15a4cf49c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-1DD328EB576D2EC2662B46CF091D8FB0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.danmedj.dk/portal/page/portal/danmedj.dk/dmj_forside/PAST_ISSUE/2012/DMJ_2012_12/A4554","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"a