Kim","orcid":"0000-0001-6429-7921","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21474587"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/aje/kwr060","issn":["00029262","14766256"],"issn_org":["00029262"],"issue":"10","journal":"American Journal of Epidemiology","pages":"1097-1104","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Epidemiology","volume":"173"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79955774582"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-01126149-17e2-440e-ac5a-f4f7935d40fd","au-f55efc82-c20f-4a63-a766-e798c476a066","ku-c7789c3e-45ac-458a-b8fb-a6663b255289"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Exploring Dietary Patterns By Using the Treelet Transform","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-100.00-000063","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"The E-core transverse flux machine, which is a variation of the classical Switched Reluctance machine (SRM), have all the basic properties to be considered as a very fault tolerant machine. Every single coil in the machine is isolated from the each others both magnetic, electrical and to some extent also thermal. Since the E-core transverse flux-machine belongs to the family of the SRMs it has unique properties of intervals without current in the windings. By careful investigation of the voltage and current in these intervals a very simple method to detect single and partial turn short circuit faults have been developed. For other types of machines the single and partial turn short circuit is very difficult to deal with and requires normally very comprehensive detection and calculation schemes. The developed detection algorithm combined with the E-core transverse flux machine is believed to be a strong candidate for fault tolerant electrical machine applications.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Peter Omand","Runólfsson, Gunnar","Thorsdóttir, Thórunn Ágústa","Jakobsen, Uffe","Pedersen, Anders Hedeager"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-091240"],"event":{"end":"2011-08-23","place":"Bejing , cn","start":"2011-08-20","title":"International Conference on Electrical Machines and Systems, ICEMS 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"e core transverse flux machine with integrated fault detection system","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ICEMS.2011.6073474","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-091240","identifier":[{"id":"83355175669","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8db45487-c1dd-4cca-a2d7-9739fc47db99"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B54FAC871BB0ECDA7936E6C93316A629"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ICEMS.2011.6073474","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=6073474","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, E-Mobility and Drives","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electrical Machines"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["ePower Technology ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Omand","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"13f9644b-1262-4526-8c71-19d53d340684","name":"Rasmussen, Peter Omand","orcid":"0000-0003-1022-3681","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gunnar","key":"runólfssonpau","last":"Runólfsson","locid":"fae61063-3fca-412e-a9b4-99ad6803f432","name":"Runólfsson, Gunnar","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thórunn Ágústa","key":"thorsdóttirpau","last":"Thorsdóttir","locid":"c034c3cf-6373