{"abstract":"This article investigates the how the performance of SDRAM based packet buffering systems for high performance switches can be simulated using OPNET. In order to include the access pattern dependent performance of SDRAM modules in simulations, a custom SDRAM model is implemented in OPNET Modeller based on the specifications of a real-life DDR3-SDRAM chip. Based on this model the performance of different schemes for optimizing the performance of such a packet buffer can be evaluated. The purpose of this study is to find efficient schemes for memory mapping of the packet queues and I/O traffic shaping to provide the best performance in terms of latency and throughput.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders","Ruepp, Sarah Renée","Berger, Michael Stübert","Wessing, Henrik","Yu, Hao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-327573"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-01","place":"Washington DC, us","start":"2011-08-29","title":"OPNETWORK 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sdram based packet buffer model for high speed switches","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/5756663/SDRAM-based.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-327573","ids":["dtu-4d4101e6-bf20-4d42-934c-53669608be40"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5F4F2C10ADD125189254134EA2468D55"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/5756663/SDRAM-based.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.opnet.com/opnetwork2011/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Networks Technology and Service Platforms"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"87986f01-324c-411f-b6e1-968b73835d8d","name":"Rasmussen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sarah Renée","key":"ruepppau","last":"Ruepp","locid":"92dfeab4-28ff-437d-9f5d-e7d8d6a67b93","name":"Ruepp, Sarah Renée","orcid":"0000-0003-0205-5067","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael Stübert","key":"bergerpau","last":"Berger","locid":"7b367889-bde0-4e40-893f-0a22e4d32371","name":"Berger, Michael Stübert","orcid":"0000-0003-4575-7261","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"wessingpau","last":"Wessing","locid":"9d363138-c28b-40ad-8ee3-21971269cabc","name":"Wessing, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-8504-8561","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hao","key":"yupau","last":"Yu","locid":"d31421ff-c774-4cd0-963c-bef6b0351797","name":"Yu, Hao","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p","title":"Proceedings of OPNETWORK 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-4d4101e6-bf20-4d42-934c-53669608be40"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"SDRAM-based packet buffer model for high speed switches","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-327573","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Highly active nanoparticle SCR deNO(x) catalysts composed of amorphous vanadia on crystalline anatase have been prepared by a sol-gel, co-precipitation method using decomposable crystallization seeds. The catalysts were characterized by means of XRPD, TEM/SEM, FT-IR, nitrogen physisorption and NH(3)-TPD. Due to the high-surface area anatase particles, loading of 20 wt% vanadia could be obtained without exceeding monolayer coverage of V(2)O(5). This resulted in unprecedented high deNO(x) SCR activity corresponding to a factor of two compared to an industrial reference and to other V(2)O(5)/TiO(2) catalysts reported in the literature in the examined temperature range of 200-400 degrees C. The catalysts showed very high resistivity towards potassium poisoning maintaining a 15-30 times higher activity than the equally poisoned industrial reference catalyst, upon impregnation by 280 mu mole potassium/g of catalyst. (C) 2011 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Kristensen, Steffen Buus","Kunov-Kruse, Andreas Jonas","Riisager, Anders","Rasmussen, Søren B.","Fehrmann, Rasmus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-330131"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Instituto de Catálisis y Petroleoquímica"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high performance vanadia anatase nanoparticle catalysts for the selective catalytic reduction of no by ammonia","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2011.08.017","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-330131","identifier":[{"id":"80054979542","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-5606fb63-e665-42cc-8597-99d5512f0127"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A019F6B0398A9F4D1087C8546832BC7F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2011.08.017","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry, Centre for Catalysis and Sustainable Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"es","key":"instituto de catálisis y petroleoquímica","loc":["Spain","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Instituto de Catálisis y Petroleoquímica","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen Buus","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"bc35659f-d692-453b-aa85-4f121f67cde5","name":"Kristensen, Steffen Buus","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas Jonas","key":"kunovkrusepau","last":"Kunov-Kruse","locid":"b4aaeb76-6eb1-407f-aa4b-f4c4d933ef30","name":"Kunov-Kruse, Andreas Jonas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"riisagerpau","last":"Riisager","locid":"ccf85ca7-c97b-48e6-bfa8-30ea97d6e9b8","name":"Riisager, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-7086-1143","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren B.","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Søren B.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"fehrmannpau","last":"Fehrmann","locid":"26df8209-1961-48f0-80ed-cbf2b3bc8747","name":"Fehrmann, Rasmus","orcid":"0000-0003-0583-5958","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jcat.2011.08.017","issn":["00219517","10902694"],"issn_org":["00219517"],"issue":"1","journal":"Journal of Catalysis","pages":"60-67","publisher":"Academic Press","status":"p","title":"Journal of Catalysis","volume":"284"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80054979542"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-5606fb63-e665-42cc-8597-99d5512f0127"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"High performance vanadia-anatase nanoparticle catalysts for the selective catalytic reduction of NO by ammonia","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-330131","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Intermittent convective transport at the edge and in the scrape-off layer (SOL) of EAST was investigated by using fast reciprocating Langmuir probe. Holes, as part of plasma structures, were detected for the first time inside the shear layer. The amplitude probability distribution function of the turbulence is strongly skewed, with positive skewed events (“blobs\") prevailing in the SOL region and negative skewed events (“holes\") dominant inside the shear layer. The statistical properties coincide with previous observations from JET. The generation mechanism of blobs and holes is also discussed. In addition burst structure and dynamics character of them are also presented.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Yan, Ning","Xu, Guosheng","Zhang, Wei","Chang, Jiafeng","Wang, Liang","Liu, Shaocheng","Liu, Peng","Wang, Huiqian","Jiang, Min","Xiong, Hao","Ding, Siye","Wan, Baonian","Gao, Xiang","Naulin, Volker","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Rasmussen, Jens Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-354896"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["Fusion energy","Fusionsenergiforskning"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"observation of blobs and holes in the boundary plasma of east tokamak","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1009-0630/13/4/05","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-354896","identifier":[{"id":"80052783005","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-a890d754-a571-46a2-b74f-8be77e670555"],"keyword":["Fusion energy","Fusionsenergiforskning"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-625D1B8379D158B786D897B3737019E4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1009-0630/13/4/05","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy, Plasma Physics and Technology Programme"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ning","key":"yanningpau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Ning","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guosheng","key":"xuguoshengpau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Guosheng","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"zhangweipau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Wei","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jiafeng","key":"changjiafengpau","last":"Chang","name":"Chang, Jiafeng","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Liang","key":"wangliangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Liang","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shaocheng","key":"liushaochengpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Shaocheng","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peng","key":"liupengpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Peng","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Huiqian","key":"wanghuiqianpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Huiqian","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Min","key":"jiangminpau","last":"Jiang","name":"Jiang, Min","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hao","key":"xionghaopau","last":"Xiong","name":"Xiong, Hao","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Siye","key":"dingsiyepau","last":"Ding","name":"Ding, Siye","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Baonian","key":"wanbaonianpau","last":"Wan","name":"Wan, Baonian","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiang","key":"gaoxiangpau","last":"Gao","name":"Gao, Xiang","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Volker","key":"naulinvolkerpau","last":"Naulin","locid":"68cb67c0-c64d-4fef-a301-67ab58d8ace6","name":"Naulin, Volker","orcid":"0000-0001-5452-9215","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Henry","key":"nielsenandershenrypau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1d9aa958-9d84-4a3b-8300-f6fe9b0be73e","name":"Nielsen, Anders Henry","orcid":"0000-0003-3642-3905","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"rasmussenjensjuulpau","last":"Juul Rasmussen","locid":"125b9658-f84c-4e0e-859e-5899413288ee","name":"Rasmussen, Jens Juul","name_org":"Juul Rasmussen, Jens","orcid":"0000-0002-3543-690X","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1088/1009-0630/13/4/05","issn":["10090630"],"issue":"4","journal":"Plasma Science and Technology","pages":"410-414","publisher":"IOP Publishing","status":"p","title":"Plasma Science and Technology","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80052783005"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-a890d754-a571-46a2-b74f-8be77e670555"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Observation of Blobs and Holes in the Boundary Plasma of EAST Tokamak","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-354896","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"The influence of finite Larmor radius (FLR) effects on the perpendicular convection of isolated particle density filaments driven by interchange motions in magnetized plasmas is investigated using a two-moment gyrofluid model. By means of numerical simulations on a two-dimensional, bi-periodic domain perpendicular to the magnetic field, it is demonstrated that the radial velocities of the blob-like filaments are roughly described by the inertial scaling, which prescribes a velocity proportional to the square root of the summed electron and ion pressures times the square root of the blob width. Due to FLR effects, the poloidal up-down symmetry in the particle density field observed in the zero Larmor radius limit is broken. The symmetry breaking implies a poloidal motion of the blobs in the BrB direction. At later times, the direction of the poloidal motion is reversed when the blob is decelerated. It is shown that the spatial structure of the blobs depends on the ratio of the ion gyroradius to the initial filament size qi=r. Blobs with qi=r&0:2 remain coherent as they move through the scrape-off layer, whereas blobs with qi=r.0:1 form plume-like structures that loose their coherence and eventually become fragmented. After having traveled approximately five times their initial widths, coherent blobs carry 2–3 times the particle density of fragmented blobs. It is shown that FLR effects reduce mixing, stretching, and generation of small spatial scales in the particle density field by setting up a sheared flow surrounding the blob.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Madsen, Jens","Garcia, Odd E.","Larsen, Jeppe Stærk","Naulin, Volker","Nielsen, Anders Henry","Rasmussen, Jens Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-366283"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Tromsø – The Arctic University of Norway"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the influence of finite larmor radius effects on the radial interchange motions of plasma filaments","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3658033","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-366283","identifier":[{"id":"82555183506","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-cebb4469-ece5-4366-9e1c-50fd5c4ac6a3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-55F996EDF926AF951A52229AF37385E4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3658033","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy, Plasma Physics and Technology Programme"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"university of tromsø the arctic university of norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Tromsø – The Arctic University of Norway","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"ed287c2f-88ab-4d2f-8609-c89f2c2f7633","name":"Madsen, Jens","orcid":"0000-0002-6874-2970","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Odd E.","key":"garciapau","last":"Garcia","name":"Garcia, Odd E.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1