":"Tjønneland","name":"Tjønneland, A.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"overvadpau","last":"Overvad","locid":"83738c57-45d4-41e0-b807-ad0f6dec597c","name":"Overvad, Kim","orcid":"0000-0001-6429-7921","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/jech.2011.142976c.11","issn":["0143005X","14702738"],"issn_org":["0143005X"],"journal":"Journal of Epidemiology & Community Health","publisher":"BMJ Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"Journal of Epidemiology & Community Health","volume":"65"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e2cb0525-9026-4adb-867e-68b2080d83d3","au-c6641f1b-592e-45f4-9afc-c3fa1b1bd318"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The Treelet Transform - a novel method for determining patterns in adipose tissue fatty acids","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.86-010829","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE. To compare patients with increased risk of bleeding who received combined blood reinfusion and femoral nerve block in total knee replacement (TKR) to regular patients treated routinely with respect to pain relief, blood loss, and knee function. METHODS. In a consecutive series of 67 patients who underwent unilateral TKR, 12 patients with increased risk of bleeding owing to cardiac disease or previous thromboembolic events received continuous femoral nerve block and blood reinfusion, without tranexamic acid (TA) injection. The remaining 55 patients were controls who received standard postoperative treatment (TA injection, local injection of analgesics, and suction drainage without reinfusion). The volume of blood loss (drained or reinfused), pain score (using a visual analogue scale) and knee function (using the Knee Society Score [KSS]) in the 2 groups were compared. RESULTS. In the study group, patients were 5 years older and tended to have a lower preoperative KSS function score (35 vs. 45, p=0.08) and a higher function-related pain score (6.5 vs. 6, p=0.10). The mean volume of drained blood wasted in the study group did not differ significantly from the mean total volume of drained blood in the control group (235 vs. 300 ml, p=0.14). Similarly, the mean decrease in postoperative haemoglobin concentration did not differ significantly between the respective groups (2.1 vs. 2.1 mmol/l, p=0.97). A significantly greater proportion of patients received allogenic blood transfusion in the study group than in controls (3/12 vs. 2/55, p","author_count":7,"contributors":["Simonsen, Ole","Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","Simonsen, A.B.","Jørgensen, Mogens Brouw","Rathleff, Michael Skovdal","Lundbye-Christensen, Søren"],"cuid":["S02-098.44-011515"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Analgesics","Autologous","Blood Transfusion","Knee","Nerve Block","Postoperative Hemorrhage","Replacement","Tranexamic acid"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"OT":["Ortopædkirurgien, Aalborg Sygehus, Aarhus Universitetshospital"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"blood reinfusion combined with femoral nerve block in total knee replacement for patients with increased risk of bleeding","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21519080","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.44-011515","identifier":[{"id":"21519080","type":"pmid"},{"id":"82255190982","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f0e17aba-094d-4f84-99f9-d9da28010a9c","au-57df59b6-e33b-472f-874a-05a16b98ba09"],"keyword":["analgesics","arthrolasty","autologous","blood transfusion","knee","nerve block","postoperative hemorrhage","replacement","tranexamic acid"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8E41BC14209843B10296B8E577C28308"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21519080","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, Ortopædkirurgi Nordjylland, Klinik Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Ortopædkirurgien, Aalborg Sygehus, Aarhus Universitetshospital"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"O H","key":"simonsenolehøjgaardpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"579c5d7d-8d51-414d-9c8f-0b2743804a3f","name":"Simonsen, Ole Højgaard","name_org":"Simonsen, O H","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"simonsenolepau","last":"Simonsen","name":"Simonsen, Ole","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"gorstrasmussenanderspau","last":"Gorst-Rasmussen","locid":"2aa85786-c0b1-42ec-93d4-eb7a75696409","name":"Gorst-Rasmussen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"A.B.","key":"simonsenabpau","last":"Simonsen","name":"Simonsen, A.B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mogens Brouw","key":"jørgensenmogensbrouwpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"1d7a10d8-23e4-41a7-a4b6-7bf1fb48f8bc","name":"Jørgensen, Mogens Brouw","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"M S","key":"rathleffmichaelskovdalpau","last":"Rathleff","locid":"a6187a1e-8b58-4c82-a06c-a95fa7ccc6a3","name":"Rathleff, Michael Skovdal","name_org":"Rathleff