{"abstract":"This paper evaluates speedup and expansion in a multi-stage Terabit switch fabric. Single-stage switch fabrics, e.g. crossbar switches, are difficult to scale up to a Terabit system. Hence, a multi-stage switch fabric, where traffic can be distributed on different chips, offers a promising perspective. We evaluate buffer usage, number of out-of-sequence cells and fabric delay. Simulation results obtained in OPNET Modeler show that speedup outperforms expansion and that both approaches significantly gain from applying an output line speedup. By reducing the buffer usage in the middle stage, fewer cells arrive out-of-sequence and hence the need for re-sequencing is decreased as well.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ruepp, Sarah Renée","Rytlig, Andreas","Berger, Michael Stübert","Wessing, Henrik","Fagertun, Anna Manolova","Yu, Hao","Rasmussen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-369913"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-01","place":"Washington DC, us","start":"2011-08-29","title":"OPNETWORK 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evaluation of speedup and expansion in terabit switch fabrics","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/7591146/OW11_SpeedupExpansion_Ruepp.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-369913","ids":["dtu-da77664f-9109-4c71-948d-86574f2b1a73"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7F2F02FD2D6CC99D1FA5CCCA73468228"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/7591146/OW11_SpeedupExpansion_Ruepp.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Networks","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Networks Technology and Service Platforms"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sarah Renée","key":"ruepppau","last":"Ruepp","locid":"92dfeab4-28ff-437d-9f5d-e7d8d6a67b93","name":"Ruepp, Sarah Renée","orcid":"0000-0003-0205-5067","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas","key":"rytligpau","last":"Rytlig","name":"Rytlig, Andreas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael Stübert","key":"bergerpau","last":"Berger","locid":"7b367889-bde0-4e40-893f-0a22e4d32371","name":"Berger, Michael Stübert","orcid":"0000-0003-4575-7261","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"wessingpau","last":"Wessing","locid":"9d363138-c28b-40ad-8ee3-21971269cabc","name":"Wessing, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-8504-8561","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anna Manolova","key":"fagertunpau","last":"Fagertun","locid":"4113ef4f-ae5e-409d-98d3-6b7f503e7b0c","name":"Fagertun, Anna Manolova","orcid":"0000-0003-3464-3226","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hao","key":"yupau","last":"Yu","locid":"d31421ff-c774-4cd0-963c-bef6b0351797","name":"Yu, Hao","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"87986f01-324c-411f-b6e1-968b73835d8d","name":"Rasmussen, Anders","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"OPNET","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of OPNETWORK 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-da77664f-9109-4c71-948d-86574f2b1a73"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Evaluation of Speedup and Expansion in Terabit Switch Fabrics","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-369913","year":"2011","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Adults with GH deficiency are known to exhibit reduced sweating. Whether sweating capacity is impacted in obese subjects with impaired GH secretion have not previously been investigated. The main objective was to investigate sweat secretion rate and the GH-IGF-I axis in obese subjects before and after weight loss. Sixteen severely obese women (BMI, 40.6 ± 1.1 kg/m(2)) were investigated before and after a diet-induced weight loss. Sixteen age-matched nonobese women served as controls. The obese subjects presented the characteristic decreased GH release, hyperinsulinaemia, increased FFA levels, and impaired insulin sensitivity, which all were normalised after diet-induced weight loss of 30 ± 5 kg. Sweat secretion rates were similar comparing obese and nonobese subjects (78 ± 10 versus 82 ± 9 mg/30 minutes) and sweat secretion did not change after a diet-induced weight loss in obese subjects. We conclude that although obese subjects have markedly reduced GH release and impaired IGF-I levels, sweat secretion rate is found to be normal.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Rasmussen, M H","Juul, Anders","Main, Katharina M.","Hilsted, Jannik","Rasmussen, Michael Højby"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-405239"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"normal sweat secretion despite impaired growth hormone insulin like growth factor i axis in obese subjects","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1155/2011/493840","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-405239","identifier":[{"id":"80053539510","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-13cd462d-41a2-42f1-b6d9-d3bcd83e8357"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-40EF7F84C5B71AC2B34B2303439BA649"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2011/493840","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1155/2011/493840","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Gynaecology, Obstetrics and Paediatrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"M H","key":"rasmussenmhpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, M H","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders","key":"juulanderspau","last":"Juul","locid":"f9b11983-c7c8-4111-b119-4de471572898","name":"Juul, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-0534-4350","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Katharina M","key":"mainkatharinampau","last":"Main","locid":"1770eebd-1659-4088-b44c-c9de22a4bb0b","name":"Main, Katharina M.","name_org":"Main, Katharina M","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jannik","key":"hilstedjannikpau","last":"Hilsted","name":"Hilsted, Jannik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael Højby","key":"rasmussenmichaelhøjbypau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Michael Højby","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1155/2011/493840","issn":["16878337","16878345"],"issn_org":["16878337"],"journal":"International Journal of Endocrinology","pages":"493840","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Endocrinology","volume":"2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80053539510"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-13cd462d-41a2-42f1-b6d9-d3bcd83e8357"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Normal sweat secretion despite impaired growth hormone-insulin-like growth factor-I axis in obese subjects","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-405239","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
