{"abstract":"Om Arena-modernisme","author_count":1,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Anders Juhl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-516573"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"den jyske modernisme skal frem i lyset","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-516573","ids":["ku-ce1576da-3af9-4ece-9633-ef3606d2a9a3"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-59C5807B36050502C626DF5E896E16F7"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Nordic Studies and Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Anders Juhl","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"3e1188ff-4cc9-42e2-86b3-59515e62f1af","name":"Rasmussen, Anders Juhl","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09046054"],"newspaper":"Kristeligt Dagblad","status":"p","title":"Kristeligt Dagblad"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ce1576da-3af9-4ece-9633-ef3606d2a9a3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Den jyske modernisme skal frem i lyset","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-516573","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"The selection of users for participation in IT projects involves trade-offs between multiple criteria, one of which is selecting a representative cross-section of users. This criterion is basic because trading it for other criteria means basing designs on information biased toward some user groups at the expense of others. Based on interviews in development and customer organizations we find that their criteria for user selection favour persons who can contribute to the progress of the IT project over persons who are representative of the full range of users. A highly valued contribution from participating users is the ability to advocate a vision for the system and champion its organizational implementation. A survey in one customer organization shows that respondents’ personal traits explain up to 31% of the variation in their experience of aspects of the usability of a recently introduced system. Thus, unless participating users are representative as to these personal traits, IT projects may, inadvertently, bring about systems that will fail to satisfy many users.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Rasmus","Christensen, Anders S.","Fjeldsted, Tobias","Hertzum, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-570845"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["User participation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"selecting users for participation in it projects trading a representative sample for advocates and champions","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-570845","identifier":[{"id":"79953054190","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-dcb46a3d-8802-44d1-806d-bd0801e5a807"],"keyword":["User selection","system champions","user advocates","user participation","user representatives"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EDF62C977A2A1870541E9FC4C71C4B0F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"78b3429e-cf25-44f6-b44e-ae6c9b104e19","name":"Rasmussen, Rasmus","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders S.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Anders S.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tobias","key":"fjeldstedpau","last":"Fjeldsted","name":"Fjeldsted, Tobias","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"hertzumpau","last":"Hertzum","locid":"cd5a2f82-1658-4e03-8e6b-63bc1215e394","name":"Hertzum, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-0019-8531","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.intcom.2011.02.006","issn":["09535438"],"issue":"2","journal":"Interacting with Computers","pages":"176-187","status":"p","title":"Interacting with Computers","volume":"23"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79953054190"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-dcb46a3d-8802-44d1-806d-bd0801e5a807"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Selecting users for participation in IT projects : trading a representative sample for advocates and champions?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-570845